We're looking for a Security Engineer that will have the opportunity to be at the forefront of shaping a secure digital landscape for a leading tech company while directly influencing policy\-making and cybersecurity strategy. This role offers a high\-impact, mission\-critical nature of work that allows you to stay ahead of emerging threats, making it both rewarding and challenging as you navigate the demanding landscape of continuous monitoring and proactive threat mitigation.  

