* Conduct access reviews for users, customers, and vendors to maintain security compliance and minimize risks.
* Implement and manage Identity \& Access Management (IAM) solutions across the organization, ensuring secure and efficient access to systems and applications.
* Experience in administer Privileged Identity Management (PIM) and Privileged Access Management (PAM) tools to secure sensitive access.
