* Tech\-savvy with a passion for staying updated on the latest IAM trends and technologies.
* Excellent communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively across teams.
* Certifications such as Azure certifications SC\-300, AZ\-500, AZ\-900 are must \& Certified Identity and Access Manager (CIAM) CEH, CompTIA Sec\+ are a plus.
* Effective communication skills and ability to collaborate with diverse teams.
