### **Job Description**


**About Globals:**  

Globals has drastically grown from a small home office to a globally recognized enterprise offering world\-class quality solutions on Cybersecurity, Cyberwarfare, ERP Systems, AI, and Enterprise Application Development for various industries including Defence, Education, Government, Financial Services and Transport Industries. Globals has enabled its customers to be game\-changers in their industry through its disruptive and innovative solutions.  

  

  

Globals is certified as a ""**Great Place to Work**"" organization for its laudable work culture that helps its team members manage work\-life, have dedicated hours to upskill and reskill themselves, and most important to ensure that the projects that they are working on are always unique, challenging their status quo every time. Our unique work culture has made us one of the world’s fastest\-growing technology companies as recognized and featured by **The Economist**.  

  

  

Our excellence in technical stewardship and service\-offering expertise has facilitated our clients ranging from individual entrepreneurs to Fortune Global 500 – to explore new business opportunities, reduce their operational costs significantly and boost their revenues. Today, Globals enjoys a strong position in the industry as a high\-performing leader through its technology innovation and remarkable domain expertise. Globals is a **CMMI Level 3** certified company.  

  

**About****the****Role:**  

We are seeking a self\-driven and strategic Enterprise Sales personnel with deep experience in cybersecurity to join our team. In this role, you will drive new business opportunities and strategic growth by selling our advanced cybersecurity solutions to enterprise customers in India, Middle East and Europe. You will be responsible for managing the full sales cycle—from prospecting and building pipeline to negotiating and closing multi\-stakeholder deals. You will be backed by a dedicated pre\-sales engineering team, a marketing team for impactful collaterals, and a skilled technical team to support you throughout the sales cycle. **Responsibilities:**  

* New Customer Acquisition: Identify and pursue opportunities to onboard new Enterprise Clients for Globals’ Cybersecurity Solutions.
* Lead Generation and Conversion: Utilize tools like LinkedIn and Lusha to generate leads, convert them into prospects, and manage the proposal submission process until closure with Enterprise
* Strategic Alliances \& Partnerships: Drive strategic alliances and partnerships by identifying and nurturing key relationships that align with our business objectives. Own end\-to\-end partnership lifecycle—from outreach and negotiation to execution and growth.
* Business Development \& Sales Pitch: Develop strategies to meet sales targets and maintain a healthy sales pipelines with Enterprise. Create compelling sales pitches and competitive intelligence content
* Develop \& Execute Sales Strategy: Design and implement sales initiatives to establish a strong presence in the Indian market.
* Industry Research \& Market Trends: Stay informed on cybersecurity trends, competitor activities, and emerging market opportunities
* Stakeholder Engagement: Engage \& establish long\-term relationships with CISOs, CTOs, CIOs, and key decision\-makers to promote cybersecurity solutions
* Online Demonstrations: Conduct effective online demos to showcase our offerings to prospects.
* Revenue Target Achievement: Consistently meet or exceed revenue targets aligned with organizational objectives.
* Cross\-selling/Up\-selling: Identify and capitalize on cross\-selling and up\-selling opportunities with existing customers.
* Customer Relationship Management: Foster strong relationships with clients and provide ongoing support to ensure their satisfaction
* Product Portfolio Improvement: Gather customer insights and feedback to contribute to the enhancement of our product portfolio.
* Pre\-sales to Post\-sales Support: Manage activities from pre\-sales to post\-sales support, ensuring the highest level of customer satisfaction.

### **Requirements**

  

* Minimum 5\+ years of sales experience in Enterprise Sales with experience in Cybersecurity Industry
* Strong knowledge of IT Services and Cybersecurity Solutions such as VAPT Services and Products, Virtual CISO Services, Mobile Security, Cloud Security, EDR, SOC, SIEM, SOAR, Digital Forensics, VDR, etc.
* Should be Technology Savvy \- Stay updated on new technology trends in cybersecurity
* Proven track record in developing new business and managing B2B sales cycles, from lead generation to closing contracts
* Possess excellent knowledge and understanding of cybersecurity concepts.
* Experience in Cybersecurity Solution selling.
* Should have hands on experience in Proposal Writing, Presentation on Solutions.
* Ability to demo products, working independently and create new proposals and generate ROI presentations.
* Strong communication, negotiation, presentation and interpersonal skills are mandatory.
* Master’s Degree in Business Management or equivalent along with Computer Science Engineering / Diploma is good to have.

  


