7\. Security Infrastructure Inventory Maintenance – Maintain inventory for in\-scope security infrastructure, ensuring all security assets are properly logged and tracked.  

8\. Security Infrastructure Monitoring – Monitor in\-scope security infrastructure and respond to operational alerts from the monitoring system, proactively identifying potential security issues.

  

