**What you\`ll do**

  

We are seeking an Audit and Compliance Specialist to uphold the integrity of our certification processes for SAP’s external accreditations, including SOC, NIST, PCI, C5, and ISO frameworks. This pivotal role involves a blend of technology and strategy, requiring hands\-on engagement with auditing tools and methodologies to ensure compliance and remediation measures are top\-notch.


