The SOC Manager is responsible for leading the SOC team in monitoring, detecting, and responding to security incidents. This role involves managing the day\-to\-day operations of the SOC, ensuring compliance with security policies, and providing strategic direction to enhance the security posture of the MSSP and its clients.**What you'll be doing**

