gd-1009699278800,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009699278800,,Deputy Manager | DTG-Incident Response & Handling | Bengaluru | Cyber Defense & Resilience,Deloitte,Bengaluru,2025-04-05,,,,,False,"Job requisition ID :: 76430
