gd-1009693451373,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009693451373,,Network Security Consultant,Codegate Technologies,Bengaluru,2025-04-01,,150000.0,200000.0,INR,False,"**Job description**

**Job Location:** Maputo, Mozambique(Onsite)

**About the Role:**

We are seeking a highly skilled Senior Technology Consultant to join our team, specializing in network and network security solutions. This role will be pivotal in guiding both internal teams and customers with expert knowledge in designing, implementing, and troubleshooting secure network infrastructures. As a Senior Technology Consultant, you will play an essential role in ensuring the security and optimization of network systems while collaborating closely with sales teams to deliver tailored solutions.

**Responsibilities:**

* Act as the primary technical resource for network and network security solutions, providing expert guidance to both internal teams and customers.
* Collaborate with sales teams to understand customer requirements, recommend suitable solutions, and support the sales process from a technical perspective.
* Design and architect secure, scalable network solutions that adhere to industry best practices and security standards.
* Plan and execute successful deployments of network and security products, such as firewalls, secure access solutions, endpoint protection, and security management systems.
* Provide advanced troubleshooting and technical support for network and security issues, remotely and on\-site when required.
* Conduct knowledge transfer sessions and training programs to ensure effective usage of security solutions by customers and internal teams.
* Stay up to date on emerging cybersecurity threats, industry trends, and advancements in network security technologies to proactively advise customers.
* Develop and maintain technical documentation, including solution architectures, configuration guides, and troubleshooting procedures.
* Assist in conducting proof\-of\-concept demonstrations and technical presentations for potential clients.
* Collaborate with technical support teams to escalate and resolve complex issues, ensuring timely resolution and customer satisfaction.
* Serve as a trusted advisor to customers, providing strategic recommendations to optimize and secure their network infrastructures.

**Qualifications:**

* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.
* Relevant certifications such as VMware Certified, Cisco CCIE/CCNP, Check Point CCSA/CCSE/CCMSE, Fortinet NSE 7\+, or equivalent are highly desirable.
* Minimum of 8 years of experience in system administration (Compute, Storage, Backup), firewall administration, network security, and network infrastructure management.
* Strong understanding of TCP/IP, Layer 2 switching protocols, and in\-depth knowledge of routing protocols (BGP, OSPF, etc.).
* Expertise in wireless networks, IPsec VPNs, and secure remote access solutions.
* Familiarity with cloud environments such as AWS and Azure and their respective network security models.
* Hands\-on experience with Fortinet security solutions, including FortiGate, FortiAnalyzer, FortiManager, FortiClient, and FortiSIEM.
* Proven ability to design, implement, and support complex network security solutions with multi\-vendor technologies.
* In\-depth knowledge of firewall technologies, VPNs, intrusion prevention systems (IPS), and security frameworks (e.g., NIST, ISO 27001, PCI DSS).
* Excellent problem\-solving and troubleshooting skills with the ability to analyze and resolve complex security issues.
* Strong communication and presentation skills, capable of explaining technical concepts to both technical and non\-technical stakeholders.
* Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast\-paced environment while managing multiple projects and priorities.
* A customer\-focused mindset with a commitment to delivering high\-quality service and building long\-term relationships.
* Willingness to travel occasionally for customer meetings, on\-site deployments, and training sessions.

**Why Join Us?**

* Be part of an innovative and growing company.
* Work with cutting\-edge technology in network security.
* Enjoy a collaborative work environment with career growth opportunities.
* Competitive compensation and benefits package.

