Assess security and verify the level of integration of the solution in BNPP environment
Coordinate and support stakeholders to test the solution (carrying out POCs – Proof of Concept)
Support the industrialization of the solution within the bank

Watch innovative technologies and solutions


Analyze and study emerging and prospective cyber security threat and vulnerabilities to anticipate security issues
Carry out studies, formalize and release position paper on innovative Cyber themes and relevant market solutions
Organize events around innovation to encourage meetup / collaboration

Communication and Reporting


Report to the top management on the innovation projects
Communicate and share different achievements at different hierarchical levels
Contribute and participate in the Bank’s security \& innovation communities (AI, Quantum, Innovation etc.)
