**About the Role:**
We are seeking a Senior Director Engineering of Security platform to lead development teams based in India, focused on delivering scalable, secure, and high\-performance capabilities that support Splunk’s security product portfolio. The role requires deep experience in building cloud\-native platforms, along with a strong understanding of enterprise software that must operate reliably in customer\-managed, on\-premises deployments.

