Prophaze is a global leader in cloud\-native security solutions, recognized for pioneering Kubernetes\-driven SD\-WAF technology. Featured in the KuppingerCole Analyst Report (2022\) as a Global WAF Innovation Leader, Prophaze is dedicated to securing applications and providing data security. We are a proud corporate partner of the OWASP Community and have been awarded as the Most Innovative Product of the Year by the Data Security Council of India in 2022\.

