We are seeking a highly skilled Cyber Security Specialist with 5 to 8 years of experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will have expertise in Palo Alto Next Gen Firewalls and will work in a hybrid model with rotational shifts. This role does not require travel. The candidate will play a crucial role in safeguarding our companys digital assets and ensuring the security of our network infrastructure.

 **Responsibilities**

* Implement and manage Palo Alto Next Gen Firewalls to protect the companys network from cyber threats.
* Monitor network traffic and analyze security events to identify potential vulnerabilities and threats.
* Develop and enforce security policies and procedures to ensure compliance with industry standards and regulations.
* Conduct regular security assessments and audits to identify and mitigate risks.
* Respond to security incidents and provide timely resolution to minimize impact on business operations.
* Collaborate with IT and other departments to design and implement security solutions that align with business objectives.
* Provide guidance and support to team members on security best practices and emerging threats.
* Stay updated on the latest cyber security trends technologies and threat intelligence to enhance the companys security posture.
* Perform vulnerability assessments and penetration testing to identify and address security weaknesses.
* Develop and deliver security awareness training programs to educate employees on security risks and best practices.
* Maintain and update security documentation including incident reports risk assessments and security policies.
* Participate in the development and implementation of disaster recovery and business continuity plans.
* Ensure the security of cloud\-based systems and applications by implementing appropriate security controls.

 **Qualifications**

* Possess a strong understanding of Palo Alto Next Gen Firewalls and their configuration.
* Have experience in conducting security assessments and audits.
* Demonstrate knowledge of network security principles and practices.
* Show proficiency in analyzing and responding to security incidents.
* Exhibit excellent problem\-solving and analytical skills.
* Have strong communication and collaboration abilities.
* Stay current with the latest cyber security trends and technologies.
* Hold relevant certifications such as CISSP CISM or CEH.
* Be able to work effectively in a hybrid work model with rotational shifts.
* Display a proactive approach to identifying and mitigating security risks.
* Have experience in developing and delivering security awareness training.
* Show ability to work independently and as part of a team.
* Demonstrate commitment to continuous learning and professional development.

 **Certifications Required**


