The Cyber Security Specialist focusses upon the provision of cyber security activities, aligning global cyber security risk reduction with local market business and technology priorities and to the global cyber security strategy to be implemented in the local market/s.The Cyber Security Specialist has a good understanding of established concepts and procedures in protecting Vodafone from security threats, reducing risk across Vodafone�s technology infrastructure and implementing security controls across Vodafone with a single design.Typically reports to the Cyber Security Manager.**Who you are**
