The RSM, reporting to the AVP of India Sales, will be responsible for remotely managing a, team of sales professionals selling Thales CSP solutions and services in the India. Through strategy and execution, the RSM will apply a broad knowledge of the organization's services, products, and sales strategies to lead this sales group in developing account opportunities and closing sales. This highly visible and impactful role will work in tandem with a cross functional Field Sales leadership team and Channel Partners to successfully develop and service all customers or prospects within their respective region.

