 **Cybersecurity Data Protection and Privacy – Senior**

**Job Description: Senior**

**Key Responsibilities:**

 **Required:**

* Work Experience: 4 to 8 years
* Thorough detailed understanding of various Data privacy regulations and privacy concepts (for e.g. GDPR, CCPA/CPRA etc.)
* Experience in performing PIA, DPIA and Data mapping etc. At least 2\-3 years of experience in Privacy domain
