* Functional and non\-functional privacy requirements definition and documentation experience
* Worked on tools like Onetrust, Trustarc, Servicenow
* Experience in working with MENA clients
* Willingness to travel to MENA region on need basis for project delivery

 **Ideally, you’ll also have**

* Consulting mindset
* Travel on short notice to Middle East

