As an IAM Specialist at Tata Digital Pvt Ltd., you will play a crucial role in ensuring the security and efficiency of our identity and access management systems. You will be responsible for designing, support implementing, and maintaining IAM solutions that safeguard our organization's sensitive information and resources. The ideal candidate will have 3 to 5 years of hands\-on experience in managing user, customer, and vendor access, with proficiency in IAM governance, implementation of IAM tools (such as CyberArk, Arcos), and a strong background in Azure IAM/CIEM\- Microsoft Entra.  


