* Conduct training sessions and create documentation for end\-users on IAM best practices and procedures.
* Monitor IAM systems for suspicious activities and respond promptly to security incidents.
* Provide technical support and troubleshooting for IAM\-related issues.
* Stay current with industry trends and best practices in IAM and cybersecurity.

**Requirements:**
