* 3 to 5 years of experience in Identity \& Access Management (IAM) roles, with a focus on user access review, governance, and implementation
* Hands\-on experience with IAM tools such as Active Directory, Azure AD, Azure IAM, Microsoft Entra, Okta, or similar platforms.
* Strong understanding of authentication protocols, LDAP, SAML, OAuth, etc.
* Experience with identity governance and administration (IGA) tools and concepts.
* Hands\-on experience with IAM tools such as and Azure IAM, CyberArk, Arcos.
* Strong understanding of permission management, RBAC, and PIM/PAM concepts.
* Tech\-savvy with a passion for staying updated on the latest IAM trends and technologies.
* Excellent communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively across teams.
* Certifications such as Azure certifications SC\-300, AZ\-500, AZ\-900 are must \& Certified Identity and Access Manager (CIAM) CEH, CompTIA Sec\+ are a plus.
* Effective communication skills and ability to collaborate with diverse teams.
* Knowledge of cybersecurity principles and best practices.
* Excellent analytical and problem\-solving skills.",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Tata-Digital,Cyber Security
