RESPONSIBILTIES
  
Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to define and address business challenges using AI and machine learning.
  
Design, develop, and deploy robust AI models and algorithms for real\-world applications.
  
Engineer and maintain efficient data pipelines for processing diverse data sources, including structured and unstructured data.
  
Perform comprehensive data extraction, cleaning, and analysis to uncover actionable insights and patterns.
  
Develop interactive dashboards and visualizations to communicate AI\-driven findings to stakeholders. \> \[Desirable; not mandatory]
  
Optimize and improve AI models and data processing techniques for enhanced performance and scalability.
  
Leverage Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques for text\-based data analysis.
  
Work with cloud\-based services (preferably Azure Cloud) to manage and process data.
  
Implement best practices for data governance, security, and version control (Git).
  
Stay updated with emerging technologies and frameworks in AI, including Large Language Models (LLMs) and multimodal AI.
  
  

