gd-1009706417969,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009706417969,,Associate Software Engineer,SERENUS TECHNOLOGIES SOLUTIONS PVT LTD,Bengaluru,2025-04-11,,330000.0,600000.0,INR,False,"**Job Description**

As an **Associate Software Engineer**, you will be a key member of our dynamic software development team, working under the guidance of experienced engineers and contributing to the design, development, testing, and maintenance of software applications. This entry\-level position offers an excellent opportunity for recent graduates or junior developers to gain hands\-on experience and grow their skills in a collaborative environment.

**Key Responsibilities**

* **Software Development:**
* Participate in the full software development lifecycle, including requirements analysis, design, coding, testing, and deployment.
* Write clean, scalable, and efficient code following best practices and coding standards.
* Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to understand project requirements and contribute to software design and architecture.
* **Testing and Debugging:**
* Assist in the development and execution of unit tests, integration tests, and system tests to ensure software quality.
* Identify and troubleshoot software defects, performance issues, and bugs, and implement appropriate fixes.
* Participate in code reviews to provide feedback and ensure code quality and adherence to project standards.
* **Documentation:**
* Create and maintain detailed documentation for software applications, including user manuals, technical specifications, and release notes.
* Contribute to the documentation of development processes, methodologies, and best practices.
* **Continuous Learning:**
* Stay up\-to\-date with emerging technologies, industry trends, and best practices in software development.
* Participate in training sessions, workshops, and seminars to enhance technical skills and knowledge.
* Actively seek opportunities for professional development and contribute to team knowledge sharing.
* **Support and Maintenance:**
* Assist in the maintenance and support of existing software applications, including bug fixes, performance enhancements, and feature updates.
* Respond to user inquiries and support requests, providing timely and effective solutions.
* Collaborate with the support team to resolve technical issues and improve application stability.

**Qualifications**

* **Educational Background:**
* Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Technology or any Bachelor's degree is eligible to apply.
* **Technical Skills:**
* Proficiency in one or more programming languages such as Java, C\#, Python, JavaScript, or C\+\+.
* Familiarity with software development tools and environments, including version control systems (e.g., Git), IDEs (e.g., Visual Studio, Eclipse), and build tools (e.g., Maven, Gradle).
* Basic understanding of web development technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, Node.js) is a plus.
* Knowledge of database management systems (e.g., SQL, MySQL, MongoDB) and experience with data querying and manipulation.
* **Soft Skills:**
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills with attention to detail.
* Excellent communication and interpersonal skills to collaborate effectively with team members and stakeholders.
* Ability to work independently and as part of a team in a fast\-paced, dynamic environment.
* Willingness to learn new technologies and adapt to changing project requirements.

**Benefits**

* **Competitive Salary:** 3,30,000 to 6,00,000 .
* **Health Benefits:** Comprehensive medical, and vision insurance.
* **Retirement Plans:** 401(k) plan with company matching.
* **Paid Time Off:** Generous vacation, sick leave, and holidays.
* **Professional Development:** Opportunities for training, workshops, and certifications.
* **Flexible Work Environment:** Options for remote work and flexible scheduling.
* **Employee Assistance Program:** Access to mental health and wellness resources.

**About Us**

**SERENUS TECHNOLOGIES** is a leading technology company committed to delivering innovative solutions that empower businesses and individuals. Our team is dedicated to fostering a collaborative and inclusive work environment where creativity and innovation thrive. We value diversity, integrity, and continuous learning, and we are passionate about building software that makes a difference.

**Application Process**

Interested candidates are invited to submit their resume to **hr@serenustech.in** Please include ""Associate Software Engineer Application"" in the subject line. Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis, and shortlisted candidates will be contacted for an interview.

