This person would be joining a Platform \& Framework Services team to assist in building out new functionality and automation for the Change Data Capture (CDC) product. Our team owns and manages a platform that handles hundreds of data replication pipelines at scale which help liberate data from legacy mainframe systems to more easily consumed streaming platforms across the organization.

  



Our team operates in an Agile environment, serving our platform customers while maintaining steady progress on improvements and automation across our platform. Our technology stack also includes many bleeding edge DevOps technologies and so our team has built up a strong culture of mentorship for TDPs rotating in to learn the relevant skills.

  



Our upcoming priorities relevant to your rotation are as follows:


* Cloud platform offering: we are in the process of architecting a cloud offering of our platform, enabling CDC functionality in the cloud for our customers. This effort would include the development of agent\-based automation written in Go and creation of automated pipelines for scaling of our platform in the cloud
* HCP Console integration: We are enabling production self\-service interaction using HCP Console, the standard portal for interactions with infrastructure and platforms at Optum. We will leverage the previously discussed agent automation to allow our team and our customers to interact with our platform through a UI console and perform a migration to Console for our production resources


**Primary Responsibility:**


* Comply with the terms and conditions of the employment contract, company policies and procedures, and any and all directives (such as, but not limited to, transfer and/or re\-assignment to different work locations, change in teams and/or work shifts, policies in regards to flexibility of work benefits and/or work environment, alternative work arrangements, and other decisions that may arise due to the changing business environment). The Company may adopt, vary or rescind these policies and directives in its absolute discretion and without any limitation (implied or otherwise) on its ability to do so

**Required Qualifications:**


* Undergraduate degree or equivalent experience
* Knowledge of the following primary tech stack:  

	+ Qlik Replicate (Vendor CDC tool)
	+ Debezium (open source CDC tool)
	+ Kubernetes
	+ Python
	+ Go
	+ Ansible
	+ Elasticsearch
	+ Jenkins
	+ GitHub Actions
  


*At UnitedHealth Group, our mission is to help people live healthier lives and make the health system work better for everyone. We believe everyone–of every race, gender, sexuality, age, location and income–deserves the opportunity to live their healthiest life. Today, however, there are still far too many barriers to good health which are disproportionately experienced by people of color, historically marginalized groups and those with lower incomes. We are committed to mitigating our impact on the environment and enabling and delivering equitable care that addresses health disparities and improves health outcomes \- an enterprise priority reflected in our mission.*",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE2409113.htm,Software Engineering
