gd-1009703720813,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009703720813,,Web Developer Intern,Traction Shastra,,2025-04-10,,,,,True,"**Job Title:** Website Developer Intern

**Location: WFH**

**Company:** Traction Shastra

**About Us:**

Traction Shastra is a dynamic and innovative creative agency dedicated to creating exceptional digital experiences for my clients. I take pride in my commitment to staying at the forefront of web development trends and delivering cutting\-edge websites and e\-commerce solutions. If you're a talented and creative Website Developer looking for a challenging and rewarding opportunity, I invite you to join my team.

**Job Description:**

I am seeking a highly skilled Website Developer to join my team and contribute to our web development projects. As a Website Developer at Traction Shastra, you will have the opportunity to create stunning and functional websites, e\-commerce platforms, and other web\-based applications that meet our clients' needs. This position offers flexible working hours and is a work\-from\-home opportunity.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Develop creative and visually appealing websites that align with our clients' brand and objectives.
* Build responsive e\-commerce websites that provide an exceptional online shopping experience.
* Utilize API knowledge to integrate third\-party services and data sources into our web applications.
* Collaborate with designers, project managers, and other team members to deliver high\-quality web solutions on time and within budget.
* Maintain and update existing websites to ensure optimal performance and functionality.
* Stay up\-to\-date with industry trends, technologies, and best practices to continuously improve our web development processes.
