**Position–** Software Development Engineer in Test\-1**Job Role–** QA Engineering**Department\-** Engineering**Location–** Gurgaon**About Tata 1mg**
Tata 1mg is India’s leading consumer health platform. It aspires to be the trusted health partner for all Indians and its mission is to make healthcare accessible, understandable, and affordable. Leading the chart as one of the top consumer health platforms through e\-pharmacy, e\-diagnostics, e\-consulting and offline stores, it is also one of the most preferred pharmacy and diagnostic partners for the leading hospitals in India. It enables consumers to learn more about their medicines and find more cost\-effective substitutes. Tata 1mg is an initiative taken in the spirit of public service with a vision to empower Indian consumers and caregivers to select the most appropriate healthcare service at the best possible prices. **Know more about us**:https://www.1mg.com/aboutUs **Brief about the Team :**
The SDET team at Tata 1mg is a dedicated group of professionals who are passionate about delivering high\-quality software solutions. Our team embodies a collaborative and innovative spirit, constantly striving for excellence in software testing and automation. We work closely with cross\-functional teams, including developers,devops, product managers to ensure the successful delivery of robust and reliable software products**What will you do :*** Own the entire life cycle of user stories: development, test, production, and subsequent fixes and improvements with the guidance of leads.
* Improve the test automation experience at Tata 1mg by enhancing tools/scripts, test coverage, and/or code structure, and Automate repeated manual tasks to improve self/stream’s productivity
* Build, contribute, and maintain automated test suites and frameworks on API, Web, and Mobile App utilizing Java/JavaScript or similar languages.
* Solve complex problems and challenges towards business, product, and tech into stable/scalable implementations.
* Ability to break down business and product feature requirements into tests effectively. Responsible for its functional and automation testing.
* Build and contribute to test infrastructure and tools at an early stage.
* Deep expertise in Functional, Automation testing for Web, API, and Mobile apps both Android and iOS.
* Work with Business, Product, and Dev teams in close coordination.
* Well\-versed with Agile methodology, SDLC, and STLC.
* Ability to highlight limitations and raise concerns/risks in testing to the stakeholders before release

 **What we are looking for:*** 1\-3 years of experience in API using Rest Assured Framework Or Mobile App using Appium (Android \& iOS) Or Web Automation using Selenium, Night watch, Cypress, or similar frameworks.
* Ability to work and communicate with cross\-functional teams.
* Bachelor's degree in Computer Science / IT / Computer Applications.

 **Why Join Us?**
Tata 1mg provides one of the most exciting and high\-growth environments to work in. You get the added benefit of working in a prestigious legacy brand like Tata and a highly dynamic and versatile startup like 1mg. The leadership of Tata 1mg is determined to make it one of the best places to work. **Disclaimer:** Tata 1mg is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All employment decisions at Tata 1mg shall be made without discrimination, harassment or less favorable treatment of any employee or job applicant, either directly or indirectly, on the grounds of age, color, physical ability, ethnic origin, nationality, religion, gender, family status, marital status, prenatal status, gender reassignment, or sexual orientation. All employment decisions are based on business needs, job requirements, competence and merit.",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE1202639.htm,Software Engineering
