* 3\+ years of relevant work experience, including large systems software development experience or client application development.
* 2\+ years of work experience on front\-end frameworks like AngularJS, VueJS etc.
* Experience programming in Java 8 or later and Oracle/MySQL.
* Experience in REST based Microservices.
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving.
* Sound Knowledge of SQL, relational databases, and other data storage.
* Experience working in Unix/Linux.
* Fluency in English.

### **Preferred qualifications**


* MCA/ME in Computer Science or equivalent work experience.
* 3\+ years of relevant work experience programming Web and/or Non\-Web Java Applications, Oracle/MySQL databases.
* 2\+ years of hands\-on work experience in front\-end frameworks like AngularJS, VueJs etc.
* Proficient in 1 or more scripting languages like Unix.
* Spring framework in general (Spring MVC).
* 1\+ years of work experience in the Financial Services space (Brokerage / Capital markets / Investment Banking /Financial services).
* A strong foundation in computer science, with strong competencies in data structures, algorithms, and software design.
* Ability to perform under pressure in time\-critical situations using sound judgment and
* Ability to integrate into and work well within a global.
* Very close to technology and looking at a technology centric.

**Company Benefits \& Perks:**
------------------------------


* Competitive salary.
* Performance based annual bonus (*cash and stocks*).
* Hybrid working model (*3 days office/week*).
* Group Medical \& Life.
* Modern offices with free amenities \& fully stocked
* Monthly food card \& company paid
* Hardship/shift allowance with company provided pickup \& drop facility\*
* Attractive employee referral
* Frequent company sponsored team building events and outings.


* *Depending upon the shifts.*



