gd-1009702824743,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009702824743,,Advisory Software Quality Assurance Engineer,Pitney Bowes,Noida,2025-04-09,,,,,False,"At Pitney Bowes, we do the right thing, the right way. As a member of our team, you can too.
  
  

We have amazing people who are the driving force, the inspiration and foundation of our company. Our thriving culture can be broken down into four components: Client. Team. Win. Innovate.
  
  

**We actively look for prospects who:**  

* Are passionate about client success.
* Enjoy collaborating with others.
* Strive to exceed expectations.
* Move boldly in the quest for superior and best in market solutions.


**Job Description:**  

Join Pitney Bowes as Advisory Automation Quality Assurance Engineer
  
**Years of Experience:** 6\-8 years
  
Job Location\- Noida
  
  

Impact
  
  

As Advisory Quality Assurance Engineer, you will be part of the team that designs and develops cloud\-based offerings. You will be deeply involved in leading the validation of the SaaS based offering including collaborating across the organization with Architects, UX experts, product managers and other software developers. You will use your expertise in building automation test framework to do sanity of the product. You are expected to be hands on and up to date with the latest technology stack. If this type of position motivates you, tell us why you are the right person for this challenging role!
  
  

The Job
  
  

Design, create and maintain automated test cases and determine priority for the test cases and create execution plans to implement these scenarios.
  
  

Maintain automated regression suites/packages to be compliant with changing requirements and features.
  
  

The candidate should be able to work independently to identify test cases/test scripts from requirements and map test cases/scripts back to the original requirement
  
  

Understand business objectives and build alignment and buy\-in cross\-functionally.
  
Analyze functional and technical requirements and translate them into manual and/or automatable scenarios.
  
  

Participate in Agile working practices such as daily scrum meetings, sprint planning meetings, reviews, and retrospectives.
  
  

Mentor \& guide the junior developers in the team
  
  

Qualifications \& Skills required
  
Must Have
  
  

Around 6\+ years overall Software QA experience
  
  

Minimum 4\+ years of experience with test automation
  
  

Experience in developing and implementing automated test cases for web applications
  
  

Exceptional ability to develop maintainable test automation solutions using Cypress
  
  

Experience with Selenium
  
  

Experience working with relational/NoSQL databases like MongoDB
  
  

Experience with performance testing tools like JMeter
  
  

Understanding of RESTful APIs and experience in testing APIs using tools like Postman
  
  

Experience in integrating automation tests into CI/CD pipelines
  
  

Good to Have
  
  

Proficient understanding of Gitlab, CI/CD, DevOps practices
  
  

Knowledge in network architecture \& server administration
  
  

Having the knowledge of front\-end technologies like Angular 16\+ and NodeJS is a plus.
  
  

Great attention to details and Organizational skills
  
  

Education
  
  

Degree in Computer Science, Statistics, or relevant field
  
  

The Team
  
Pitney Bowes, a global technology company, provides shipping \& mailing solutions, data management software, and location intelligence offerings, powering billions of physical and digital transactions in the connected and borderless world of commerce.
  
Helping clients achieve their greatest commerce potential are Pitney Bowes' 16,000\+ passionate employees around the world, our relentless pursuit of innovation with over 2,300 active patents, and our focus on clients, who are at the center of all that we do \- from small businesses to 90% of the Fortune 500\.
  
  

Know more about us\-
  
  

Who we are\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=DDHx\_0OV6D4\&list\=PL06B89F1DD8A5475A
  
  

Digital Commerce\- https://youtu.be/T\_dTWGQH7Cs
  
  

Location Intelligence Domain\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=XouclG\_puWs
  
  

Pitney Bowes, Great Place to Work\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=\-fhcBkm2S9A
  
  

Life at Pitney Bowes\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=b6sqC1w\_cGk
  
  

Pitney Bowes Diversity\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=osYLqcU2JsQ
  
  

Pitney Bowes Leadership\- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\=H2cuGAjpDAI
  
  

