* Collaborate with the team to understand system requirements and implement features.
* Participate in code reviews, debugging sessions, and performance optimizations.
* Test and validate firmware to ensure it meets functional and performance requirements.


Qualifications:* Bachelors degree with 2 years of experience / Masters Degree, in ECE/EEE/CSE or a related field.
