* Understanding of embedded systems concepts and microcontroller architecture.
* Understanding of Real Time Operating Systems (RTOS) and Wireless Networks
* Knowledge of debugging tools such as oscilloscopes, logic analyzers, or emulators is a plus.
* Strong problem\-solving skills and attention to detail.

