* Monitor performance benchmarks, analyse test outcomes, and work with development teams to resolve issues.
* Conduct risk analysis, uphold QA standards, and provide regular updates on QA progress.
* Address and resolve client queries related to product quality.
* Generate Root Cause Analysis (RCA) reports and propose preventive measures to avoid recurring issues.

