* Demonstrate a flexible and adaptive approach to accommodate changing requirements.


Qualifications \& Experience* Degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, related field, or equivalent work experience
* 2\-3 years of ServiceNow experience
* Experience with ServiceNow modules (ITSM, ITAM, ITOM, IRM (GRC/TPRM), HRSD)
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills to troubleshoot and resolve technical issues
* Excellent communication and collaboration abilities to work effectively with cross\-functional teams
* Ability to work independently, manage multiple priorities, and meet deadlines in a fast\-paced environment
* Makes decisions while understanding the team's work and how it fits into the broader enterprise
