Aviato Consulting is looking for a talented Backend Software Engineer like you to join our growing team in **Bangalore East (On\-site)**. Forget bureaucracy – we're focused on delivering cutting\-edge solutions for major clients across Europe and Australia. This is your chance to work on challenging, large\-scale projects during **India Standard Time (IST)** hours, collaborating directly with international teams.

**Why Choose Aviato?**

