* Proven experience designing and building **APIs, microservices, or serverless applications**.
* Hands\-on experience with **event\-driven systems (Kafka, Azure Event Hub, MQ, etc.)**.
* Experience with containerization (**Docker**) and orchestration (**Kubernetes**).
* Familiarity with **CI/CD tools and practices**.
* Experience working effectively in an **Agile** environment.
* Experience with **Flink** or similar real\-time data processing tools is a significant plus.

**Our Tech Stack Includes:**

Java \| Reactive Programming \| Microservices \| Serverless \| Kafka \| Azure Event Hub \| Flink \| GCP (inc PubSub) \| Docker \| Kubernetes \| CI/CD (Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Bitbucket Pipelines) \| Dynatrace \| Sentry \| JIRA \| ServiceNow

**Ready to build the future with Aviato?**

