gd-1009700446050,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009700446050,,AI Web Software Developer,Gursimran,,2025-04-07,,5000.0,5000.0,INR,True,"**Job Title: AI Web Software Developer**

we are passionate about leveraging cutting\-edge technologies to create innovative and effective solutions for our clients. We specialize in providing advanced AI\-driven software solutions that streamline business processes and improve user experiences. We are currently looking for a talented and motivated AI Web Software Developer to join our growing team and help us create impactful and scalable AI web applications.

**Position Overview:**  
We are seeking an experienced AI Web Software Developer to build and enhance our AI\-driven web applications. In this role, you will collaborate with a cross\-functional team to design, develop, and maintain AI\-powered software solutions for a variety of use cases. You will be working with state\-of\-the\-art technologies, and your work will directly contribute to the success of our clients and our company.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Develop and deploy AI\-based web applications using machine learning, deep learning, and data science techniques.
* Collaborate with the product team to define and execute features for AI\-driven web solutions.
* Integrate AI algorithms and models into web applications, ensuring high performance and scalability.
* Work with front\-end and back\-end developers to implement AI\-driven features into web platforms.
* Optimize AI models for speed, accuracy, and resource usage in real\-time web environments.
* Perform data analysis and preprocess data for AI model training.
* Collaborate on the design of user interfaces that leverage AI features effectively.
* Stay up\-to\-date with the latest AI technologies, frameworks, and best practices.

**Required Qualifications:**

* Proven experience in developing AI or machine learning applications for web platforms.
* Strong proficiency in programming languages such as Python, JavaScript, and frameworks like TensorFlow, PyTorch, or similar.
* Experience with web development technologies including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, or similar tools.
* Solid understanding of AI and machine learning techniques, data structures, and algorithms.
* Experience working with APIs, cloud services (AWS, GCP, Azure), and containerization (Docker, Kubernetes).
* Knowledge of database management systems and data processing tools (SQL, NoSQL, Hadoop, etc.).
* Excellent problem\-solving skills, ability to troubleshoot and optimize performance issues.
* Strong communication skills and ability to work in a collaborative, agile environment.
* A passion for developing innovative and scalable AI solutions.

**Preferred Qualifications:**

* Experience with computer vision, natural language processing (NLP), or other specialized AI domains.
* Familiarity with server\-side programming and back\-end frameworks (e.g., Flask, Django, Express).
* Knowledge of version control systems (e.g., Git).
* Experience with deploying AI models into production environments.
* Previous experience working on web applications that leverage AI and automation.

**What We Offer**

* Flexible work hours and the option to work remotely.
* Opportunity to work with cutting\-edge AI technologies.
* Collaborative and supportive work environment.
* Career development and learning opportunities.

**How to Apply:**  
If you are passionate about AI and web development and are eager to contribute to exciting projects, we would love to hear from you! Please submit your resume, portfolio (if applicable), and a cover letter explaining your interest in the position to gursimranworkplace@gmail.com.

Job Types: Full\-time, Freelance  
Contract length: 2 months

Pay: ₹5,000\.00 per month

Benefits:

* Flexible schedule
* Work from home

Schedule:

* Monday to Friday

Application Question(s):

* Are you currently employed or engaged in any projects?
* Can you share 1–2 recent web development projects you’ve worked on, including the goals, technologies used, your specific role, and the outcome or impact of the project?

Work Location: Remote",,,Software Engineering
