* Familiarity with Agile methodologies, including Scrum and Kanban.
* Bonus: Experience with Docker, cloud infrastructure (Kubernetes, OKD), and CI/CD pipelines.
* Ability to work independently and collaborate effectively within a remote team.


Why you’ll love us* We’ve evolved; we provide three work environment scenarios. You can feel like a Newfolder in a work\-from\-home, hybrid, or work\-from\-the\-office environment.
