technologies.

* Participate in code reviews, ensuring adherence to best practices and coding standards.
* Create and maintain technical documentation.

Skills \& Qualifications:

* Education: BE/B.Tech in IT / Computer Science / Electronics, MCA, or M.Sc. in IT /

Computer Science from a recognized institution.

* Experience: Minimum of 5 years of experience in J2EE, Advanced Java, Web Services,

and Microservices development.

* Technical Skills:

o Strong experience in Java/J2EE and related frameworks (Spring Boot, Spring

Cloud).

