**Job Type:** Full\-time/Contract

**About the Role:**  
We are seeking a skilled Software Developer to design, develop, and maintain high\-quality software solutions while collaborating with US and UK\-based clients and teams. This role offers the opportunity to work on global projects, adapt to diverse business needs, and align with international standards. You will engage in cross\-cultural teamwork, leveraging remote collaboration tools and occasionally adjusting working hours to overlap with US/UK time zones for meetings and deadlines.

**Key Responsibilities:**

**Software Development:**

* Design, code, test, and deploy scalable applications using languages like Java, Python, JavaScript, or C\#.
* Maintain and enhance existing systems to meet client requirements.

**Cross\-functional Collaboration:**

* Work closely with US/UK teams (product managers, designers, QA engineers) to deliver solutions aligned with global standards.
* Participate in Agile/Scrum ceremonies (stand\-ups, sprint planning) accommodating time zone differences.

**Code Quality \& Compliance:**

* Conduct code reviews and ensure adherence to best practices.
* Implement security protocols and comply with regulations (e.g., GDPR, HIPAA) for US/UK clients.

**Problem Solving:**

* Debug and resolve technical issues promptly to minimize downtime for international clients.

