**Benefits:**

* Competitive salary in USD/GBP or equivalent INR.
* Flexible hours to accommodate global collaboration.
* Professional growth opportunities with international exposure.
* Health insurance and remote work allowances.
* Inclusive, multicultural work environment.

**How to Apply:**  
Submit your resume, cover letter, and portfolio/GitHub profile to info@alfarecruit.com with the subject: *“Application for Software Developer (US/UK Projects) – \[Your Name]”*.

*We are an equal\-opportunity employer and value diversity in global perspectives.*

