* Designing, producing, testing and implementing our working code
* Working across the life cycle, from requirements analysis and design, through coding to testing, deployment and operations

**The skills you'll need**


You’ll need at least eight years of experience in software engineering, software design, architecture, and an understanding of how your area of expertise supports our customers.


You’ll also need:

* Experience of working with Azure deployments and pipelines
* Experience in C\#, Python using associated technologies and coding design patterns like gang of four, solid and clean coding
* Experience of DevOps, Testing and Agile methodology and associated toolsets
* Experience of test driven development and automated test frameworks like Nunit, XUnit and Pytest and mocking and stubbing
* Experience of design and develop high\-volume, high\-performance and high availability applications using frameworks and technologies",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE10222.htm,Software Engineering
