* Maintains responsibility of assigned tasks by using experience/knowledge of environment to make design/development decisions.
* Educates others (technical and non\-technical) on areas of expertise.
* Provides development level support for assigned products and projects throughout the development lifecycle.
* Provides support to existing customer base.
* Works well within an Agile team.
* Other job\-related duties as assigned.


Basic Qualifications* Bachelor’s degree in a related area (Computer Engineering, Computer Science, Computer Information Services, Management Information Services) or equivalent industry experience.
* Must exhibit good judgment in decision making.
* Ability to work independently – willing to ask tough questions and investigate / experiment to find answers.
* 3\+ years of Microsoft Visual Studio experience.
* SQL Server Knowledge; Strong SQL query skills.
* Strong understanding of Database management systems.
* Strong understanding of computer science principles.
* Excellent problem\-solving skills and an analytical mind.
* Experienced w/ Software Engineering best practices (Design Patterns, Coding Style, etc.)
* Able to convey technical concepts with non\-technical audiences.
* Able to troubleshoot complex systems including hardware and software systems.
* Extensible Markup Language (XML).
* C\#, .NET, JavaScript


Preferred Qualifications
Experience:* 6\+ years of software development experience with C\#, .Net
* 4\+ years Windows Client Application development


Preferred Skills:* Excellent understanding of basic software design principles.
* Design and implementation of objects.
