* **Stay Updated on Trends:** Keep up\-to\-date with the latest industry trends, tools, and best practices in front\-end development.

**Requirements:**

* 6 months to 1 year of proven experience in front\-end web development.
* Strong proficiency in HTML, CSS, Bootstrap and JavaScript.
* Experience with responsive design techniques and mobile\-first design.
* Knowledge of web performance optimization techniques.
* Strong attention to detail and passion for creating visually appealing, user\-friendly interfaces.

**Preferred Skills:**

* Experience with JavaScript libraries like jQuery.
* Understanding of UX/UI design principles.

