Pay: ₹8,000\.00 \- ₹12,000\.00 per month

Schedule:

* Monday to Friday

Work Location: In person

Application Deadline: 20/04/2025  
Expected Start Date: 21/04/2025",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Nexxoory-Solutions-Pvt.-Ltd.,Software Engineering
