* Exceptional Communication: Skilled in influencing and collaborating with stakeholders across disciplines and levels and effectively telling the story of design’s success
* User Advocacy: Adept at driving product design and UX decisions that center on user needs.
* Influence and Buy\-In: Proven ability to build trust with others to foster support for new processes and enhance existing workflows and understand team challenges and feedback
* Process\-Oriented: Able to work with ProductOps within the organization on shared operational initiatives
* Data\-driven: Able to identify key metrics, measure and provide evidence of Design and the Design Systems operational success


**Why You’ll Love This Role:**


* A Systems\-Minded Opportunity: Perfect for a leader passionate about improving design quality through scalable systems and processes.
* Dual Focus: A unique chance to work at the intersection of system\-focused product design and operational excellence.
* Innovative Challenges: Be part of a team shaping the DAP category across multiple products, leading cutting\-edge design projects.
* Empowering Teams: Coach and mentor your team to thrive in a fast\-paced, high\-growth environment while driving innovation through human\-centered design.
* Impactful Work: Solve diverse, complex challenges that deliver real value to customers and drive business success.


