----------------------------------------

**Technical Skills:**

* Strong hands\-on experience in Angular frontend development.
* Technical knowledge proven in practice of developing with **Angular 12, Angular material, Jasmine, UX/UI design**
* Good knowledge of **Java 11, Spring Boot 3, SQL language**
* Unit testing, Integration testing, Acceptance testing
* Familiarity with business server Like liberty Base, Oracle database
* Support functionals for end users
* Management of server obsolescence, migration of HTTPS certificates

**Behavior Skills**

* Ability to work independently and to collaborate.
* Ability to report efficiently.
* Good documentation skills
* Rigorous, resilient, serious, and disciplined
* Good Communications and presentation skills
* Excellent analytical and problem\-solving skills
* Previous experience with Finance and Banking would be advantageous to the role.

