* Experience with M\&A, system integration and ERP migrations.
* Familiarity with cloud\-based ERP transformations and SaaS financial platforms.

**What Will You Be Doing in This Role?**

* Develop \& optimize integrations between EPM, Tax, Treasury platforms with enterprise financial systems.
* Design \& implement API\-based financial automation for tax calculations, payment processing, and treasury operations.
