As a Senior Java Developer you are responsible for
  

  

1\. Working in partnership with the project team and business to fully understand project goals and requirements and use this knowledge to effectively plan and execute the development process.  

2\.Create low level design documents (including code samples/outlines) and detailed engineering specifications based on complex business, user and non\-functional (e.g., performance, reliability) requirements.  

3\.Responsible for Writing code, adhering to coding standards, procedures and techniques.  

4\. Responsible for guiding the development team to consistently apply appropriate development principles and standards during all phases of the development life cycle.
Job Description**Key Responsibilities**

* Design \& Build  

Create low level design documents (including code samples/outlines) and detailed engineering specifications based on complex business, user and non\-functional (e.g., performance, reliability) requirements.  

Write code, adhering to coding standards, procedures and techniques.  

Actively participate in the code review process to ensure development work adheres to standards and specifications (including peer review and code review external to team).
* Test \& Execute  

Unit test all code and programs prior to releasing them to quality assurance.  

 Assist quality assurance in identifying test cases and creating/mining test data to enable a thorough test of all development deliverables.  

Respond to all inquiries and issues in a timely manner as developed code/program moves through the testing process and into production.  

Provide implementation/production support as required.  

Improve the health of system assets by identifying enhancements to improve performance, reliability, and resource consumption.
* Planning  

Work in partnership with the project team and business to fully understand project goals and requirements and use this knowledge to effectively plan and execute the development process.
* Process \- Consistently apply appropriate development principles and standards during all phases of the development life cycle.

 **Required Qualifications**

* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field. \-
* 4\-7 years of relevant experience.
* Strong programming \& problem solving , analytical skills .
* 4\+ years of practical experience and proven success with the design and build of Java , Spring , Spring Boot , Docker based Micro services Applications.


Mandatory Skills :

* Expertise in JAVA ,Spring Boot , Spring Framework.
* Strong programming \& problem solving skills.
* Expertise in Micro Services development with security/availability/performance aspects being thorough.
* Sound knowledge on Object oriented programming concepts, Java 8 required.
* Experience in working on Multi threaded Systems.
* Experience in working on Docker Container Technologies. • Experience in DevSecOps tools and best practices ( must have Jenkins Knowledge).
* Exposure to Unit testing framework like Mockito, JUnit.
* Good knowledge on system design and various design patterns.
* Expertise in Unix commands.
* Expertise on GIT and Maven usage. • Ability to work independently with minimal supervision

 **Preferred Qualifications**

* Exposure in any Actor based framework like akka is a plus.
* Exposure to working in a cloud/distributed environment (like AWS , Kubernetes , Apache Mesos) is a plus.
