* Solid understanding of version control systems, particularly Git.
* Strong problem\-solving skills and attention to detail.
* Experience working in agile development environments.
* Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively within cross\-functional teams.
* Understanding of cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure) is a plus.

