* 6 to 9 years of experience building web or mobile applications with at least 4 years of OutSystems specific development experience
* Experience in leading the teams
* Knowledge on process methodologies – Agile/frameworks like CMMI

 **Ideally, you’ll also have**

* Technical delivery skills

 **What we look for**

* A Team of people with commercial acumen, technical experience and enthusiasm to learn new things in this fast\-moving environment
