Role Overview


Enterprise Platform and Tech services that focuses on delivering high\-quality and efficient testing services for various IT projects and systems. The unit follows the best practices and standards of software testing, including test automation, performance testing, functional testing, and user acceptance testing. The unit works closely with the business stakeholders and the IT project teams to ensure the quality and reliability of the IT solutions delivered by BHCoE. We are seeking a highly skilled Automation Tester with specialized expertise in TOSCA and any open source tool to join our dynamic team. As an Automation Tester, you will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, and executing Automation tests suits using TOSCA to ensure the quality, scalability, reliability, and stability of our applications. You will collaborate closely with cross\-functional teams to identify Critical business processes, frequently used in production etc. Based on that, identify ideal candidates for automation.


What you’ll be doing:

* Handle test automation activities, create, design and execute automated test flows and defect management.
* Collaborate with Functional expert teams to understand the testing requirements and design test cases
* Develop and maintain automated test scripts using industry standard tools and technologies
* Execute automated test suites and analyze test results to identify defects and performance issues
* Work closely with QA analyst to prioritize testing efforts and ensure comprehensive coverage
