* Proficiency in DEX and TDM (TDS)
* Self\-motivated, self\-driven, own and consider him/herself accountable for timely completion of QA deliverables
* Excellent verbal and written communication skills along with good interpersonal skills
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills with great attention to details.
