* Strong and applied RDBMS \& NoSQL skills, with a strong preference for Oracle, PostgreSQL / MongoDB/AWS Dynamo DB.
* Experience in applied AWS skills (EC2, S3, RDS, VPC, SNS, Lambda’s), as well as experience with virtualization tools like Docker \- **Good to have.**
