s Driving solutions. \-Strong understanding of sensor technologies (LiDAR, Radar, Camera, Ultrasonic) and their validation methodologies. \- Hands\-on experience with test automation frameworks, HiL, SiL, and DiL environments. \- Expertise in automotive communication protocols (CAN, LIN, Ethernet, AUTOSAR, etc.). \- In\-depth knowledge of ISO 26262, ASPICE, and SOTIF for system safety validation. \- Proficiency in Python, C\+\+, MATLAB, or other scripting languages for test automation. \- Experience in cloud\-based simulation and AI\-driven testing approaches is a plus. \- Strong leadership, problem\-solving, and stakeholder management skills. Preferred Certifications: \- ISTQB Advanced Level – Test Manager or equivalent certification. \- SAFe or Agile Certification is an added advantage. Additional Information: \- The candidate should have a minimum of 15 years of experience in Automotive Mobility Services \& Connected Vehicles. \- This position is based at our Bengaluru office. \- A 15 years full\-time education is required.


  

