ct with Architect \& UX design team to align system requirements \& specifications \- Store and maintain specifications into traceability tools such as Codebeamer, DOORS… \- Bring functional clarity to the cross\-functional teams, such as development, test and integration teams \- Monitor the functional behavior of the developed software, to align with specifications \- Support for the developers, bringing clarify about any critical bugs around the specified functionality Additional Information: \- The candidate should have a minimum of 12 years of experience in Automotive Mobility Services \& Connected Vehicles. \- This position is based at our Bengaluru office. \- A 15 years full time education is required.


  

