in-8e414eb05677dfae,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=8e414eb05677dfae,https://opportunities.vodafone.com/job/Pune-Manager_Lead_Webmethod-Developer%2CUnix_Pune/1169902801/?feedId=301801&utm_source=Indeed&utm_campaign=Vodafone_Indeed,"Manager_Lead_Webmethod Developer,Unix_Pune",Vodafone,"MH, IN",2025-04-11,,,,,True,"**About \_VOIS**
----------------


VOIS (Vodafone Intelligent Solutions) is a strategic arm of Vodafone Group Plc, creating value and enhancing quality and efficiency across 28 countries, and operating from 7 locations: Albania, Egypt, Hungary, India, Romania, Spain and the UK.


Over 29,000 highly skilled individuals are dedicated to being Vodafone Group’s partner of choice for talent, technology, and transformation. We deliver the best services across IT, Business Intelligence Services, Customer Operations, Business Operations, HR, Finance, Supply Chain, HR Operations, and many more.


Established in 2006, \_VOIS has evolved into a global, multi\-functional organisation, a Centre of Excellence for Intelligent Solutions focused on adding value and delivering business outcomes for Vodafone.

**About \_VOIS India**
----------------------


In 2009, \_VO**IS** started operating in India and now has established global delivery centres in Pune, Bangalore and Ahmedabad. With more than 14,500 employees, \_VO**IS** India supports global markets and group functions of Vodafone, and delivers best\-in\-class customer experience through multi\-functional services in the areas of Information Technology, Networks, Business Intelligence and Analytics, Digital Business Solutions (Robotics \& AI), Commercial Operations (Consumer \& Business), Intelligent Operations, Finance Operations, Supply Chain Operations and HR Operations and more.

**Job Description**
-------------------

**Roles and Responsibilities:**

* Service Troubleshooting and Understanding existing codes and flows.  

Developing and deploying enhancements in production environment and lower Environments.  

Involvement in triage of Major Incidents and Escalated cases.
* Post release Service synthetic testing.  

Service Application Debugging.  

Discovering and driving defects till closer.  

Involvement is project planning and Operational readiness.  

Documentation of Standard Operating Procedure and Operation Manual for L1/L2 teams.

**Core competencies, knowledge and experience:**

* A WebMethods Developer resource having experience in development of complex solution over of WebMethods products suite.
* Must have experience in development of service over Public and subscribe framework.
* Development experience required have functionalities/Solution over APIGW, remote invoke, ESB, B2B TN and WebMethods Active transfers.
* Must have experience of development of SOAP, Rest stateful, Stateless services.
* Troubleshooting experiences of Integration Server, Universal messaging server, Enterprise Gateway, API Gateway, IS Clustering.
* Preferred to have experience on Administration, Planning, configuration of WebMethods product suite (APIGW, Broker, Integration Server, Trading Networks, My WebMethods Server, Deployer, Adapters (SAP, JDBC etc), Universal Messaging, API, command central and Terracotta)..
* L3 Experience in Administration and maintenance of Integration solutions.
* Platform: MUST have worked on any of Unix flavored Environment (Linux, Solaris, AIX, HP\-UX etc.).
* Troubleshooting issues related to threads, memory, sessions Analysing thread dumps and finding root causes of server crashes.
* Experience in communication security protocols, TLS, HTTP(s), SFTP, Encryption /Decryption and file / Database polling.
* Experience in Certificate Configurations with ports/services.
* Zest/Experience in both development and Admin will be a plus.
* MUST have worked on WebMethods version (7\.X, 8\.X, 9\.X and 10\.X) components:
* Preferable experience in Telecom domain involves configuring and managing the production application \& production servers, monitoring and scripting for automations.
