* Compute Infrastructure: Deploy and manage virtualized and physical servers using VMware, Hyper\-V, or cloud platforms (OCP, Azure, GCP). Optimize server performance and automate provisioning.
* Storage Infrastructure: Manage enterprise storage solutions (SAN, NAS, object storage) and ensure high availability, performance, and data protection through backup and disaster recovery strategies.
* Cloud \& Hybrid Environments: Implement cloud\-based infrastructure solutions and integrate with on\-premises systems. Optimize cost, security, and performance.
* Automation \& Scripting: Develop infrastructure\-as\-code (IaC) using Terraform, Ansible, PowerShell, or Python to automate deployments and configurations.
* Security \& Compliance: Ensure infrastructure follows security frameworks (NIST, ISO 27001\) and regulatory requirements. Implement monitoring, logging, and threat detection tools.
* Incident Management \& Troubleshooting: Lead root cause analysis for infrastructure incidents and optimize system performance and reliability.

