You are passionate and self\-driven Software Engineer to join our team. As a Software Engineer, you will be responsible for collaborating across teams and oversee Protegrity platform development in accordance to the architecture. Key to success is to collaborate and share design ideas with other architects and senior engineers in the product teams.

This position is perfect for strong technical individuals who enjoy building technology and excited to be part of end\-to\-end product delivery life cycle.

