* In\-depth knowledge of X\+\+ programming
* In\-depth knowledge in developing and updating SSRS reports and Forms
* In\-depth knowledge, of extension methodologies and customizing D365 FO modules
* In\-depth knowledge in the installation and configuration of Finance and Operation modules and add\-ons
* Good understanding of software development life cycle in the D365 environment
* Good communication and interpersonal skills

**Additional Information:**

* Hands\-on expertise in application integration framework (DIXF and DMF)
* Hands\-on expertise in building and deploying D365 packages using Dynamics Retail SDK
* Hands\-on expertise in building and consuming Data Entities (OData)
* Hands\-on expertise in integration projects using Power Apps and Azure Logic Apps
* Hands\-on expertise in integrations/data migrations with legacy and other ERP applications, web services, and extensions
* Understanding of industry best practices on enterprise integration patterns, B2B and B2C patterns
* Possess Dynamics 365 FO Certifications


