in-ad8120c656aed9de,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=ad8120c656aed9de,https://ats.rippling.com/illumina-technology-solutions/jobs/99e998a4-1201-4724-938d-5b881eb87a7b?jobSite=Indeed,Power BI Developer,Illumina Technology Solutions,"TS, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**About Illumina Technology Solutions, LLC**

  

At Illumina Technology Solutions, we are experiencing rapid growth across the U.S.A., Canada, India, and Pakistan and are proud to be a Microsoft Gold Partner. We are committed to providing technology solutions that help organizations thrive in a fast\-changing digital landscape. Our vision is to become a leader in digital transformation for our clients, leveraging the power of the Microsoft digital ecosystem to drive innovation and growth.


Visit us at www.illuminatechnology.com

 **About the role**

  

As a Power BI Developer, you will be responsible for interacting with Microsoft’s Power BI to generate, operate, and maintain BI applications that serve to provide the company with actionable business insights. These solutions allow you to address optimization scenarios in several organizations and our team is committed to showcasing the value of technology! We seek a highly motivated individual who can thrive in a dynamic environment and is adept at meeting deadlines

 **Essential Functions**

* Understand business requirements in the BI context and design data models to convert raw data to meaningful insights
* Create dashboards and visual interactive reports using Power BI
* Identify KPIs with clear objectives and monitor them consistently
* Develop \& Support ETL process to source, aggregate and summarize data for reporting
