Job Summary:

We are seeking a skilled and motivated Node.js Developer to join our backend development team. The ideal candidate should have 3–4 years of hands\-on experience in designing and developing server\-side applications using Node.js, along with a strong understanding of modern backend frameworks, microservices architecture, and cloud technologies. This role requires the ability to write clean, efficient, and scalable code, while collaborating closely with cross\-functional teams to deliver high\-quality solutions.

