**Job Description:**  

Impact
  
  

As a Senior Advisory Software Engineer, your job is to build optimized, scalable, and modular software. You are tasked with developing and coding back\-end components and connecting applications to other web services. You will work with cross\-functional teams to design and develop innovative solutions that meets the needs of our customers. Evaluate and incorporate new technologies into new and existing frameworks and solutions as applicable. Provide guidance to team members on functional \& non\-functional requirements.
  
The Job
  
Design and develop a cloud based scalable, extensible, reliable and maintainable platform on modern cloud stack like AWS
  
Work with cross\-functional teams to design and develop innovative solutions that meets the needs of our customers
  
Coordinating the workflow between the UXdesigner, Engineering, QA, BA, Product Mgt and yourself
  
