You will implement, managing, and supporting the Information Technology (IT) infrastructure. You will develop systems software to analyze data to improve existing ones. You will support the design, deployment, and operations of a large\-scale global hybrid cloud computing environment. The role designs and maintains modern and open toolchains, automation frameworks and test suites, infrastructure tiers, advocating for end\-to\-end automated CI/CD DevOps pipelines. You will work with developers and the IT staff to oversee the code releases by understanding the requirements.
