Bearish OS is hiring a Full\-Stack Developer to help build and scale Bearish OS 3\.0, our next\-generation enterprise productivity platform. This is a high\-impact role for an experienced engineer who writes clean, modular code and understands the demands of secure, performance\-driven systems. No freshers will be considered.

Responsibilities

* Build and maintain full\-stack features using NestJS (TypeScript) and React/Next.js
* Architect and implement backend services using TypeORM and PostgreSQL
* Develop frontend components and interfaces that are fast, accessible, and responsive
* Integrate and manage third\-party APIs and external services at scale
* Write clean, tested, well\-documented code across the stack
* Collaborate with product and design teams to deliver enterprise\-grade functionality
* Participate in code reviews, system architecture discussions, and infrastructure planning
* Maintain high security and performance standards in all areas of development

Requirements

* 3\+ years of full\-stack development experience
* Strong experience with NestJS and TypeScript
* Proficient in React and/or Next.js for frontend development
* Deep knowledge of TypeORM and relational databases (PostgreSQL required)
* Hands\-on experience with integrating and managing third\-party APIs
* Familiarity with authentication systems (JWT, OAuth, SSO)
* Experience with Docker, Git workflows, and CI/CD pipelines
* Strong architectural thinking and ability to work autonomously in a fast\-paced environment
* No freshers or junior developers will be considered

Preferred

* Experience working in monorepos or enterprise\-scale codebases
* Familiarity with secure coding standards and large\-scale deployments
* Background in enterprise SaaS, AI\-enhanced systems, or productivity tools

Location

Remote. Open to candidates worldwide.

About Bearish OS

Bearish OS is building the future of enterprise software. Our platform replaces over 250 fragmented tools with a single secure system that unifies messaging, meetings, calendar, HR, CRM, email, and task management. Built for scale, privacy, and performance, Bearish OS empowers teams to move faster, stay aligned, and save time and money. Join us and help shape the operating system for modern work.

