The responsibilities will include –

* Develop message flows to construct business process services using orchestration of existing services, and ensured  

guaranteed delivery with Re\-try mechanism.
* Routing and Transformation of data using built in IBM ACE message flow nodes such as Compute, Java compute, Mapping, File, Aggregate, MQ, HTTP, SOAP, Collector, Sequence, Timer, Email.
* Integrate source code version control system bitbucket, such that all versions of the Message flow components are stored in a centralized repository.
* Extensively use ESQL, Java and XSLT to handle the message transformations between XML and COBOL.
* Support migration of existing product version to higher version as per need
* Develop and design the Reusable sub flows for Error handling, business Exception handling and Logging
* Use Trace nodes/files, MQ logs, and JMS logs to troubleshoot/debug and fix the issues.
* Execute various Broker Runtime and Toolkit MQSI commands.
* Analyze complex application
* Planning the Production readiness activities and prepare the Go\-Live implementation checklist.

**Additional job\-specific responsibilities needed for this position.**

* Availability – ensure the ability of a technology service or component to perform its required function at a stated instant or over a stated period.
* Availability Management – reporting and analyzing of outages and how they impact production downtime.
* Incident Management – manage the incidents that occur in production environment.
* Performance Management – continually evaluate the processing performance of assigned assets, recommending changes and implementing prioritized opportunities. Perform trend analysis to identify cause of performance and/or usage issues.
* Gap Analysis – identify and understand the difference between the current state and the To\-Be Assessment state
* Problem Management – perform root cause analysis and permanent resolution of system outages and potential causes.
* Change Management – establish a controlled process for implementing changes into production environment
* Capacity Planning \- predict the current/future availability and current/future capacity capabilities of the system with regards to the application capacity requirements and to the hardware on which the application runs
* Continuous Improvement \- Use experience, expertise and data analysis to collaborate with manager and team members in the identification of corrective action to increase efficiency, improve performance and meet or exceed consumption targets.

**Required Skills**

* Excellent Knowledge of IBM App Connect Enterprise/ IBM Integration Bus preferably ACE V12
* Excellent understanding of integration design patterns \& Best Practices.
* Experience in Migrating current version of code to upgraded versions.
* Experience in REST and SOAP services.
* Broad knowledge on web security standards relating to \#OAuth, \#SSL, \#JWT etc
* Design and develop API specifications using OpenAPl
* Specifications/YAML
* Excellent Knowledge on \#IBMMQ ,\#Oracle notification service and Oracle function call in ACE
* Deep knowledge on \#ESQL, \#XSLT, \#DFDL, \#WSDL, \#XML, \#SOAP, \#IMAP. Oracle and \#REST protocols.
* Good in ESQL coding mapping nodes and transformations
* Should be capable of Performance optimization.
* Proficient in \#Corejava, \#MS\-SQL and Oracle \#SQL database with strong SQL querying skills.
* Good understanding of On\-Prem, Cloud and Hybrid integrations

