gd-1009707368471,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009707368471,,Delivery Head - IT Staffing,Awign Enterprises,Bengaluru,2025-04-12,,,,,False,"* Awign is India’s largest work fulfillment platform for enterprises. We work with multiple large enterprises to “gigify” their core business functions and save on fixed costs. We have become the partner of choice for many enterprises to drive business transformation and excellence with our fraud proof, insights driven work fulfilment model.
