* Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills
* Excellent communication and interpersonal skills
* Ability to work independently and in a team environment
* Knowledge of IT systems and processes
* Experience in the engineering industry is a plus

  

Job Summary:


We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled Business Analyst to join our team at Titan. The ideal candidate will be responsible for analyzing business processes and identifying areas for improvement. The Business Analyst will work closely with our IT team to develop and implement solutions that will enhance our automation solutions and drive business growth.

  

