P\&G India's footprint expands to 4500\+ employees across 8 manufacturing sites across the country making quality products and services that improve people’s lives, now and for generations to come.


Would you like to experience this legacy of brands and be a part of the journey in what will be a first\-time corporate experience for most of you?

