* Proficiency in using sourcing tools like LinkedIn, job portals, and technical forums.
* Strong understanding of technical roles and the skills required for positions like Software Engineers, DevOps Engineers, and System Administrators.
* Strong communication, negotiation, and interpersonal skills.
* Ability to conduct technical interviews and assess candidates’ technical expertise.
* Immediate joiners will be preferred.

