* Develop age\-appropriate assignments and projects to encourage practical application of concepts.
* Inculcate digital responsibility, basic coding logic (if applicable), and tech readiness in students.
* Maintain and manage the computer lab environment and coordinate with technical staff for system upkeep.
* Assess student progress through practical tests, activities, and observations, and provide constructive feedback.
