gd-1009700835913,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009700835913,,DevOps Engineer – Cloud Automation & IT Infrastructure (WFH),Outsource Bigdata,,2025-04-07,,400000.0,800000.0,INR,True,"Apr 7, 2025

  

#### **Aimleap**


#### **India (Remote)**


#### **Posted on Apr 07, 2025**

**AIMLEAP is Hiring:**
----------------------

##### **DevOps Engineer –** **Cloud** **Automation \&****IT Infrastructure** **(WFH)**


Experience: 2\+ Years  

Location: Work from Home / India  

CTC: INR 4 to 8 LPA  

Number of Positions: 1  

Engagement Model: Full Time  

Industry: Automation / Data Processing  

Educational Qualification: Engineering / CS / IT  

Notice Period: Immediate

**Job Description:**
--------------------

**What we are looking for**

* Hands\-on expertise in CI/CD, cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, DigitalOcean), and Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using tools like Terraform.
* Strong knowledge in managing Kubernetes (self\-managed), Jenkins automation, repository/version control, and implementing code quality gates.
* Proven experience supporting IT infrastructure components such as system setup, user onboarding/offboarding, access control, device provisioning, VPN setup, and troubleshooting.

**RESPONSIBILITIES:**

* Design, implement, and manage CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins for seamless build, test, and deployment workflows.
* Deploy and administer self\-managed Kubernetes clusters ensuring high availability, auto scaling, and secure container orchestration.
* Provide IT support across system provisioning, user access management, hardware/software setup, VPN configuration, and issue resolution.
* Manage and optimize multi\-cloud environments (AWS, Azure, DigitalOcean), ensuring cost\-effective and resilient infrastructure.
* Automate infrastructure provisioning using Terraform or similar IaC tools.
* Maintain code repositories with structured workflows for staging, approvals, and production pushes.
* Integrate tools for automated code quality checks and maintain development best practices.
* Write scripts using Bash or Python to automate repetitive DevOps and IT tasks.
* Set up monitoring, alerting, and logging using Prometheus, Grafana, or ELK stack for proactive infrastructure management.

**QUALIFICATIONS:**

* Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or related field.
* 4\+ years of DevOps and IT support experience in cloud environments.
* Proficient in cloud services (AWS, Azure, DigitalOcean), Kubernetes, Jenkins, Docker, and IaC (Terraform).
* Strong scripting ability (Bash/Python) and version control practices (Git).
* Knowledge of IT support tasks including device setup, system access, user lifecycle management, and security protocols.
* Excellent communication and troubleshooting skills.
**About Us:**
-------------


AIMLEAP is an ISO 9001:2015 and ISO/IEC 27001:2013 certified global technology consulting and service provider offering Digital IT, AI\-augmented Data Solutions, Automation, and Research \& Analytics Services.


AIMLEAP has been recognized as ‘The Great Place to Work®’. With focus on AI and automation\-first approach, our services include end\-to\-end IT application management, Mobile App Development, Data Management, Data Mining Services, Web Data Scraping, Self\-serving BI reporting solutions, Digital Marketing, and Analytics solutions.


We started in 2012 and successfully delivered projects in IT \& digital transformation, automation driven data solutions, and digital marketing for more than 750 fast\-growing companies in the USA, Europe, New Zealand, Australia, Canada; and more.


– An ISO 9001:2015 and ISO/IEC 27001:2013 certified  

– Served 750\+ customers  

– 12\+ Years of industry experience  

– 98% Client Retention  

– Great Place to Work® Certified  

– Global Delivery Centers in the USA, Canada, India \& Australia.

