* Assist in the planning and execution of IT projects, including hardware upgrades, system migrations, and new technology implementations.
* Document IT processes, configurations, and security policies for internal use and audits.
* Stay up to date with industry trends and best practices in IT administration, network security, and payment gateway technologies.

