gd-1009699390137,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009699390137,,IT Engineer II,Honeywell,Pune,2025-04-05,,432000.0,640000.0,INR,False,"As an IT Engineer II here at Honeywell, you will be responsible for providing technical support and troubleshooting for IT systems and infrastructure. You will work closely with the IT team to ensure the smooth operation of all IT systems and to resolve any issues that may arise. This role requires strong technical skills, problem\-solving abilities, and a customer\-focused mindset. You will report directly to our IT Manager and you'll work out of our Pune, Maharashtra location on a hybrid work schedule. In this role, you will impact the efficiency and effectiveness of our IT systems, ensuring that our employees have the tools and resources they need to perform their jobs effectively. You will also play a key role in maintaining the security and integrity of our IT infrastructure. At Honeywell, our people leaders play a critical role in developing and supporting our employees to help them perform at their best and drive change across the company. Help to build a strong, diverse team by recruiting talent, identifying, and developing successors, driving retention and engagement, and fostering an inclusive culture.


**KEY RESPONSIBILITIES**


* Design, develop, maintain and enhance software applications using C\# and .NET frameworks.


* Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to gather requirements and translate them into technical specifications


