* Document design specifications, coding standards, and user instructions for the applications developed


* Conduct unit testing and integration testing to ensure application reliability and performance


* Collaborate with Analyst teams to perform comprehensive testing on developed applications and AutoCAD integrations


* Provide technical support to end\-users, assisting with any issues related to the applications developed


* Conduct training sessions for users on new features and functionalities in the developed software


* Participate in code reviews and contribute to team discussions to ensure best practices in software development


* Work closely with team members and other stakeholders to align development work with project timelines and goals

  



**YOU MUST HAVE**


* Bachelor’s degree from an accredited institution in a technical discipline such as Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field
* Familiarity with the AutoCAD .NET API and the ability to manipulate CAD objects programmatically
* Minimum 6 years professional experience:
* At least five years of experience in C\# programming with strong knowledge of object\-oriented programming principles and design patterns
* At least two years of experience with databases (SQL Server, Oracle) and data access technologies to handle data storage and retrieval tasks
* At least one year of experience reading, reviewing, and interpreting electrical schematics and network drawings
* At least one year of customer support and/or customer facing experience


* Strong analytical skills to troubleshoot and resolve technical issues effectively


* Good communication skills to interact with users, gather requirements, and present solutions clearly


* Interest and skill to collaborate with engineering functional teams


**WE VALUE**


* Ability to work with AutoCAD Electrical tool


* Relevant certifications Microsoft Certified Solutions Associate (MCSA)


* Experience with cloud computing platforms such as GCP, AWS or Azure


* Knowledge of IT security best practices


* Ability to work effectively in a team environment

Additional Information

