gd-1009698348758,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009698348758,,Operations Manager – Domestic IT & Non-IT Staffing,Openkyber,India,2025-04-04,,,,,False,"**Job Title: Operations Manager Domestic IT \& Non\-IT Staffing**


**Location:** Madhapur, Hyderabad, Telangana  

**Experience:** 8\-12 years  

**Job Type:** Full\-time


**Company Overview:**  

\[Insert Company Name] is a leading provider of staffing solutions, specializing in delivering top\-tier talent across a wide range of IT and Non\-IT sectors. We are looking for a highly experienced and motivated Operations Manager to oversee our Domestic IT and Non\-IT Staffing operations, ensuring the efficient and effective delivery of services to our clients.


**Job Description:**  

As an Operations Manager for Domestic IT and Non\-IT Staffing, you will be responsible for leading and managing staffing operations across both IT and Non\-IT domains, driving operational excellence, and ensuring the successful deployment of professionals across various industries. You will oversee all staffing\-related activities, ensuring that our recruitment processes run smoothly and efficiently while being aligned with business goals. Additionally, you will manage the staffing tools and identify opportunities for process improvements to meet diverse client needs.


**Key Responsibilities:**


* **Operational Leadership:**  

Lead and manage day\-to\-day operations of the domestic staffing business for both IT and Non\-IT roles. Oversee recruitment, deployment, and retention of professionals across a variety of industries and technologies.
* **Client Management:**  

Collaborate closely with clients to understand their staffing requirements, ensuring that both IT and Non\-IT needs are met in a timely, efficient, and cost\-effective manner. Build and maintain strong, long\-term client relationships.
* **Staffing \& Recruitment:**  

Supervise the end\-to\-end staffing process for both IT and Non\-IT roles, including sourcing, screening, interviewing, and onboarding candidates. Ensure high\-quality talent delivery across industries like IT, engineering, healthcare, finance, operations, marketing, and more.
* **Team Management:**  

Lead, mentor, and manage a diverse team of recruiters, account managers, and other operational staff, ensuring that team performance is aligned with company goals. Provide training, guidance, and development to team members in both IT and Non\-IT domains.
* **Process Optimization:**  

Continuously assess and improve internal processes for IT and Non\-IT staffing, ensuring that workflows are efficient, scalable, and transparent. Implement best practices across both domains.
* **Technology Tools Management:**  

Ensure effective use of staffing tools and platforms, including Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS), CRM tools, job boards, and sourcing platforms. Stay up\-to\-date with the latest tools and technologies to improve staffing operations.
* **Performance Monitoring:**  

Establish and track key performance indicators (KPIs) for both IT and Non\-IT staffing operations. Provide regular reporting on team performance, client satisfaction, and project outcomes to senior management.
* **Compliance and Documentation:**  

Ensure adherence to legal and regulatory requirements related to staffing for both IT and Non\-IT roles, including labor laws, contracts, data protection policies, and other relevant compliance measures.
* **Financial Management:**  

Oversee the budgeting and financial management of staffing operations, ensuring cost\-effective resource allocation and achievement of profitability targets.

