Designation \- Associate Operations Engineer
Business Unit \- Technology
Location \- Turbhe, Navi Mumbai  

The Associate System Engineer will be responsible for engineering, optimization, automation, and administration for Dun \& Bradstreet Cloud environments.
### **Key Responsibilities**

