* Work with Architecture, Security, DevOps, Business, and Application Development teams to choose appropriate technology solutions and facilitate complete integration into the D\&B cloud environments.
* Develop new infrastructure implementation plans, automation, and testing procedures to ensure operational reliability and performance.
