gd-1009695505539,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009695505539,,IT Project Coordinator,Klizo Solutions Pvt. Ltd.,Calcutta,2025-04-03,,25000.0,35000.0,INR,False,"**\*\* Company Name:** Klizo Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (It is a **SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT COMPANY)**

**\*\* Company Website:** www.klizos.com

**\*\* Location:** Astra Tower, Newtown, Akanksha More (Near **City Centre 2**).

**\*\* No. of vacancies:**  3

**\*\* Job Type:** IN OFFICE, **Full\-time**

**\*\* Shift timing:** Flexible with different shift timing

**\*\* Working Days:** Monday to Friday **(5 Days)**

**\*\* Week Off:** Saturday \& Sunday **(Fixed off)**

**\*\* Salary: 25K \- 35K** ( based on current salary, experience and interview performance)

**About Klizo Solutions:**

Klizo Solutions, founded by Joseph Ricard, is an IT company that develops outstanding applications and techs in an enterprise environment, located near CC2 in the New Town Area, Kolkata. But it isn’t the first brainchild of our founder, as he also has multiple start\-ups to his credit, including one of the largest music apps in Italy and a first\-of\-its\-kind Cannabis Vending Machine. So, naturally, being a part of a company founded in the Philippines and run by such a visionary tech leader and a serial entrepreneur, our employees always have ample opportunities to learn and grow as the company evolves. Currently, our big happy Klizo family consists of 50\+ employees. But we want to extend the happiness of working and collaborating with talented individuals even further. And by this, we mean we will hire more talents over the next few weeks!

**\*\*\*\*Job Requirement:** 

We are seeking a proactive and detail\-oriented **Project Coordinator** to support our project management team in delivering high\-quality software solutions. The ideal candidate will have a strong grasp of project management fundamentals, basic technical skills, and a thorough understanding of Agile methodologies. They will play a pivotal role in facilitating communication, ensuring smooth project execution, and assisting with sprint planning and tracking.

**Key Responsibilities:**

● Coordinate and monitor project timelines, deliverables, and dependencies to ensure successful project execution.

● Assist in sprint planning, backlog refinement, and tracking project progress using **Jira** and other project management tools.

● Work closely with **cross\-functional teams**, including frontend and backend developers, QA engineers, and designers, to ensure seamless collaboration.

● Facilitate Agile ceremonies such as daily stand\-ups, sprint planning, sprint reviews, and retrospectives.

● Identify potential project risks, bottlenecks, and roadblocks; escalate issues proactively and support mitigation efforts.

● Maintain clear and up\-to\-date project documentation, status reports, and dashboards for stakeholders.

● Support project managers in resource allocation, task prioritization, and dependency management.

● Ensure project alignment with business objectives, timelines, and stakeholder expectations.

● Assist in improving project processes, workflows, and best practices to optimize efficiency and team productivity.

**Required Skills \& Qualifications:**

● Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Business Administration, or a related field.

● **1\-3 years of experience** in project coordination, project management, or a related role in software development.

● Familiarity with **Agile methodologies (Scrum, Kanban)** and experience in an Agile development environment.

● Hands\-on experience with **Jira**, Confluence, or other project tracking tools.

● Basic understanding of **frontend and backend development** processes, including APIs, databases, and UI/UX workflows.

● Strong organizational and multitasking skills with the ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.

● Excellent communication and interpersonal skills to effectively coordinate between technical and non\-technical teams.

● Problem\-solving mindset with a proactive approach to identifying and addressing project challenges.

● Ability to work collaboratively in a fast\-paced environment and adapt to changing project requirements.

**Preferred Qualifications:**

● Certification in **Agile (CSM, PMI\-ACP, SAFe)** or Project Management (PMP, CAPM) is a plus.

● Experience in software development or technical background is an advantage.

● Familiarity with version control tools (e.g., Git), cloud platforms, and DevOps concepts.

● Exposure to reporting and dashboarding tools like Power BI or Tableau.

**What We Offer:**

● We offer drop service for the night shifts.

● 5 days a week work.

● On\-time salary.

● A dynamic work environment with opportunities to grow in project management.

● Collaboration with experienced professionals in a technology\-driven organization.

● Competitive compensation and benefits.

● Continuous learning and development opportunities.

If you are passionate about project coordination and want to be part of a collaborative and innovative team, we would love to hear from you!

**Interested candidates** are requested to **send us** their **updated CV** through **indeed.com** or **email us** at **nabanita@klizos.com, jobs@klizos.com** for scheduling interview with us.

