gd-1009694420453,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009694420453,,Business Development Manager (BDM) – US IT Staffing,Koshika International,,2025-04-02,,15000.0,40000.0,INR,True,"**Job Overview:**

Talent Vista Inc. is seeking a **highly motivated and experienced Business Development Manager (BDM)** to drive client acquisition and revenue growth in the **US IT staffing industry**. The ideal candidate will have a **strong understanding of US IT staffing**, proven experience in **business development, client relationship management, and lead generation**, and the ability to **work independently** to secure new business opportunities.

This role is **highly performance\-driven**, and compensation will include **competitive incentives based on business closures**. Only **self\-driven, hardworking, and confident professionals** who can work without constant supervision should apply.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Identify, prospect, and acquire new **direct clients, MSPs, and staffing vendors** in the US IT staffing industry.
* Build and maintain **strong relationships** with clients, understanding their hiring needs and providing effective staffing solutions.
* Develop and implement **strategies to generate leads, close deals, and expand business opportunities**.
* Negotiate **contracts, agreements, and service terms** with clients and ensure smooth onboarding.
* Work closely with the recruitment team to ensure timely and quality candidate submissions.
* Stay updated on industry trends, market conditions, and competitors to enhance business strategies.
* Consistently **meet or exceed sales and revenue targets** through effective business development efforts.

**Requirements:**

* **Mandatory experience in US IT staffing business development**, with a proven track record of acquiring clients.
* Strong knowledge of **US recruitment processes, contract types (W2, C2C, 1099\), and IT technologies**.
* Excellent communication, negotiation, and client relationship management skills.
* Ability to **work independently and take ownership** of business targets.
* Strong network and connections in the US staffing industry are a **big plus**.
* Candidates from **Delhi NCR or Hyderabad are preferred.**

**Why Join Us?**

* **High earning potential** with an attractive **incentive structure**.
* Opportunity to work with a **fast\-growing US IT staffing firm**.
