-------------------------------------------------



About the team  

We are currently hiring for Information Technology Team ""IT Application Development and Operations"" as part of ZF Strategic Digital Transformation initiatives.

  


What you can look forward to as Role\- Chennai:  

* We are seeking a highly skilled IT Production Application Support \- Backdesk to join our team, focusing on maintaining and

 supporting critical production applications in a fast\-paced manufacturing environment.  

* This role will primarily involve the management of Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and SCADA systems used on the

 shop floor.  

* The ideal candidate will possess expertise in high availability and resilience, ensuring that our production systems run smoothly

 with minimal downtime.  

* The role requires someone who can quickly learn new technologies and adapt to a constantly evolving environment,

 while working effectively to support mission\-critical applications.  

* Provide 24/7 support for MES and SCADA systems in production environments, ensuring maximum uptime and

 system performance.

  


Your profile as IT Production Application Support \- Backdesk (m/f/d):  

* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (or equivalent work experience).
* Proven experience with MES, SCADA, or similar production systems in a manufacturing environment.
