 Excellent problem\-solving skills, with the ability to troubleshoot complex issues quickly and effectively\*.  

* Experience with system monitoring tools and platforms (e.g., Nagios, Zabbix, Prometheus)\*.
* Hands\-on experience with databases (SQL, Oracle, etc.) and server administration (Linux/Windows).
  


