The IT systems analyst is responsible for gathering requirements, writing test scripts \& execution, business analysis, and documentation for design, deploying, and supporting systems and web \& mobile application support solutions that enable this strategic program. The position requires solid experience in deploying solutions to the sales force and supply chain as well as exposure to the logistics processes in large multi\-nationals.


This position is for supporting the program rollout in the EMEA or ANZ region.


