* Understand customers business needs, challenges and position the relevant solutions that address those needs.
* Develop pipeline by using the company sales methodology and processes.
* Manage sales opportunities throughout the sales cycle.
* Attend and contribute to team meetings and report progress towards achieving account or market strategies with management and peers.

