The Delivery Head is responsible to lead Awign Staffing division and manage the end\-to\-end recruitment delivery process, ensuring client expectations are met or exceeded, and leading a team of recruiters and account managers. This role requires a strategic mindset to drive operational efficiency, client satisfaction, and profitability within the staffing division. The Delivery Head works closely with clients, vendors, and internal teams to deliver high\-quality staffing solutions across various industries and roles.
  
* Develop and implement delivery strategies that align with company goals and client expectations.
* Forecast recruitment needs based on client pipelines and manage resources accordingly.
* Monitor market trends to adapt delivery processes, ensuring competitiveness and relevance.
