* Establish and maintain efficient processes for candidate management, interview coordination, and feedback.
* Ensure adherence to service level agreements (SLAs) and client requirements for every placement.
* Track and report delivery metrics, such as time\-to\-fill, quality of hire, and retention rates.
* Analyze delivery data to identify bottlenecks and areas for improvement.
* Provide regular updates to senior management on delivery performance and client satisfaction.
* Continuously improve recruitment processes to reduce costs, improve efficiency, and enhance candidate quality.
* Work with technology and operations teams to implement recruitment tools and automation solutions.
* Maintain compliance with relevant legal and regulatory standards in staffing.

Manage budgets and P \& L for the delivery team, optimizing resources to meet financial targets.* Collaborate with finance and sales to maximize profitability on each account.
* Identify opportunities for upselling or expanding services within existing accounts.


  
