* Collaborate with IT team to support hardware, software, and network issues.
* Create and maintain documentation for systems, configurations, and procedures.
* Support virtualization platforms (VMware/Hyper\-V).
* Assist in cloud infrastructure management (AWS, Azure, etc. if applicable).

