Languages\-  

""1\. Scripting Languages \- Perl, Python, Groovy, Shell script, PowerShell, Yaml, Ansible  

2\. Visual Studio App Center/Xamarin \-C\#, Cucumber/Calabash with scripting language,  

3\. Java, Python for Appium  

