* Design, implement and support cloud services that comply with the organization's network, security, and technology standards. Automate provisioning of cloud networking services using Infrastructure as Code (e.g. Terraform, CloudFormation Templates, Azure Resource Manager Templates) and GitOps techniques.
* Create, maintain, and update detailed service design, architecture, usage, troubleshooting, support, standard operating procedures and project artifact documentation.
* Provision, manage and troubleshoot the cloud environment's core network services such as AWS Transit Gateway, AWS VPC, AWS Security Groups, AWS Route 53, AWS ELBs, AWS Private Endpoints, Azure VNETs, Azure NSG, Azure Private DNS, etc.
