in-1aaa10f81588f4ee,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=1aaa10f81588f4ee,https://jobs.tjx.com/pl/pl/job/TJCOGLOBALREQ62EXTERNALPLPL/IT-Engineering-Manager?utm_source=INDEED&utm_medium=phenom-feeds,IT Engineering Manager,"The TJX Companies, Inc.","KA, IN",2025-04-09,,,,,True,"TJX Companies
