le follow\-up.  Sales Reporting \& Forecasting: Maintain accurate records using CRM tools and provide sales reports to senior management. Key Requirements:  Education: Bachelor's degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field (certifications in Google Cloud/Microsoft are a plus).  Experience: 4\-5 years in B2B sales with a focus on Google Cloud, Microsoft 365, Azure, or similar enterprise solutions.  Skills: Strong sales, negotiation, and presentation skills, ability to engage with senior decision\-makers, and proficiency in CRM tools.  Preferred: Experience in cloud computing, SaaS sales, enterprise solutions, and  certifications in Google Cloud or Microsoft Azure.  Experience: 4 to 5 Years in the (Internet Service Provider)

