in-f73db97cadd5a621,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=f73db97cadd5a621,http://in.indeed.com/job/senior-it-recruiter-f73db97cadd5a621,Senior IT Recruiter,Metamorfs Infotech Pvt Ltd,"KA, IN",2025-04-09,fulltime,,,,False,"Job title : IT Recruiter

Location : RR Nagar

Experience : 4 years \- 8 years

Skills : Good screening skill

Notice period : **Immediate joiners** 

We are looking for self\-motivated, high performance ""Technical Recruiters"" with 3\-5 years of experience at our office in Bangalore, who will be responsible for the sourcing, technical screening, and successful on\-boarding of resources to fill the open positions. You should have an excellent knowledge of the recruitment process \& accomplishments.

As a Technical Recruiter you will work to identify and fill job openings, technically screen \& interview candidates, and keep records of applications. The Technical Recruiter's responsibilities include all aspects of hiring, from meeting with hiring managers, to writing job descriptions, to offering job positions to the most suitable candidates. You should be focused, hard\-working, and able to meet deadlines to the satisfaction of all parties involved. Having thorough knowledge of ATS will be advantage.

**Recruiter Requirements:**

**· 4\- 8**  years’ experience in end to end recruitment, preferably for IT/Technical roles.

· Bachelors of Science, **B. Tech, B.E., B.C.A., or Human Resources degree.**

· Good understanding of technology and technical skills.

· Experience recruiting for candidates specializing in the niche areas like ERP software's like SAP, Oracle, Salesforce, Workday, SaaS.

· Good interpersonal and decision\-making skills.

· Must have strong written and oral communication skills.

· Should be proficient in word, excel, and outlook and use of ATS.

**Responsibilities**

· Communicating with hiring managers to identify job openings and the technical requirements for those jobs.

· Writing job descriptions and posting to relevant media platforms.

· Screening applicants for competency with the job requirements.

