Laya Tech Pvt Ltd is seeking a highly skilled **Senior Server Engineer** to design, implement, and maintain our server infrastructure. The ideal candidate will have in\-depth knowledge of server architecture, cloud technologies, security protocols, and network configurations. This role requires expertise in troubleshooting, performance optimization, and ensuring high availability of critical systems.

