As a Manager of End User Services, you lead a team responsible for technical support and maintenance of End user infrastructure like Desktops, Workstations, Laptops, Printers, etc., Your key responsibilities include:  

* Establishing, managing, and measuring quality processes for end\-user hardware throughout its lifecycle.
