* Working with an enterprise ticketing system, SLA reporting and maintaining regular reports.
* Ensuring compliance with company policies and regulations.
* Providing regular status updates to leadership and handling complex technical escalations.
* Collaborating with both your team and other teams to complete project works.
* Communicating effectively through verbal and written channels, including email and direct conversations.
* Managing team performance by discussing ongoing and future projects, identifying growth opportunities, and evaluating performance metrics.
* Promoting a shared vision within the team and fostering a collaborative environment.
* Coaching and mentoring team members, assigning development tasks, and setting performance expectations.
* Partnering with stakeholders to define system specifications and business requirements.
* Allocating work based on employee availability and skill sets.


Level of Responsibility:  

* Working independently with minimal supervision.
* Providing guidance to direct reports.
* Conveying complex information verbally and in writing to individuals with limited subject knowledge.
* May involve negotiation, influence, cooperation, tact, and diplomacy.
* Managing a small budget.
* Completing multi\-step tasks with effective planning and prioritization.
* Exercising creativity when drafting original documents, imagery, or work products within established guidelines.
