---------------------------

* The developer will be required to do new developments, extensive analysis, Maintenance, and bug fixes.
* When required will do re\-factorization of existing code for performance improvements and optimization.
* The developer is required to show a steep learning curve to understand the application flows and independently work in the scrum.
