 What You’ll Do* Provides day\-to\-day management of all infrastructure components including but not limited to Network Infrastructure and Security Applications and Appliances
* Creates and maintains supporting documentation, including but not limited to Network Infrastructure diagrams, Data Flow Diagrams, Disaster Recovery Plans, and IT policies and procedures.
