* Establishes network by evaluating network performance issues including availability, utilization, throughput, goodput, and latency; planning and executing the selection, installation, configuration, and testing of equipment; defining network policies and procedures; establishing connections and firewalls.
* Maintains network performance by performing network monitoring and analysis, and performance tuning; troubleshooting network problems; escalating problems to vendor.
* Secures network by developing network access, monitoring control, and evaluation.
* Upgrades network by conferring with vendors, developing, testing, evaluating, and installing enhancements.
* Coordinate with key stakeholders to identify future needs and requirements \& develop future state architecture.
* Provide level 3 technical expertise for projects and issues related to Network infrastructure.
* Ensure the security of information technology assets, data, network access, and backup systems, and implement monitoring and alerting systems to verify the security of internal and external systems


Special Conditions:* Some evening and weekend work will be required (as required)
* Ability to provide 24\-hour on\-call and on\-site emergency support (as required)


Experience You’ll Bring* University Degree or Diploma in Computer Science, Information Technology, Computer Networking, Engineering, or a related technical field.
* At least 2 – 5 years of progressive experience in IT Networking and/or Server Infrastructure.
* Fundamental understanding of Network Performance Tuning
* Fundamental understanding of LAN, and WAN protocols.
* Fundamental understanding of Network Design and Implementation
* Fundamental understanding of DNS, DHCP, VLAN, and Routing
* Proven strong analytical and troubleshooting skills.
* Excellent report and documentation writing skills.
* Practical experience managing network software and network hardware devices.
* Experience with monitoring tools, monitoring methodologies, escalation processes, and procedures.
* Excellent troubleshooting and problem\-solving skills
* Strong customer focus, ownership, urgency, and drive
* Proven ability to mentor and train others
* Strong communication skills and organization skills


Nice to Have:* Relevant certifications (Network \+, Security \+, CCNA, CCSA)
* Experience with Checkpoint Products
* Experience with HP/Aruba Product


