Techminds Group founded in 2007, headquartered in New Jersey, USA is a Global Information Technology Services firm known for our deep industry experience and high customer satisfaction. Techminds Group is an NJFast50 winner (2016\), Inc 5000 (2017\) Winner, is one of the fastest\-growing private companies in America, also a Microsoft Certified Partner focused on Data Management, Enterprise Resource Planning, and Azure platform solutions.

