The System Administrator will be responsible for managing and maintaining our basic IT Infrastructure, ensuring seamless onboarding and offboarding processes, and providing support for both Windows and Mac systems. Proficiency in Microsoft Intune, JAMF, and Entra is essential for this role, as is the ability to troubleshoot and resolve issues related to various applications and Microsoft 365 services. This role would be part of 18\*5 Global support team.

