**About Orbiqe Technologies:**  
Orbiqe Technologies is a leading IT services and solutions company, delivering innovative business products tailored to our clients' needs. We specialize in web and mobile app development, digital solutions, and cutting\-edge technology services. We are expanding our team and looking for a motivated **Technical Recruiter** to join us.

