* Self\-motivated, proactive, and able to work independently.

**Preferred Skills:**

* Experience selling cloud computing solutions (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, etc.) or data center infrastructure.
* Familiarity with hybrid cloud, virtualization technologies, and network security solutions.
* IT certifications (e.g., Cisco, VMware, Microsoft, AWS) are a plus.
