Experience with HPE switches, F5 LTM, and FortiGate, firewalls.  

Knowledge of networking protocols (TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP/S) and network security best practices.  

Experience with traffic management, VPNs, and firewall policies.  

Relevant certifications (e.g., Cisco CCNA/CCNP, F5\-CA, Fortinet NSE) are a plus.  

Strong troubleshooting and problem\-solving skills.  

Manage firewall policies, VDOM configuration, VPN configurations, site\-to\-site/remote access VPNs, and ensure network security compliance.  

Monitor network performance and resolve security and connectivity issues promptly.

