**Job Role:**  

  

Boston Scientific is looking for a Mid\-level SAP Basis person to support within an SAP Center of Excellence. The Consultant will be responsible for performing SAP Basis activities as including support of multiple SAP systems (S/4 HANA, GRC, GTS, SLT, BW/B4, ECC, CRM and various Interfaces/Bolt\-on. This person will help coordinate between SAP run activities provided by 3rd party support and projects going on in the environment.

