We are currently seeking an experienced professional to join our team in the role of Manager Product Control


**Principal responsibilities**


* Deliver timely and accurate daily and periodic reporting with high degree of accuracy and auditable controls
* Ensure service delivery of Product Control processes as per the standards set out in agreed SLAs within the HSBC Global Resourcing operating framework. Demonstrate an expert understanding of Markets business and processes
