* Contributes to customer enablement sessions (AMA, webinars, live sessions, etc)


Qualifications:
* Ability to set and manage priorities judiciously
* Demonstrated ability to work independently and as part of a team
* Creative problem solving, business judgment and financial acumen are required
* Relationship building skills and the ability to plan and influence across all departments in the organization.


Preferred:
* Bachelor’s degree
* Experience in a start\-up or an enterprise
* Platform Experience (Privacy OR Consent Management)


