**Job Description Of General Manager Sales**

**Key Job Responsibilities**

\- Create and implement strategic sales and marketing plans to successfully achieve business objectives

\- Monitor competitor products with relevant sales and marketing data

\- Use and monitor available data to accurately forecast sales and set appropriate sales performance goals

\- Identifying key clients and develop and maintain positive relationships with key clients.

\- Plan visits, Price Negotiation and close Key client contracts.

\- Develop complete plan along with budgets for marketing activities for team

\- Monitor daily communications via CRM, Outlook emails and take appropriate steps where ever necessary.

\- Maintain the average selling price

\- Keeping the outstanding at bare minimum. Proactively monitors account receivables from directs accounts to maintain a healthy credit control scenario

\- Develop sales monitoring system for team members for daily, weekly, monthly visible targets vs achievements along with incentive schemes

**Other Vital Accountabilities**

\- Manage teams with focus on excelling business targets \& sales metrics.

\- Responsible for handing existing customers in import \& export market

\- Focusing more on special grade/value products for achieving the average price.

\- Developing new business across the globe for Microcrystalline Cellulose Powder, Spirulina Powder and other products.

\- Responsible for appointing new distributors or end customers.

\- Coordinate with other heads of departments, integrating objectives and ideas for organizational growth

\- Allocate resources to various centres and regions; all aimed at achieving results

\- Responsible for training and mentoring staff; motivating them all for effective performance for the growth of the company

**Product Profile**

\- MCC is used in Pharma industry: as excipient, bulking agent and as binder to increase tablet hardness. It acts as disintegrating agent, stabiliser, adsorbent, anti\-sticking agent and capsule diluent.

\- MCC has wide applications in food industry. Used as Hot and Cold stabiliser, fat substitute and emulsifier in Ice Cream industry, Frozen foods, desserts \& canned meat for improved stability.

\- Used as gelling agent, stabilizer, anti\-caking agent and suspending agent in beverages \& Fruit Juices.

\- It's anti\-caking properties in Bakery industry helps improving crispiness, to improve water retention, to reduce calories \& breakages.

\- Spirulina is blue\-green algae consumed by humans and animals. It is used as dietary supplement.

\- Spirulina is available in Powder, Tablet and Capsule formats.

**Job Specification**

\- Qualification \- B. Tech / MSc / M. Pharm/B. Pharm \+ MBA

\- Experience \- 5 to 20 Years in similar API/Capsules/excipient/ Food industries with at least 5 years as Sales Head / Leadership role

