* Technical Knowledge: Familiarity with AI technologies, natural language processing (NLP), machine learning, and chatbot frameworks.
* Customer Orientation: Deep understanding of customer needs and a passion for creating user\-centric products.
* Project Management: Proven track record of managing complex projects and delivering products on time and within budget.

  


