gd-1009705124266,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009705124266,,Product Owner,G-Source Technologies LLC.,Pune,2025-04-11,,766265.0,1800000.0,INR,False,"**Job Title:**  
**Product Owner**

**Job Summary:**  
We are seeking a highly driven **Product Owner** with **7\-10 years of experience in product management and product development**. This individual will act as the strategic bridge between stakeholders and development teams, guiding product lifecycle management from concept to launch. The ideal candidate has hands\-on experience with **agile frameworks** and a successful history of launching impactful, market\-ready products.

**Key Responsibilities:**

**1\. Product Strategy \& Development:**

* Drive end\-to\-end product development, ensuring all features align with business objectives and user needs.
