* Ability to articulate user needs clearly, both verbally and in writing.
* Experience in product management and feature definition/ownership with exposure to large\-scale product management.
* Deep analytical skills to uncover end\-to\-end logic and functionality of a process and identify comprehensive test case scenarios.

