* Visit the customer’s business and residential place to conduct thorough assessment/evaluation, following standard operation procedures. Analyze and evaluate loan applications to determine the situation of business, establish risks, determine the capacity of repayment and adequate loan amount for the customer’s needs and also evaluate the family situation and stability
* Cooperate with credit department in case of identifying discrepancies or problems in customer’s information, reports, etc.
