r with marketing and communication. In the role of the Junior Product Manager, you will work in particular on and learn strategic product development. You will work in a team of experienced product managers who will guide you and introduce you to new subject areas. Regular assessments and interviews as well as dedicated product management training measures and certifications will support you in your professional and personal development process.

