* Discovering use cases for new features and enhancements that improve digital customer registration and onboarding experience
* Identifying best practices from competitors and best in class,
* Identifying opportunities to increase digital sales and service and improve CX, gap analysis between best in class and current capabilities and define MVP1 scope and roadmap.
* Performing on Value assessment and prioritization informed by in\-depth data analysis of customer and business impacts of new features and enhancements including estimating revenue, operating expense and OSAT (overall satisfaction) and setting KPI targets.
