	+ Balance partner/customer needs with engineering feasibility.
* **Partner \& Product Enablement**


	+ Anticipate and resolve onboarding and operational challenges for internal and external partners.
	+ Build infrastructure to empower partners and teams to operate seamlessly on Ema’s platform.
