**Front\-End Developer (React.js)**

Position Overview:

We are seeking a skilled and experienced Front\-End Developer specializing in building modern Single Page Applications (SPAs) to join our development team. In this role, you will collaborate with designers, back\-end developers, and product managers to deliver seamless, scalable, and high\-performance web applications. The ideal candidate has expertise in Remix, TypeScript, and Redux Toolkit, combined with a passion for creating exceptional user experiences. Experience with React Native is a plus.

Key Responsibilities:

* Develop, test, and maintain front\-end features for SPAs using Remix, TypeScript, and Redux Toolkit.
* Collaborate with UI/UX designers to ensure the technical feasibility of designs and implement user\-friendly interfaces.
* Build reusable, modular, and well\-tested components that enhance scalability and performance.
* Design and optimize state management solutions using Redux Toolkit, including RTK Query and Redux Thunk for managing side effects.
* Work with RESTful APIs, Server\-Sent Events (SSE), and other back\-end services to enable dynamic and real\-time data flows.
* Debug and resolve front\-end performance and cross\-browser compatibility issues.
* Stay updated with the latest trends, techniques, and best practices in front\-end development.
* Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback to team members.

Requirements:

* Proven experience as a Front\-End Developer, with a focus on building SPAs.
* Strong expertise in Remix.js or a similar modern framework.
* Proficient in TypeScript, JavaScript (ES6\+), HTML5, CSS3, and related web technologies.
* Strong understanding of React.js concepts such as components, state management, hooks, and lifecycle methods.
* Familiarity with Redux Toolkit, including RTK Query, slices, middleware, and Redux Thunk for handling side effects or other state management libraries.
* Experience with front\-end build tools like Webpack, Babel, or Vite.
* Knowledge of version control systems, especially Git.
* Understanding of responsive design principles and mobile\-first development.
* Familiarity with modern CSS frameworks or pre\-processors like SASS, LESS, or Tail windCSS.
* Basic understanding of SEO principles and accessibility standards.

Preferred Qualifications:

* Experience with Client Side Rendering(CSR) in frameworks like Remix/Next.js.
* Knowledge of TypeScript.
* Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and DevOps practices.
* Exposure to Agile/Scrum development methodologies.

Good to have:

* Experience working with tools like Jest, React Testing Library, or other testing frameworks.
* Understanding of GraphQL and/or experience with Apollo Client.
* Understanding of Server\-Sent Events (SSE)
* Experience with React Native for building mobile applications.

Soft Skills:

* Strong problem\-solving and analytical skills.
* Excellent communication and collaboration abilities.
* Ability to work in a team environment and independently as needed.
* Attention to detail and a focus on delivering high\-quality code.

Benefits:

* Competitive salary and performance bonuses.
* Opportunities for professional growth and training.
* Flexible working hours and remote work options.
* Health insurance and other benefits.
* Supportive and collaborative work environment.

