**201303**### **Job Description**


**Broad Function:**  

We are seeking an analytical thinker with an audience\-first mindset to fill the position of Content Manager. The ideal candidate should have a deep understanding of the B2B content marketing space and possess the ability to leverage data to develop a content strategy aligned with specific business goals and objectives.  

  

  

If you are passionate about crafting top\-notch and captivating content that delivers tangible business results, we would love to have you join our team! **Roles and Responsibilities:**  

  

  

**As a Content Writer, your responsibilities will include:**  

* Developing, managing and executing a comprehensive content strategy and content calendar.
* Collaborating with cross\-functional teams to create various types of content such as case studies, whitepapers, landing pages, offers, and more.
* Conducting research and ideating to produce engaging content assets such as blog posts, e\-books, infographics, emails, newsletters, social media posts, and sales collateral.
* Repurposing existing content and creating new ideas for content marketing and lead generation.
* Writing video scripts to support the content strategy.
* Implementing SEO best practices to improve content visibility and organic traffic.
* Ensuring that all content is optimized to drive traffic, engagement, and leads.
* Providing assistance to team members on other written materials as needed.
* Managing freelance writers when required.
* Taking ownership of content delivery to support product or marketing projects, including email campaigns and sales collateral.
* Contribute to employer branding activities

### **Requirements**

**Key skills required for the role:**  

  

  

* 7\-9 years of experience in content writing or marketing communication, preferably in the B2B sector.
* Demonstrated ability to learn quickly, adapt to changing circumstances, and manage multiple priorities.
* Strong understanding of which platform is best suited for different types of content.
* Proficiency in conducting secondary research.
* Good time management and interpersonal skills.
* Data\-driven approach with a good understanding of Google Analytics, social media analytics, and other relevant tools.
* Experience in online community building.

  

If you meet these requirements and are passionate about creating exceptional content that resonates with the target audience, we would love to hear from you!### **Benefits**

**The company offers a range of employee benefits including:**  

* Cashless medical insurance for employees, spouses, and children
* Accidental insurance coverage
* Life insurance coverage
* Five\-day work week
* Company\-paid lunch
* Company\-paid transportation
* Access to online learning platforms such as Udemy and LinkedIn Learning
* Retirement benefits including Provident Fund (PF) and Gratuity
* Sodexo benefits for income tax savings
* Paternity \& Maternity Leave Benefit
* National Pension Saving",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE613022.htm,Product Management
