Flipkart. You lead the development and execution of their growth plans and  


optimization recommendations. You should have a thorough knowledge of Amazon \&  


Flipkart marketing. You should also thrive in ambiguous situations, with clear  


communication skills. You should be a person with an organized approach and a real  


team player who is willing to roll up sleeves as and when needed.### **Requirements**

