* Create \& Implement ad strategies to increase eCommerce revenue.
* Handle, review, and perform daily account responsibilities associated with


Amazon/Flipkart.  

* Maintain and monitor key metrics for 4\-6 accounts.
* Optimize campaign performance to get better scale while maintaining ACoS.
* In\-depth data analysis to develop actionable insights and recommendations


for campaigns.  

* Work cross\-functionally with R\&D teams to understand new products and


launch them on Amazon.  

* Direct, handle and be able to generate daily, weekly and monthly reporting


for all major metrics, goals tracking, revenue tracking, and other key metrics.  

* Communication to team and management on project development, timelines,


and results. Work closely with the other team members to meet goals.  

* Be on top of the latest happenings and algorithm changes for the platform


and implement the most cutting edge strategies for best\-in\-class results.  

Requirements:  

* Experienced with Amazon Marketing including organic and paid marketing


growth.* An insatiable desire to win! A clear\-minded approach to continuously and


rapidly improve your skills so that you are amongst the best in ads  


management.  

* Extreme interest in business results and their linkage to marketing tactics.


You should be extremely interested in rapidly growing businesses via Digital  


advertising.  

* Experience in interpreting data and making business recommendations.
* Demonstrated high attention to detail and proven ability to manage multiple,


competing priorities simultaneously.  

* Confidence in the analysis of number\-based reports and experience in MS


Office (esp. Excel).  

* Passion for online advertising and a proven track record of delivering


outstanding results.  

* Proficiency in managing moderate to large scale PPC accounts on Amazon.

### **Benefits**


Why should you join us?
* In case you value the opportunity to work on real \& challenging Marketing


problems  

