You're a creative storyteller who lives for Instagram Reels and loves experimenting with new trends. You adore your phone and gimbal like they’re your best friends. Editing is your second language—InShot, CapCut, VN, Canva, you name it. You understand what makes content *click*, and you have the instinct to turn a simple moment into a scroll\-stopping visual. You thrive on making things beautiful, shareable, and authentic.

