gd-1009703308571,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009703308571,,3D Assistant Product Manager,BoxBrownie.com,,2025-04-09,,,,,True,"Join us as a 3D Assistant Product Manager – Virtual Staging!



*Remote \| Full\-time \| Creative Tech Industry*

  


At BoxBrownie.com, we're redefining the way the world sees property marketing—and we’re on the hunt for a dynamic 3D Assistant Product Manager to help elevate our Virtual Staging product to new heights. If you’re highly organised, tech\-savvy, and passionate about delivering top\-quality visual experiences, this could be your perfect role.

  


You’ll play a key part in supporting our industry\-leading virtual staging services' strategic direction and daily operations. This role is about turning big ideas into polished execution—bridging the gap between customer needs, operational excellence, and cutting\-edge creativity.



What You’ll Do


* Drive ongoing improvements to the virtual staging product, ensuring high\-quality output and customer satisfaction.
* Support daily operations and make sure services are delivered seamlessly and on time.
* Collaborate with editors to optimise workflows, allocate resources, and uphold product quality.
* Maintain and enforce quality standards across all virtual staging content.
* Partner with cross\-functional teams to improve features, tools, and user experience based on market insights.
* Gather and analyse operational data and feedback to support innovation and continuous improvement.
* Assist in creating and updating training materials, documentation, and product guidelines.
* Act as a key liaison between the virtual staging team and other departments.


✅ What We’re Looking For


* Previous experience in an administrative, assistant, or project coordination role—bonus if it’s in digital content, real estate, or creative services.
* Exceptional organisational and multitasking skills—you thrive in a fast\-paced environment.
* Clear, confident communicator (written and verbal).
* Detail\-oriented with a strong commitment to quality.
* Comfortable working with data, reports, and insights that drive decision\-making.
* Experience in product or operations with a focus on quality control and team coordination is a plus.


Why You’ll Love Working With Us


* Be part of a creative, innovative, and global team.
* Work on a product that makes a real difference in the real estate and creative industries.
* Opportunities to grow and expand your skills in product and operations management.
* Flexible, remote work environment with a great team culture.


If you’re ready to bring organisation, creativity, and purpose together in one role, we want to hear from you!

  


Apply now and help shape the future of virtual staging at BoxBrownie.com.",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE2374761.htm,Product Management
