Newton is a leading one\-stop iOS app store growth management platform for advertisers. Part of the Affle Group, Newton helps businesses improve iOS app visibility, acquire quality users, and maximize ROI. Leveraging advanced AI, it provides multilingual recommendations, intelligence, automated bid optimization, and detailed analytics to drive app installs, user activation, and purchases

