**About the role**
We are looking for a highly skilled Senior Product Manager (SPM) / Product Manager (PM) to take end\-to\-end ownership of a key platform module and customer experience. This is a hands\-on role, requiring close collaboration with engineering teams,  

banking clients, and cross\-functional stakeholders.  

  

The ideal candidate should have experience in owning and scaling a technology\-driven platform and should be able to define product strategy, translate business needs into actionable features, and drive execution with precision.
**Key Responsibilities:**
Own a platform module end\-to\-end, ensuring seamless customer experiences and smooth integration with banking systems.
