Work closely with engineering teams to translate product requirements into scalable and efficient platform solutions.
Collaborate with banking partners, financial institutions, and regulatory bodies to design and refine solutions.
Drive market research, competitive analysis, and customer feedback loops to inform product decisions.
Define and monitor key product metrics (KPIs) to measure success and continuously optimize platform performance.
