Communicate product vision clearly across teams and advocate for user\-first design and engineering excellence.

**Requirements:**
3\-5 years of hands\-on experience as a Product Manager / Senior Product Manager in a technology\-driven environment.
Mandatory: Hands\-on experience with technology platforms (preferably fintech, banking, or payments).
Strong understanding of platform scalability, APIs, integrations, and infrastructure\-driven product development.
Experience working closely with engineering teams, including defining technical product requirements.
Familiarity with fintech ecosystems, banking integrations, and regulatory compliance (preferred).
Excellent stakeholder management skills, especially in coordinating with external banking partners.
Strong analytical and problem\-solving abilities, with experience in data\-driven decision\-making.
Expertise in agile methodologies, sprint planning, and backlog management.
Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and align teams across functions.

