gd-1009703535276,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009703535276,,Marketing Manager,Tetra Pak,Gurgaon,2025-04-09,,666000.0,925000.0,INR,False,"*At Tetra Pak we commit to making food safe and available, everywhere; and we protect what's good – protecting food, protecting people, and protecting the planet. By doing so we touch millions of people's lives every day. And we need people like you to make it happen*


**Job Summary**
---------------



As Marketing Manager – for one of the core categories you will have the opportunity to develop and implement the category strategy for the growth of business in Tetra Pak South Asia Markets. This position plays an important role in building the category amongst customers and consumers by creating awareness on the benefits and value of products in carton.


Reporting to the Marketing Director, South Asia Markets, you will be part of the core team of Tetra Pak that will work with local and multinational customers to drive business exponentially. You will be required to work collaboratively with other members of the sales team and customers while leading the overall business responsibility for the category.


**What you will do**
--------------------


* Develop and implement a 3 year business plan to grow Tetra Pak sales in the category
* Develop, document and disseminate knowledge on the category to the stakeholders within and outside the company
* Partner with the key account team and customers to drive new concepts incorporating marketing and consumer knowledge
* Partner with the global teams to develop and roll out strategic initiatives
* Understand the complete value chain for key food and beverage customers, from processing to retail and consumer, to build and implement growth oriented solutions in packaging and processing

  




**Key areas of responsibilities**

  

  

**Drive Market leadership in category**  

o Lead the development and execution of Market business plan based on analysis of market intelligence covering the entire value chain in the assigned category  

