* Develop and ensure that sufficient audit and control procedures are in place.
* Incorporate audit and control procedures within trading partner profiles, translation set maps and interface files.
* Perform data mapping, mailbox setup, communications and security setups
* Translate business requirements and customer needs into detailed API specifications and user stories.
* Lead the migration of legacy APIs to a modern technology stack, ensuring seamless transition and minimal disruption.
* Collaborate closely with engineering teams throughout the development lifecycle, ensuring timely and high\-quality delivery.
* Stay abreast of industry trends, emerging technologies, and best practices in API development and management.

### **What we’re looking for...**


Understanding what customers will want next is your driver. You are creative but balance that with your practical business side. You can juggle several projects with tight deadlines and not drop any balls—while also keeping your eye on the big picture. An environment with lots of competing priorities and new challenges every day is where you thrive. With a knack for working with different types of people, you inspire others to do their best work and carry out your vision.

 **You’ll need to have:**

