**Job Description**



This position is in the GRC Data Management team within Global Risk and Compliance Line of Business. The Product Owner position will provide day to day strategic support and function as the primary point of contact owning the vision and roadmap of BAU data capabilities and platforms and the modernization efforts. Focus would be on new product development, risk management initiatives, process control and improvement and end user experience. This is a highly visible and strategic position within the company.

  


