* Proactively communicate and collaborate with external and internal customers to analyze information needs and functional requirements and deliver the following artifacts as needed: Business Requirements Documents, User Stories, Shaping Document etc.
* Drive and challenge business units on their assumptions of how they will successfully execute their plans
* Successfully engage in multiple initiatives simultaneously
* Work independently with minimal or no supervision
* The ability to excel in a fast\-paced, dynamic environment
* Conduct Training for Clients / System Users
* Actively participate in the requirements, design, and build phases of an application through collaboration with the business contacts and Pega consultant team
**Who you are**
---------------

