Techwens Software Pvt. Ltd. is seeking a passionate and enthusiastic Junior Frontend Developer to join our growing development team in Montreal. This is an excellent opportunity for a motivated individual to contribute to the development of user\-friendly and visually appealing web applications. You will work closely with senior developers, designers, and product managers to implement and maintain frontend features, learn best practices, and grow your skills in a collaborative and supportive environment.

