gd-1009701729798,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009701729798,,Senior Software Engineering Manager,rePurpose Global,Bengaluru,2025-04-08,,7000000.0,7000000.0,INR,False,"**rePurpose Global** is the world’s leading Plastic Action Platform, bringing together brands, consumers, innovators, and policymakers to collectively combat the plastic waste crisis and support impactful environmental and social action.  

