We’re just getting started on our mission \- the fight against plastic pollution is going to take everything we’ve got, and more. We are looking for entrepreneurial and passionate team members who thrive in a collaborative and purpose\-driven environment. We invite you to join our 60\+ member global team that is striving hard everyday to create a truly consequential company.  

As a Senior Software Engineering Manager at rePurpose Global you will be responsible for managing and growing a team of 3 engineers while serving as an independent contributor as required. We’re looking for a player/coach who loves to build products while mentoring and growing a team of engineers. You will collaborate heavily with our product managers and other business leaders throughout the company to ensure alignment between our products and people.
### **Responsibilities**

* Manage a team of full\-stack engineers: provide mentorship and career guidance, organize sprint plans, run performance reviews.
