* Strong analytical mindset with experience in setting OKRs and measuring product success.
* Ability to influence without direct authority, working across multiple teams and stakeholders.
* Exceptional communication and storytelling skills to articulate product strategy and impact.
* Experience working with engineering, UX, and data teams to drive AI product development.
* Strong problem\-solving and conflict resolution skills in a cross\-functional environment.
* Ability to thrive in ambiguous and fast\-paced environments, adapting to new challenges.",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE194.htm,Product Management
