﻿You are a strategic thinker passionate about driving solutions in Business Management. You have found the right team.


As a Business Manager within our Finance team, you will be responsible for defining, refining, and achieving the firm's set goals. You will join the Finance \& Business Management (F\&BM) team, which supports the Consumer and Community Banking (CCB) Technology and Product Organization. Your role will involve driving business management, financial analysis, vendor management, strategy, program management, training, and internal communications for CCB Technology organization teams across Mumbai, Hyderabad, and Bengaluru. You will play a crucial role in helping the CCB Technology and Product organization shape and achieve its vision, execute strategies, and support businesses by providing information, analysis, and recommendations to improve results and drive decisions. Your responsibilities will include optimizing business performance by driving key initiatives, acting as a trusted advisor and counterweight to Business/Group Heads, and identifying, escalating, and mitigating business risks.

**Job Responsibilities**

* Provide Business Management support for CCB India (Tech/Product Organization) supporting Forecasting, Budgeting, Location Strategy, Spend governance and analytics
