**Western Union powers your pursuit**  

In this role you will work as a member of the Digital Product team with a focus on building the online payment experience of customers who visit Western Union across channels. You will ensure that Western Union has best\-in\-class product capabilities, which will enable our customers to have the best possible experience. You will own and set the strategy for your product line and be accountable for execution upon that strategy.  

  

**Role Responsibilities**

* Define product features, ensuring a seamless and user\-centric experience along with mapping of KPIs for measuring performance and defining success.
