At Clari5, we’re not just building products — we’re helping the world’s leading banks stop financial crime in real time. Our platforms protect 1 billion accounts across 15 countries, and now we’re looking for a Product Manager to help us take that impact even further.



If you understand the complexity of the BFSI space, speak the language of bankers and technologists alike, and can turn market needs into real\-world products that fight fraud, this role is for you.

  


### **Your Mission:**



As a **Product Manager at Clari5**, you’ll be at the center of everything — strategy, customer conversations, product design, delivery, and growth. You’ll work closely with cross\-functional teams to build solutions that matter to the banking world — especially those that combat fraud at scale.

  


### **What You’ll Do:**


**Product Vision \& Roadmap:** Define and own the product strategy, turning insights into action and market needs into differentiated offerings.  

**Customer\-Centric Innovation:** Engage directly with banks and financial institutions to understand their challenges and translate them into impactful product features.  

**Cross\-Functional Collaboration:** Partner with engineering, sales, marketing, and customer success to ensure seamless delivery and adoption of product enhancements.  

**Market Intelligence:** Stay on top of fraud trends, regulatory shifts, and competitive activity in BFSI to ensure we’re always ahead of the curve.  

**Go\-To\-Market \& Launch:** Drive product development from concept to release, ensuring GTM readiness, internal alignment, and client success.  

**Data\-Driven Iteration:** Use product analytics and feedback loops to continuously evolve and improve the offering.  

**Stakeholder Alignment:** Keep internal and external stakeholders aligned through clear communication, prioritization, and progress updates.

  


### **What You Bring:**


**Experience:** 5\+ years in product management, preferably in **BFSI, fintech, or enterprise risk solutions**  

**Client\-Facing Strength:** You’ve worked closely with banks and FIs, and understand how to balance innovation with regulatory realities  

**Domain Knowledge:** Exposure to **fraud prevention, risk analytics, or financial crime management** is a strong plus  

**Technical Fluency:** You’re comfortable working with APIs, banking core systems, and digital product stacks  

**Strategic \& Tactical Mindset:** You can zoom out and set vision, but also dive into the weeds to get things shipped  

**Clear Communicator \& Influencer:** Able to work across teams, present to customers, and align diverse stakeholders with confidence


### **Why Clari5?**



Build products that **protect economies** and **solve real\-world problems** in real time  

Collaborate with **top\-tier banks across 15 countries**  

Work on **next\-gen fraud prevention, risk, and analytics platforms**  

Be part of a team where **your product decisions are visible, meaningful, and global**



### **Job Features**


#### **Job Category**


Project Management


