gd-1009697419935,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009697419935,,Senior Product Designer,Probo,Gurgaon,2025-04-04,,450000.0,710000.0,INR,False,"**About Us:**
  

At its heart, Probo is **India’s leading online skill gaming platform** building prediction markets for India. On Probo, users can find questions on many topics of their interest, like sports, news, finance and many more. Users can swipe **yes or no** to express their opinion and place trade(s), and by doing so they enter into an event contract with another user on the other side of the trade. Probo is a matching engine that enables the execution of this event contract.


**We are also backed by the finest institutional investors in the form of Sequoia and Elevation (formerly SAIF Partners).**

**About the role:**

  


As a Senior Product Designer, you’ll lead projects to tackle user problems and help achieve business goals through crafting delightful, accessible, and easy\-to\-use designs. You’ll be a core member for defining and implementing Probo’s design language for millions of users.



We're seeking a Senior Product Designer with a passion for crafting **high\-quality visual designs** and an exceptional user experience. In this role, you'll work closely with our product and engineering teams to design and iterate on Probo's platform features, ensuring our users have a seamless and engaging experience.  

  

**Who will you work with?**

  


You will primarily work alongside product, engineering and customer support teams on projects requiring a strong focus on visual solutions.


**What skills \& qualifications are we looking for?**


* **Design Leadership:** Lead the visual and interactive design efforts for our product, ensuring high standards of usability and aesthetics.
* **User\-Centric Design:** Conduct user research and testing to gather insights and feedback, using this data to inform design decisions.
* **Collaboration:** Work closely with product managers, engineers, and other stakeholders to develop design strategies that align with Probo's business goals and user needs.
* **Prototyping and Validation:** Create wireframes, prototypes, and high\-fidelity designs, using tools such as Figma, Sketch, or Adobe XD. Validate designs through user testing and iterative feedback.
* **Design Systems:** Develop and maintain a cohesive design system to ensure product consistency across multiple platforms and touchpoints.
* **Mentorship:** Mentor junior designers, fostering a culture of creativity, innovation, and continuous learning.


**How to apply?**



Apply with a portfolio that demonstrates your design work. We want to see your thought process, aesthetics and high\-quality samples of work.


**Curious about this team?**



Checkout Medium to see how the Design team works.


**Next steps**  

Finally, if this tickles your bones and you know what it takes to build magical user experiences, this is definitely the right place for you. Encouraging you to know more about us \-  

Check out our app/trading platform: https://probo.in/events  

