We seek a dynamic professional to fill the combined role of Product Owner with healthcare and pharmaceutical industry experience. This versatile role is responsible for owning the end\-to\-end delivery of a product line, translating business requirements into product features and user stories, and facilitating effective communication among various teams to ensure the successful development and delivery of high\-quality products.


