\* As part of the team for one of our A\-list clients, you’ll be collaborating with animators, editors, production crew as well as with PMs,operations managers, clients and other talents.

\* Responsible for directing the post production team and getting work done.

\* Working on multiple projects at once, you go above and beyond each brief to push what’s

possible on both a creative and technical level.

\* Whether it’s through programmatic targeting or dynamic content, your job is to get the right message across to the right audience(s).

\* You would be responsible for delivery of the final QC video to the client.

Our mission to become the best media production partner in any field and market —. You’ll get the opportunity to bring concepts to life from first ideas to the final production (shoot/animation)

