gd-1009695317248,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009695317248,,B2B Relationship Manager,A C Agarwal Share Brokers Pvt. Ltd.,India,2025-04-03,,240000.0,600000.0,INR,False,"A.C. Agarwal Share Brokers is an Indian stock broking company with 20\+ years of experience in the capital markets. The company holds memberships of most of India's top stock exchanges and depositories, including NSE, BSE, MCX, and CDSL. With a team of 250\+ authorized partners, AC Agarwal is committed to building growth and wealth creation at a national level.

**Job Summary:**

We are looking for a dynamic and results\-driven **B2B Relationship Manager** to join our team. This role will be pivotal in fostering and expanding relationships with stock broking firms, corporates, financial institutions, and intermediaries. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in the financial markets, particularly in currency derivatives, equity, debt, and exchange\-traded funds, along with excellent relationship management skills.

