**The Opportunity:**



We are looking for a seasoned Product Manager with 10\+ years of experience in SaaS\-based IT Product Development. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in product lifecycle management, stakeholder collaboration, and agile methodologies. They will be responsible for defining the product roadmap, driving innovation, and ensuring alignment with business goals to deliver world\-class SaaS solutions.

  

