gd-1009694778742,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009694778742,,Front End Developer,Cognex technology pvt ltd,Chennai,2025-04-02,,263568.0,1275952.0,INR,False,"* A Front\-End Developer creates the user\-facing part of websites and web applications, focusing on the visual and interactive elements that users see and interact with, using languages like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
