* Using Web Technologies: They utilize core web technologies such as HTML (for structure), CSS (for styling), and JavaScript (for interactivity and dynamic content).
* Ensuring Responsiveness and Usability: They focus on creating websites and applications that are responsive across different devices and browsers, and prioritize usability and accessibility.
* Collaborating with Others: They work closely with backend developers, designers, and product managers to bring ideas to life and ensure a cohesive user experience.
* Troubleshooting and Debugging: They identify and resolve issues related to the front\-end code, ensuring the website or application functions as intended.
* Staying Up\-to\-Date: They keep abreast of the latest trends and technologies in front\-end development to ensure they are using the most effective and efficient tools and techniques.
* Testing and Optimization: They test their code to ensure it works correctly and optimize it for performance and speed.
* Skills Required: HTML: Understanding of HTML structure and semantics.
* CSS: Knowledge of CSS for styling and layout. JavaScript: Proficiency in JavaScript for interactivity and dynamic content.
* Version Control: Familiarity with version control systems like Git.
* Frameworks and Libraries: Knowledge of popular front\-end frameworks and libraries (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js).
* Responsive Design: Understanding of responsive design principles and techniques.
* Problem\-Solving: Ability to identify and resolve technical issues.
* Communication: Strong communication skills to collaborate effectively with other team members.

Job Types: Full\-time, Permanent

Pay: ₹263,567\.93 \- ₹1,275,951\.52 per year

Benefits:

* Food provided

Schedule:

* Day shift

Supplemental Pay:

* Yearly bonus

