**Job Summary**

We are seeking a **Product Marketing Manager** to drive brand awareness and market positioning for our digital marketing solutions. The ideal candidate will craft compelling messaging, lead go\-to\-market strategies, and collaborate with cross\-functional teams to amplify brand visibility and engagement.

