**6\. Performance Analytics \& Optimization**

* Track and measure key performance indicators (KPIs) such as brand reach, engagement, and conversion rates.
* Use data\-driven insights to optimize campaigns and improve ROI.
* Utilize marketing automation and analytics tools (Google Analytics, HubSpot, SEMrush, etc.) to refine strategies.

