· Ensure smooth execution of promotional activities, product sampling, and consumer engagement to maximize product visibility and drive demand.

· Track post\-launch performance and consumer feedback to fine\-tune the product offering and marketing efforts.

* **Branding \& Marketing Support:**

· Work alongside the branding and marketing teams to ensure consistent product messaging across all consumer touchpoints.

· Develop product campaigns, including media, digital, and in\-store promotions, to increase consumer awareness and loyalty.

* **Quality Assurance \& Compliance:**

