* Build offline partnerships with boutiques and retailers to expand reach.

**Requirements:**

✅ **Experience in Amazon \& Myntra selling** and marketplace management.  
✅ **Proficiency in influencer marketing, social media management, and digital marketing.**  
✅ Strong understanding of **fashion trends, branding, and styling**.  
✅ Experience in **paid ads, lead generation, and brand reputation management**.  
✅ Fluent in **spoken \& written English** with excellent communication skills.  
✅ Creative mindset with strong **aesthetic and visual branding** sense.  
✅ Ability to **multitask and work in a fast\-paced environment**.

**Perks \& Benefits:**

Work with a premium fashion brand in a dynamic and creative environment.  
Exposure to **high\-end fashion events, collaborations, and influencer marketing**.  
Competitive salary with **performance\-based incentives**.

