* Coordinate with key team members to ensure timely resolution.
* Accurately record call outcomes and customer responses in the system.
* Follow up on pending cases to ensure closure within the given turnaround time (TAT).
* Educate customers about delivery timelines and process\-related queries.
* Work on reducing RTO (Return to Origin) rates by resolving delivery issues effectively.
* Maintain high customer satisfaction by handling inquiries professionally.
* Acting as a point of contact for complaints and escalating issues to the concern.
* Servicing the client after receiving the order till the time of collection of payment.

**KEY SKILLS**

* Proactive.
* Ability to rigorously follow up.
* Thorough knowledge of products/services.
* Always available on calls.
* Basic knowledge of e\-commerce logistics and delivery processes.
* Ability to handle customer queries with patience and professionalism.
* Good problem\-solving skills to resolve delivery\-related issues.
* Familiarity with CRM tools or Excel for maintaining records.
* Polite disposition.
* The ability to communicate confidently – both through speaking and writing – with colleagues and clients.

**WHY BE A PART OF “ISLIE BY PRIYA JAIN”?**

Do you feel out of place in a world full of unnecessary complexities?

Do you find joy in little things?

Are you an avid reader with a curiosity for understanding how things work and how we got here?

Do you believe life is simple and people around you are focusing on the wrong things?

Are you excited by the idea of learning new things or solving problems with the simplest solutions?

If the answer to all the above questions is yes, you are in the right place.

The world is full of unnecessary complexities, \& we, as humans, do not understand the burden of unconscious consumption.

We at “Islie by Priya Jain” believe simplicity with better basics is the way to live a fulfilling life.

**WHAT DO WE OFFER?**

* A team of empathetic problem solvers
* The Right Compensation
* Growth path to becoming a leader
* An opportunity to drive meaning with products
* A culture of continuous learning
* Freedom: freedom to explore, fail, and learn

