in-0353277710583add,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=0353277710583add,https://vashi.keka.com/careers/jobdetails/76956,Assistant Head,Vashi Integrated Solutions,"TS, IN",2025-04-12,fulltime,,,,False,"Asst. BUSINESS MANAGER  

Job Title: Assistant Business Manager
Location: Hyderabad
Reports to: Business Manager

Job Summary:
The Assistant Business Manager supports the Business Manager in promoting product sales,
coordinating with the sales team, and achieving business targets. This role involves assisting
with market research, managing client relationships, and ensuring efficient sales operations to
drive growth and profitability.  

Key Responsibilities:
1\. Product Sales and Promotion:
o Assist in handling and promoting the respective range of product sales.
o Support the Business Manager in developing strategies to increase product
sales.
2\. Coordination with Relationship Managers:
o Work closely with Relationship Managers (RMs) on the field to support
product\-related sales.
o Help manage and empower the team of Relationship Managers.
3\. Target Achievement:
o Assist in ensuring purchase targets for the region are achieved as mutually
agreed between the Segment Head and the regional RMs \& Business
Development Executives (BDE) Team.
o Support the increase of the Count of Customers (COC) for the area of product
sales in the region with the help of the local segment RM Team.
4\. Market Research and Product Improvement:
o Help manage and improve product sales based on market research and
Principal connect.
o Assist in guiding the RM Team \& BDEs to close high\-value quotations and
meet high\-value customers.
5\. Training and Development:
o Provide support in delivering regular training to the Segment Technical team
and local segment RM to improve their selling capability and negotiation
skills.
6\. Gross Profit and Inventory Management:
o Assist in ensuring the Gross Profit (GP) target for the product range is
achieved.
o Help manage inventory turnaround as per set targets for the stocks at the local
warehouse.
7\. Commercial and Financial Responsibilities:
o Support in ensuring timely collections of payments from customers as per the
credit limits and credit period assigned.
o Regularly coordinate with the Accounts Team to ensure receivables are in
good control.
8\. Customer Satisfaction:
o Assist in resolving customer complaints and ensure customer delight.  

Qualifications:
 BTech/BE in Electrical or Mechanical, Bachelor of Science (BSc), Diploma in
Electrical or Mechanical, or any Graduate.
 5\-10 years of relevant work experience in Product Sales of Wires, Cables, Motors,
Switchgears, Automation products, Bearings, Pneumatics, Solar Inverters, Lightings,
Panels, Meters, Abrasives, etc.

Website : https://vashiisl.com
