* Strong rapport\-building skills, with the ability to establish and maintain relationships with clients and colleagues.
* Good to have experience in both inside and outside sales.
* Demonstrated ability in leads generation, objection handling, and conflict resolution.

 · Consistent track record of meeting sales targets and exceeding expectations.",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Twinleaves-Retail-Ecommerce-India,Product Management
