* Provide support to resolve production incident raised by end user or by IT
* Identify the root cause of the incident by applying sound error tracing technics

**TECHNICAL \& BEHAVIORAL COMPETENCIES**
----------------------------------------

**Essential Knowledge/Skills (Mandatory) :**

* Strong hands\-on experience in Angular frontend development. Understands technologies such as

Angular , RESTful API, JavaScript, CSS,, TypeScript, Node.js., PNPM

