The Biologics Business Unit Commercial Sales Organization is comprised of highly skilled, motivated, and customer focused professionals who are technical experts on the Wyatt Technology and SEC HPLC product suites. Focus spans nanoparticle and macromolecule applications across the Pharmaceutical \& Life Sciences, Polymer, Food, Environmental, Academia and Government industries.

  



