This is a high\-ownership role that sits at the heart of Awign’s growth ambitions. You’ll lead three core marketing tracks — scaling our new initiatives, elevating our demand\-side (client\-facing) presence, and strengthening our supply\-side (gig workforce) brand. Expect to build from scratch, scale what works, and lead a cross\-functional team that shapes how the world experiences Awign.
  
* New Initiatives (New Business Lines, GTM, Experiments)
