* Sync closely with founders and product for roadmap alignment.
* Demand / Client\-Facing Marketing
* Goal: Strengthen Awign’s brand and communication for clients and enterprises.
* Launch high\-performance paid ad campaigns (Google \+ LinkedIn) focused on B2B leads.
* Refresh and manage the Website continuously with updated narratives and CTAs.
* Drive visibility through client testimonials, product videos, case studies, and webinars.
* Strengthen SEO and organic visibility in phases.
* Manage and grow our LinkedIn, YouTube, and Instagram presence.
* Roll out a professional Business WhatsApp experience.
* Collaborate with the sales team to ensure timely updates on leads, stories, and assets.
* Execute PR activities to boost brand perception in B2B circles.
* Launch and maintain a high\-quality Monthly Newsletter (High priority).
* Develop’ narratives via blog and social storytelling
* Supply / Gig Workforce / Employer Branding
* Goal: Build brand affinity and drive traffic from gig workers \& talent at scale.
* Drive relevant and sustained user traffic to www.awign.com via SEO and content.
