 **AWS Data Analyst\- Manager**


We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated Data Product Manager with 8 \-11 **years of experience as a product owner** and who is familiar with modern data stack (AWS) to join our dynamic team. As a Data Product Manager, you will be responsible for managing business stakeholders, user expectations and desired outcomes that guides the strategic decision of the data product.

