in-1a2a16e9e3a71395,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=1a2a16e9e3a71395,http://in.indeed.com/job/crm-experience-center-manager-sales-operations-1a2a16e9e3a71395,CRM & Experience Center Manager (Sales & Operations),La Italiya Interiors Pvt Ltd,"TS, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**About La Italiya**

La Italiya Interiors is a premium interior brand that combines German engineering with Italian artistry to deliver high\-end turnkey interiors. We specialize in creating elegant, functional spaces for luxury residential and commercial projects. With state\-of\-the\-art machinery and European design sensibilities, we bring precision, beauty, and customization together.

**About the Role**

We are looking for a customer\-centric, detail\-oriented CRM \& Experience Center Manager to oversee client engagement, walk\-in consultations, and day\-to\-day showroom operations. This is a full\-time, on\-site role that serves as the face of the brand for visiting clients. Your focus will be sales assistance, client coordination, and delivering an exceptional in\-store experience.

**Key Responsibilities**

* Welcome and consult walk\-in clients, understand their requirements, and guide them through our offerings
* Provide showroom walkthroughs and explain product features with a focus on premium positioning
* Coordinate with design and project teams to facilitate timely client responses
* Assist sales team in proposal generation, pricing discussions, and order tracking
* Follow up with clients via phone, WhatsApp, or email for meetings, decisions, and documentation
* Maintain showroom decorum, cleanliness, and ambiance aligned with brand aesthetics
* Schedule and coordinate client appointments, visits, and handovers
* Keep CRM updated with lead status, meeting notes, and follow\-up actions
* Provide a seamless, warm, and professional customer experience at every touchpoint

**Preferred Qualifications \& Skills**

* Bachelor’s degree in Business, Interior Design, or a related field
* Minimum 3 years of experience in showroom/retail/client\-facing sales roles
* Strong verbal communication skills in English, Hindi, and Telugu
* Excellent interpersonal skills and client rapport\-building ability
* High standards of professionalism, grooming, and hospitality
* Familiarity with interior or luxury product sales is a strong advantage
* Experience using CRM tools and basic computer applications
* Must be available for full\-time, on\-site work in Hyderabad

**Why Join La Italiya?**

* Represent a high\-end European\-inspired interior design brand
* Work in a luxurious, design\-forward showroom environment
* Engage with premium clientele and sophisticated design projects
* Be part of a customer\-first, quality\-driven culture
* Collaborate closely with design, operations, and leadership teams

Job Type: Full\-time

Pay: ₹30,000\.00 \- ₹35,000\.00 per month

Benefits:

* Cell phone reimbursement

Schedule:

* Day shift

Work Location: In person

Expected Start Date: 22/04/2025",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/La-Italiya-Interiors-Pvt-Ltd,Product Management
