ation of connected vehicle services, telematics, or infotainment systems. \- Strong expertise in V2X, 5G, LTE, Wi\-Fi, Bluetooth, GNSS, and IoT protocols. \- Hands\-on experience with test automation frameworks, cloud\-based validation, and vehicle network simulation. \- Proficiency in Python, C\+\+, or Java for test automation and scripting. \- Knowledge of AUTOSAR, MQTT, REST APIs, CAN, Ethernet, and TCP/IP protocols. \- Experience with cybersecurity testing for connected vehicles and compliance with ISO 21434 \& UNECE WP.29\. \- Familiarity with Over\-the\-Air (OTA) updates, backend integration, and data security protocols. \- Strong problem\-solving and analytical skills with a deep understanding of cloud\-based automotive platforms. Preferred Certifications: \- ISTQB Advanced Level – Test Manager or equivalent certification. \- AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud Certification for cloud\-based validation expertise. Additional Information: \- The candidate should have a minimum of 12 years of experience in Automotive Mobility Services \& Connected Vehicles. \- This position is based at our Bengaluru office. \- A 15 years full time education is required.


  

