* Advanced degree in technical or business field, MBA helpful.

**Location Note**



This role is based in Bengaluru and follows a hybrid model, requiring you to be in the office 2\-3 days a week. The engineering team for this role is based out of India, whilst the collaborating teams, and other cross functional leads are US based, so you should be comfortable being available (as are India PMs) for meetings 9\-11a Pacific time, three days a week. As a people manager, there may be additional days required depending on strategic urgency.



