* Strong systems thinking and ability to design at both micro and macro levels
* Ability to facilitate discussions, drive alignment, and make tradeoff decisions
* Familiarity with designing for internal tools, SaaS, or B2B platforms",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Uber,Product Management
