Join Opinary, a part of Affinity Global Inc., a leading international AdTech powerhouse headquartered in Mumbai and Chicago. We're at the forefront of audience engagement, empowering publishers like the Financial Times, NBC Universal, Yahoo, and The Times of London with our award\-winning AI polling software. We help publishers capture real\-time opinions, collect valuable first\-party data, and monetize their content.


We're seeking a seasoned (Senior) Publisher Sales Manager to spearhead our expansion across Europe and the UK, focusing on our revolutionary Flex Poll product.

**Your Mission:**

* Proactively identify, qualify, and convert a target list of 10M\+ page views per month publishers to Opinary's Flex Poll.
