Join our engineering team to help us build and innovate great products on our Insight platform using the latest technologies to make the world a safer digital space.

**About the Role**


As a Platform Operations Engineering Manager you will be responsible for managing the day\-to\-day operations. First and foremost, you will coach and grow the individuals on your team so they feel supported and engaged. You will also be responsible for keeping track of the projects the teams are working on, facilitating cross\-team discussions when necessary and deciding on the future direction of the team (what projects they will focus on next). You will collaborate with UX, Product and other development teams to deliver best\-in\-class solutions for our customers.

**In this role, you will:**

* Directly manage a team of Platform Operations Engineers by coaching and growing their skills, identifying growth areas, setting expectations and providing feedback
* Manage projects and socialize progress across engineering teams and leadership
