* 10\+ years of experience in software engineering, with at least 3\+ years of experience in a hands\-on managerial role
* Previous experience in managing engaged and high performing software engineering teams with a track record in developing and mentoring software engineers at all levels
* A demonstrable passion for all things software engineering with a solid understanding of the software development lifecycle
* Strong design and problem\-solving skills with a focus on quality, security, and performance.
* Experience working with remote teams and individuals while ensuring agility and velocity.
* Background in optimizing platform operations or experience driving standardization initiatives
* Ability to communicate and articulate crisply at all levels from executive staff to engineers.
