in-94261083c3a2d9f2,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=94261083c3a2d9f2,http://in.indeed.com/job/ux-developer-94261083c3a2d9f2,UX Developer,Arosys Technologies P Ltd,"OR, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**UX Developer**

**Company:** Vyakar Technology Pvt. Ltd.  
**Location:** Bhilai,Chhattisgarh (Onsite)  
**Employment Type:** Full\-time  
**Experience Level:** 3 \+Years

**About Vyakar Technology Pvt. Ltd.**

Vyakar is a fast\-growing technology company transforming the way businesses manage and optimize their lead routing, account matching, and revenue operations. We build intelligent, scalable, and enterprise\-grade solutions that help companies drive better performance and ROI from their sales and marketing efforts.

**Job Overview**

We are looking for a passionate and detail\-oriented **UX Developer** to join our product team. As a key member, you will be responsible for developing and implementing exceptional user experiences across our web\-based applications. You should have a strong grasp of modern UX principles, frontend development, and a deep understanding of user behavior.

**Key Responsibilities**

* Collaborate with product managers, developers, and stakeholders to translate user needs into intuitive designs.
* Create wireframes, prototypes, and high\-fidelity mockups for web applications.
* Develop and maintain responsive, accessible, and visually appealing UIs using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frontend frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, Vue).
* Conduct user research, usability testing, and analyze feedback to iterate on designs.
* Advocate for UX best practices, accessibility standards, and design consistency.
* Optimize application performance and ensure cross\-browser compatibility.
* Work closely with backend developers to ensure seamless integration between front\-end and back\-end components.

**Required Skills \& Qualifications**

* 3\+ years of experience in UX/UI design and frontend development.
* Proficiency in tools like Figma, Adobe XD, or Sketch for design and prototyping.
* Strong knowledge of HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and responsive design frameworks.
* Experience with React (preferred) or other JavaScript frameworks.
* Understanding of UX research methodologies and user\-centered design.
* Familiarity with version control systems like Git.
* Strong problem\-solving skills and attention to detail.
* Excellent communication and collaboration skills.

**Preferred Qualifications**

* Experience in B2B SaaS products or enterprise applications.
* Knowledge of accessibility guidelines (WCAG) and best practices.
* Familiarity with Agile/Scrum development methodologies.
* Background in psychology, human\-computer interaction (HCI), or a related field.

**What We Offer**

* Competitive salary and performance\-based bonuses.
* A collaborative and innovation\-driven environment.
* Opportunities for professional growth and continuous learning.
* Be a part of a team that values creativity, ownership, and user\-first thinking.

**To Apply:**  
Send your resume, portfolio, and a short note on why you’d be a great fit to **email \- anisha.sagar@arosys.com or application link\- https://forms.gle/gvP8TRqhTLKaHbfB7**

