in-448b14546a9fbd9d,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=448b14546a9fbd9d,http://in.indeed.com/job/seo-manager-448b14546a9fbd9d,SEO Manager,"Agile Soft Systems, Inc","PB, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**Job description**

**Job Title:** Marketing Manager (SEO Manager)  
**Company:** Agile Soft Systems  
**Location:** Mohali Punjab  
**Job Type:** Full\-time

**Job Summary:**

We are seeking a highly motivated and results\-driven **SEO Manager** to lead our search engine optimization efforts. The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of SEO best practices, algorithm updates, and content strategies that drive organic traffic and improve search rankings. You will collaborate with cross\-functional teams to enhance our digital presence and ensure continuous growth.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Develop and execute comprehensive SEO strategies to improve organic search rankings, traffic, and conversions.
* Conduct keyword research, competitive analysis, and content gap analysis to identify opportunities.
* Optimize website structure, on\-page elements, and content to enhance search visibility.
* Monitor and analyze website performance metrics using tools such as Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush, Ahrefs, etc.
* Manage technical SEO, including site audits, crawlability, and indexation improvements.
* Collaborate with content, marketing, and development teams to implement SEO best practices.
* Stay up\-to\-date with search engine algorithms and industry trends to adapt strategies accordingly.
* Build and execute link\-building strategies to improve domain authority.
* Develop and manage SEO reporting and performance tracking.
* Ensure website compliance with SEO best practices, including mobile optimization and Core Web Vitals.

**Required Skills \& Qualifications:**

* Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Computer Science, or a related field.
* 7\+ years of proven experience in SEO, preferably in an IT services company.
* Strong understanding of search engine algorithms, ranking factors, and SEO tools.
* Proficiency in Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush, Ahrefs, Moz, and other SEO tools.
* Hands\-on experience with technical SEO, site audits, and structured data.
* Ability to develop and execute link\-building strategies.
* Excellent analytical, problem\-solving, and communication skills.
* Familiarity with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript is a plus.

**About Agile Soft Systems:**

Agile Soft Systems is a professional IT Services company based in Silicon Valley (Fremont, CA) with off\-shore development centers in India. Agile Soft Systems has earned a reputation as an end\-to\-end IT Services \& development firm that excels in a fast\-paced technology marketplace.

Agile Soft Systems extensive domain expertise makes leading ISV’s across the globe, from various industry sectors, choose it as their strategic outsourcing and product development partner.

**Why Join Agile Soft Systems?**

* Work with a dynamic and innovative team in a fast\-growing IT services company.
* Opportunities for career growth and professional development.
* Competitive salary and benefits package.
* Collaborative work environment with a focus on continuous learning.

If you are passionate about SEO and want to make a significant impact, we’d love to hear from you! Apply now and be part of our growth journey.

**\*\* If you are looking for job change, please share your profile at atulag@agsft.com.**

