We are seeking a dynamic and experienced Marketing Manager to lead the marketing initiatives for our aquaculture business in India. This role will be responsible for driving brand visibility, market development, and customer engagement for our range of aquaculture products and services. The ideal candidate will have a solid background in B2B or B2C marketing within the aquaculture and feed sector, and a passion for driving sustainable growth in the industry.

