· Excellent communication and presentation skills in English and at least one regional language.

· Ability to travel extensively across regions to support field marketing efforts.

**Preferred Qualifications**

· Experience working directly with aquaculture farmers, hatcheries, or feed mills.

· Prior experience launching or promoting aquaculture\-related products (feed, probiotics, farm equipment, etc.).

· Knowledge of aquaculture supply chains, farmer behavior, and seasonal cycles.

**What We Offer**

