in-bec086c4e4c49d02,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=bec086c4e4c49d02,http://in.indeed.com/job/sales-manager-cum-tender-executive-psu-liaison-bec086c4e4c49d02,Sales Manager cum Tender Executive – PSU Liaison,Sun Bizcon,"HR, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**Job Title: Sales Manager cum Tender Executive – PSU Liaison**  
**Location:** Gurgaon  
**Experience Required:** 3–4 Years  
**Employment Type:** Full\-Time, On\-Site

We are looking for a proactive and detail\-oriented **Sales Manager cum Tender Executive** to manage institutional sales and handle the complete tendering process with **Public Sector Undertakings (PSUs)**. This dual\-role demands a balance of business development skills and expertise in government bidding procedures.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Identify and pursue business opportunities with PSUs, government departments, and large institutional buyers
* Monitor tender portals such as GeM, CPPP, eProcurement, and state government sites for relevant opportunities
* Prepare and manage the end\-to\-end bidding process, including documentation, pricing, technical compliance, and timely submissions
* Liaise with PSU procurement teams and government officials to ensure smooth tender participation and post\-bid follow\-ups
* Ensure all compliance\-related documents (EMD, performance BG, certifications, etc.) are accurate and up to date
* Coordinate with internal teams (product, finance, legal, operations) to align bids with organizational capabilities
* Maintain a well\-documented tracker of all tenders submitted, awarded, under review, and lost, with feedback and learnings
* Negotiate and convert tender wins into revenue\-generating business contracts
* Ensure timely execution of orders and maintain post\-sale relationships with PSU clients

**Candidate Requirements:**

* 3–4 years of experience in government tendering and B2B sales, preferably involving PSU clients
* Strong familiarity with e\-tendering platforms and government procurement procedures
* Excellent communication and relationship management skills
* Strong documentation, compliance, and coordination abilities
* Proficiency in MS Office tools (Excel, Word, PowerPoint)
* Bachelor's degree in Business Administration, Engineering, or related field

**Preferred Qualifications:**

* Experience with government or institutional sales in industries like solar, electricals, infrastructure, or manufacturing
* Working knowledge of government taxation, pricing norms, and contractual terms
* Experience with GeM portal and registration processes

**Why Join Us:**  
Join a growth\-focused team in Gurgaon where your expertise in sales and tendering will directly impact our success in the public sector. If you're looking for a role that combines relationship\-building with process excellence, this is the opportunity for you.

Please write us at sunbizcon@gmail.com

