We are a growing luxury hair extensions and wigs brand dedicated to providing Human premium\-quality products that enhance beauty, confidence, and self\-expression. With a strong focus on customer satisfaction and brand excellence, we are looking for a passionate and creative **Social Media Marketing cum Manager** to join our team and take our online and offline presence to the next level .

**Role Overview:**

As our **Social Media Marketing cum Manager**, you will be responsible for planning, creating, and executing social media strategies that build brand awareness, drive engagement, and increase sales. You should have a deep understanding of beauty/fashion trends, know how to create viral content, and be confident managing a brand’s voice across all major platforms.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Develop and implement an effective social media strategy aligned with our brand identity and goals
* Manage and grow our social media platforms (Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, YouTube, Pinterest, etc.)
* Create and schedule engaging, high\-quality content (images, Reels, videos, stories, captions, etc.)
* Collaborate with influencers, brand ambassadors, and hair stylists for partnerships and user\-generated content
* Monitor social trends, hashtags, and competitors to keep the brand relevant and ahead of trends
* Run and optimize social media ad campaigns (Meta Ads, TikTok Ads, etc.)
* Engage with followers, respond to comments/messages, and build a strong community
* Analyze performance metrics (engagement, reach, conversions) and report monthly insights and recommendations
* Assist with content planning for product launches, campaigns, and promotions
* Oversee content shoots, product photos/videos when necessary
* Maintain brand consistency in tone, style, and messaging across all platforms

**Requirements:**

* Proven experience managing social media for a beauty, fashion, or lifestyle brand
* Strong understanding of social media platforms, especially TikTok and Instagram
* Skills in content creation – photography, videography, editing (Canva, CapCut, Adobe Suite, etc.)
* Knowledge of paid advertising (Meta Ads, TikTok Ads Manager)
* Creative thinker with strong writing and storytelling abilities
* Organized, detail\-oriented, and self\-driven
* Familiarity with influencer marketing and user\-generated content
* Bonus: Experience with Shopify, Klaviyo, email marketing, or website content management

**What We Offer:**

* Opportunity to work with a passionate and empowering brand in the beauty industry
* Creative freedom and room to experiment
* Competitive compensation and performance\-based bonuses
* Flexible work schedule (for remote/freelance roles)
* Growth potential within the company

**How to Apply:**

Please send your resume, portfolio (or samples of past work), and a brief note on why you're perfect for this role to Hairhaux@gmail.com or Contact us on 9876509093 .

