 **Job Description** **Introduction:** In Data \& Analytics practice, we are looking for candidates with 5\-9 years of experience in Sales Force Effectiveness (SFE), Dashboard reporting and Incentive Compensation (IC) analytics domain. The candidates should have strong analytical capabilities and can provide data driven solutions to our global pharma clients.

