in-cae8909d7d2ad6a8,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=cae8909d7d2ad6a8,http://in.indeed.com/job/luxury-sales-manager-cae8909d7d2ad6a8,Luxury Sales Manager,Qwerty INK,"MH, IN",2025-04-11,fulltime,,,,False,"**Job Description: Sales Manager \- The Qwerty Ink Incubator**

**About Us:**  
The Qwerty Ink is a global brand management firm established in 2016, specializing in end\-to\-end brand strategies and solutions for businesses ranging from emerging startups to multinational corporations (MNCs). We have successfully helped countless businesses streamline their brand story and achieve greater returns. We are now expanding our operations and recruiting for **The Qwerty Incubator**, a pioneering division that will be managed by a dynamic, self\-sufficient team of front and back\-end executives overseeing the full lifecycle of incubated brands.

**Role Overview:**  
As a **Sales Manager** at The Qwerty Ink Incubator, you will be at the forefront of driving sales growth, establishing and nurturing business relationships, and achieving monthly sales targets per brand. We are seeking a highly motivated, results\-driven professional with a strong sales acumen and a proven track record in B2B sales. This role is critical in shaping and scaling the success of the brands within our incubator.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* **Sales Target Achievement:** Consistently meet or exceed monthly sales targets by selling the designated number of products for each brand within the incubator.
* **Pipeline Management:** Create, maintain, and manage the sales pipeline by ensuring the CRM setup is completed on time and keeping all records updated for real\-time tracking.
* **Lead Generation:** Generate a substantial number of qualified leads each month to ensure a healthy and robust sales funnel.
* **Industry Representation:** Attend and actively participate in industry events, conferences, and networking opportunities to represent the company and generate new business opportunities.
* **Sales Pitch Refinement:** Continuously improve sales pitch effectiveness based on client feedback, adapting strategies to increase conversion rates.
* **Performance Tracking:** Track progress towards sales goals and monitor pipeline hygiene to ensure consistent and efficient sales processes.
* **Client \& Partner Acquisition:** Successfully negotiate and close deals with potential clients and partners, contributing to the expansion of the brand portfolio.
* **Deal Optimization:** Implement effective sales strategies to increase the average value of closed deals, maximizing revenue generation.
* **Event Coordination:** Identify, shortlist, and organize events that align with each brand’s target market and goals, ensuring optimal exposure and engagement.
* **Pop\-Up Events Coordination:** Onboard and manage F\&B establishments for pop\-up events, ensuring smooth operations and brand representation.
* **Team Development:** Recruit, onboard, and train individuals for Qwerty’s Promoter Partnership and Affiliate Program to enhance brand outreach and engagement.
* **Process Creation:** Design and implement backend processes to ensure seamless operations and collaboration across all incubated brands.

**Requirements:**

