**Position Type:** Regular \- Full\-Time


**Position Location:** New Delhi

**Requisition ID:** 33023

 **JOB PURPOSE:**


As the SAP S/4HANA Basis Engineer, you will be responsible for overseeing the technical architecture, operations, and strategic planning of our SAP S/4HANA environment. You will Engineer Basis function and collaborate with key stakeholders to ensure the successful implementation, maintenance, and optimization of our S4/Hana systems.

 **KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:**

* Your activities will be divided between daily Operational activities (e.g., daily health checks of SAP systems, database administration, client maintenance activities, performance tuning, applying Support Packages \& kernel updates) and Project activities (e.g., installations, upgrades, and data migrations) and creating documentation and work instructions.
* Strong HANA experience and BASIS tech skills in Net weaver concepts and products (ERP or S/4 HANA, BW, PI, FIORI, Solution Manager, BODS, BOBJ, Cloud Connector)
* Should be able to carry out an audit of any SAP/HANA system to identify the bottlenecks and to do recommendations to improve the performance.
* Design, develop and maintain scripts for automation and maintenance of DB Environments
* Collaborates effectively with peer engineers, developers to solve complex problems.
* The candidate must be able to communicate clearly and with ease with all relevant stakeholders.
* Strong Experience with HANA XS/Experience on SAP HANA Administration / Operations
* You should be familiar with SAP Solution Manager, Fiori, SSO, SLD, Web Dispatcher, Load Balancers, Firewalls etc.
* Working knowledge of high availability and disaster recovery environments, as well as OS level clustering.
* Experience in HANA HA and DR Setup.
* You will ensure service availability 7 x 24, service quality for our support.
* Ability to understand the long\-term (""big picture"") and short\-term perspectives of situations.

 **KEY QUALIFICATION \& EXPERIENCES:**

* Bachelor's degree in computer science, information technology, or a related field
* Minimum 12\+ years of SAP experience working across a range of SAP implementations, upgrade, conversion, and migration projects. Experience in SAP RISE/GROW is preferred.
* Ability to manage multiple tasks, work in a team, multi\-party/vendor environment, understand and be responsive to project and customer needs.
* MUST have hands on experience on Upgrades, Add\-on Installations, HANA Scale\-out environment and well versed with multi\-tenant DBs.
* Deep knowledge of System Architecture, HANA Technology including High Availability and Disaster Recovery. Backup and Recovery.
* Experience on UX \& Business Technology Platform (BTP) including Cloud Security and Architecture: Single Sign\-ON, Infrastructure Security, HANA
* Experience in Solution Manager
* Infrastructure Knowledge: Working knowledge of various Operating systems esp. Linux, Windows, Sybase. Knowledge of Basic network architecture, Experience in SAP Sizing
* Experienced with typical support activities including preventive maintenance.
* SAP Certification and Hyperscaler Certifications (AWS/GCP/Azure) is an added advantage.
* Strong leadership and communication skills, with the ability to effectively engage and influence stakeholders at all levels of the organization.
* Proven ability to work effectively in a fast\-paced, dynamic environment with multiple stakeholders and competing priorities.

  



