Full Stack Development: Guide and participate in both front\-end and back\-end development, utilizing frameworks like React, Node.js, and FastAPI.


Database Management: Manage complex data models, ensuring data consistency, optimization, and performance with PostgreSQL and MongoDB.


Cloud Strategy: Lead the deployment, scaling, and maintenance of cloud\-native applications using AWS services.


Code Quality and Standards: Establish coding best practices, perform regular code reviews, and ensure adherence to quality standards.


API Development: Lead the design and integration of RESTful APIs to ensure seamless front\-end and back\-end communication.


Performance Optimization: Identify bottlenecks, troubleshoot, and optimize applications to ensure efficiency and scalability.


DevOps Enablement: Implement and manage CI/CD pipelines to improve development, testing, and deployment efficiency


Security Leadership: Champion the adoption of robust security practices, ensuring applications meet security standards and are resilient to vulnerabilities.


Documentation: Ensure comprehensive documentation of architectural decisions, workflows, and processes for future reference.


