Programming Languages: Expertise in JavaScript (Node.js) and Python.


Front\-End Frameworks: Advanced knowledge of React.


Back\-End Frameworks: Extensive experience with Express.js and knowledge of FastAPI.


Databases: Proficient in PostgreSQL and MongoDB, including schema design and optimization.


Cloud Platforms: In\-depth knowledge of AWS services such as EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, and CloudFormation.


API Development: Deep understanding of RESTful API development, integration, and best practices.


DevOps: Proven experience with CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and Kubernetes.


Caching Technologies: Experience with Redis for performance optimization.


Server Management: Proficiency with Nginx and Linux\-based systems.


Agile Methodology: Strong understanding of Agile development processes, including SCRUM.


Version Control: Expertise with Git and branching strategies.


### **Preferred Skills:**


Familiarity with microservices architecture and serverless technologies.


Exposure to AI/ML pipelines and data engineering tools.


Hands\-on experience with advanced CI/CD setups and infrastructure as code (e.g., Terraform).


### **Soft Skills:**


Exceptional problem\-solving skills and attention to detail.


Excellent communication and stakeholder management abilities.


Adaptability to evolving business needs and technological advancements.


Strong organizational and time management skills with the ability to prioritize effectively.


A self\-starter with a proactive attitude and a commitment to continuous learning.",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Recruber-4,Product Management
