At SAP, we enable you to bring out your best. Our company culture is focused on collaboration and a shared passion to help the world run better. How? We focus every day on building the foundation for tomorrow and creating a workplace that embraces differences, values flexibility, and is aligned to our purpose\-driven and future\-focused work. We offer a highly collaborative, caring team environment with a strong focus on learning and development, recognition for your individual contributions, and a variety of benefit options for you to choose from.

**What you’ll do**

  

For 2\-5 years

  

* Should have strong BASIS fundamentals
* Hand's on Experience in either upgrade (1\-2\) or implementation (1\-2\) of SAP Systems
	+ Upgrade includes \- Release upgrades
	+ Implementations \- Installation of HANA Databases , Applications \- S4HANA , ERP , CRM etc
* Migration experience is a must include \- Backup/Restore or Export/Import (HSR would be a big plus)
* Hands\-on experience in executing large End\-to\-End Implementations and/or large Cloud Migrations of SAP Applications, HANA Database Migration, Upgrades, OS/DB Migrations, S/4HANA Conversion Projects etc.
* Experience in Designing SAP System Landscape, Defining Implementation or Migration Strategies \& Detailed Planning is big plus
* Ability to assist team members in the development and implementation of technical solutions (Implementations, Upgrades and Migrations)
* Good knowledge and understanding of SAP Application Security, Single Sign\-ON Technologies, Infrastructure Security, High Availability, Disaster Recovery etc. will be a big plus
* Good knowledge and understanding of new dimensional SAP products, Technologies and Methodologies (S/4HANA, SAP BTP, BIGDATA, SDI , SLT , ILM)
* Provide technical product expertise, consulting support to SAP customer
* Responsible for maintaining a high degree of customer satisfaction in addition to growing and developing reference able customers
* Ability to manage multiple tasks, work in a team environment, understand and be responsive to project and customer needs
* Ability to adapt and function effectively in a fast\-paced, changing environment while working under deadlines
* A record of taking initiatives, driving results and accepting increasing levels of responsibility
* Build credible relationships with peers and clients, and continuous professional learning of SAP products
* Ability to learn quickly and apply knowledge effectively
* Experience in SAP Solution Manager 7\.2 setups for Technical Monitoring scenarios including BPM, Interface Monitoring
* Experience in SAP Solution Manager 7\.2 Focused Build, Focused Run, Process \& Project Management, Test Management, IT Service Management, Change Control Management etc.
* Knowledge and understanding of CLOUD ALM will be a big plus
* Own / Acquire relevant SAP Business AI skills to position / deliver SAP’s AI offerings to our customers
* Enhance adoption/ consumption of various SAP AI offerings in customer use cases

  

Additional Skillsets (One or more combination from the below)

  

* Good knowledge and understanding of SAP Authorization \& Authentication concepts \& technologies and also of SAP GRC Suites of Products including AC, IDM etc, will be big plus
* Good knowledge, understanding and hands\-on experience of SAP Cloud Platform capabilities around Identity Authentication Services, Identity Provisioning Services etc. will be big plus
* Knowledge and understanding IOT \& Edge Technologies, BIGDATA, Machine Learning etc. will be big plus
* Technical coding knowledge in Shell Scripts, SQL, JavaScript and any one of programming language like JAVA or Python is a big plus

 **What you bring**

  

Education \& Qualifications / Skills \& Competencies

  

* Bachelors or Master’s degree in: Information Systems, Engineering, Computer Science or similar degree
* Analytical, results\-driven and have a solution\-oriented approach
* Must be open to travel on short notice. (Long term or Short term)
* SAP Certifications (NetWeaver, HANA, OSDB – or a combination of these)
* AWS/Azure/Google Cloud : Solution or Architect certifications

  

Technical Skills

  

* Good working knowledge of databases like HANA, Oracle, MS SQL Server, Sybase ASE, MaxDB, DB2 etc.
* Experience in working with SAP Applications viz. S/4HANA , SAP Fiori, SAP ERP, SAP Solution Manager, SAP GRC, ETD, SAP PI/PO, SAP BW/4HANA, SAP Analytics Cloud, SAP CPI, SAP NetWeaver etc.(Combinations of these)
* Experience in Technical setup of BTP services
* Working knowledge of Operating Systems (Windows, UNIX, Linux, OS/400, etc.)
* Technical skills in SQL, Database (SQL) knowledge, database management, Architecting, Advisory

  

Work Experience

  

* Require 2\-5 years of work experience for various job levels
* Hands\-on experience in OS/DB migrations (On\-premise /cloud), Unicode conversions, S/4HANA System conversions \& Upgrades and implementations (Pure end user support profile \- Application Maintenance Support EMS \- need not apply)

 **Location** \- Gurgaon / Bangalore

  

