in-ca8b140fe7d07521,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=ca8b140fe7d07521,http://in.indeed.com/job/business-development-manager-bdm-ca8b140fe7d07521,Business Development Manager (BDM),Stedaxis,"Nagercoil, TN, IN",2025-04-10,fulltime,,,,False,"**JOB SUMMARY:**

We are seeking a dynamic and result\-oriented Business Development Manager responsible for identifying and creating new business opportunities, building relationship with potential clients, and driving growth for the organisation.

