in-9431867ff5f3ccac,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=9431867ff5f3ccac,https://armman.org/join-our-team/#,Product Manager - Mumbai and Delhi,ARMMAN,"MH, IN",2025-04-10,,,,,False,"We are looking for an experienced Product Manager to drive the design and development of our mHealth / digital health products focused on pregnant women, mothers and their children, as well as health workers. You will work closely with public health professionals, program implementation experts, engineers, designers, and researchers.



ARMMAN is developing an innovation process that is human\-centered, data\-driven and evidence\-based, leveraging emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence / Machine Learning and Large Language Models to make our programmes more engaging and effective. This role is a unique, high\-impact opportunity to use technology to improve the lives of millions of women and children.


