**About the Role** Responsible for supporting Marketing’s effective use of web and email tools. Oversees delivery of new features and developments through both direct execution and business support for projects led elsewhere. Provides advanced technical support to marketing and marketing operations teams, ensuring websites perform as expected, monitoring KPIs, and meeting SLAs.


