	+ Own and complete tasks within a project effectively and efficiently following best\-practice approaches.
* **Handle technical queries from campaigns and operations teams**


	+ Answer or escalate queries to the Senior Development Manager if additional technical expertise is required.
	+ Respond to queries in a timely manner.
* **Ensure routine maintenance and testing of marketing\-owned websites**


	+ Carry out web maintenance and support tasks regularly and on time.
	+ Maintain a record of all tasks and make it available to the Senior Development Manager.
* **Develop and share best\-practice guidelines and support materials**


	+ Create and communicate support materials effectively.
	+ Seek opportunities to improve workflows, such as developing new automation agents.
**Skills, Knowledge, and Experience**


* **Attributes:**


	+ Excellent IT skills
	+ Experience working with a large website in a content editor or product owner role
	+ Knowledge of latest web standards (AI, accessibility, CX, design, and legal)
	+ Experience working with developers to create new web features and templates (for WordPress or other CMS systems)
	+ Basic understanding of Email Marketing platforms
	+ Good data management skills
	+ Written and verbal communication skills
	+ Project and time management skills
* **Skills \& Knowledge:**


	+ Knowledge of web marketing approaches/tools (SEO, ABM, Google Analytics, SMS, etc.)
