Baker Hughes is the first and only comprehensive provider of digital oilfield products, services and solutions. Drawing inspiration from its rich heritage as an inventor company, Baker Hughes harnesses the passion and expertise of its people to improve productivity throughout the entire oil and gas value chain.

 **Partner with the best**

  

As a resource you will be part of Internal SAP Technical team and will be responsible for ABAP developments in SAP ERP. The Internal team is owner and custodian of all custom developments in SAP system. The team handles various types of SAP related initiatives like roll outs, implementation, upgrade, support, enhancements, and Integrations.

  

