* Participating in complete SAP projects / rollouts, will be involved in projects and support initiatives.
* Collaborating with Technical and Functional leads, Project Managers, and cross functional stakeholders/partners for development activities.
* Demonstrating and maintaining a commitment to quality, security, efficiency, and maintainability.
* Coordinating process design or re\-engineering with project manager and communicating in an ever changing, highly matrixed organization.
* Designing and implementing codes test and maintaining automated and manual processes in support of business needs and/or corporate strategy.
* Translating business requirements into technical design documentation, additional responsibilities include code and design review of IT applications.

 **Fuel your passion**

  

