As a Global Product Manager of InterConnect® Platforms, you will help to drive the product strategy and roadmaps, while executing on the Initiatives for the platform for various regions around the globe. InterConnect® is Equifax’s flagship online decision platform that automates the orchestration of data, analytical models and decision policies for lending institutions. It is supported by several applications, many of which this role will be responsible for managing. The right candidate will have a technical background with strong experience managing UI applications and workflow services, with at least some exposure to MLOps and data modeling (AI/ML). The right candidate must also be experienced in gathering business requirements from markets and internal user groups remotely, with the ability to tie these requirements to the platform.


