\- 1 Year (preferred)

\- Diploma or Certification in Marketing

**Language:**

\- English (Preferred)

**How to Apply:**

If you are passionate about Marketing and eager to gain experience in a creative industry, we would love to hear from you. To apply, please send your resume and a cover letter detailing your interest in the Social Media Marketing Intern position to hr@studio1emporio.com.

