* Excellent Knowledge on \#IBMMQ ,\#Oracle notification service and Oracle function call in ACE
* Deep knowledge on \#ESQL, \#XSLT, \#DFDL, \#WSDL, \#XML, \#SOAP, \#IMAP. Oracle and \#REST protocols.
* Good in ESQL coding mapping nodes and transformations
* Should be capable of Performance optimization.
* Proficient in \#Corejava, \#MS\-SQL and Oracle \#SQL database with strong SQL querying skills.
* Good understanding of On\-Prem, Cloud and Hybrid integrations

