data\-driven decision\-making.

* Present findings and recommendations to stakeholders, including executive

leadership.

* Continuously monitor and optimize AI models in production, implementing

improvements as needed.

* Collaborate with data engineers to build efficient data pipelines and ensure high

quality datasets for model training and evaluation.

* Stay updated with the latest AI and data science advancements, incorporating new

methodologies into projects.

* Mentor junior data scientists and contribute to best practices and team development.
* Work closely with the MLOps team to ensure seamless model deployment and

integration into production environments.

* Create and maintain documentation, including model specifications, data

dictionaries, and user guides.

