learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch).

* Expertise in supervised and unsupervised learning, deep learning, and natural

language processing (NLP).

* Proven ability to develop and deploy machine learning models in production

environments.

* Experience with big data technologies (e.g., Spark, Hadoop) and cloud platforms

(e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP).

* Strong foundation in statistical analysis, experimental design, and A/B testing.
* Excellent problem\-solving skills, with the ability to translate complex business

problems into AI solutions.

* Strong communication skills, capable of explaining technical concepts to non

technical stakeholders.

* Experience with version control systems (e.g., Git) and collaborative development

practices.

* Familiarity with MLOps practices and tools for model deployment, monitoring, and

automation.

* Knowledge of data privacy regulations and ethical considerations in AI

development.

* Prior experience mentoring junior data scientists and contributing to team growth.
* Ability to thrive in a fast\-paced, collaborative environment and manage multiple

projects simultaneously.

Additional Requirements:

* Self\-motivated, highly organized, and analytical thinker with a passion for solving

complex AI challenges.

* Strong adaptability and willingness to learn and experiment with emerging AI

technologies

