* Possess strong analytical and problem\-solving skills.
* Demonstrate excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively in a team environment.


Primary skills:* Natural Language Processing (NLP): Hands\-on experience in use case classification, topic modeling, Q\&A and chatbots, search, Document AI, summarization, and content generation.
