**About S\&C Global Network \- Data \& AI**: \-


Accenture Global Network \- Data \& AI practice help our clients grow their business in entirely new ways. We enable our clients to achieve high performance through insights from data \- insights that inform better decisions and help grow their business in entirely new ways through the power of Artificial Intelligence. From strategy to execution, Accenture works with organizations to develop advanced analytic capabilities. This includes everything from accessing and reporting on data to building and deploying predictive models and implementing Generative AI solutions.

**WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU?**

