The ideal AI/ML Ops Lead will have a strong background in artificial intelligence, machine learning, and deep learning, with a specific focus on supporting AI opportunities in the organization. This role will work closely with data scientists, data engineers, AI/ML engineers, and other cross\-functional teams to ensure AI systems are seamlessly integrated across the organization’s operations, ensuring that productionalized AI solutions are scalable, accurate, secure, and compliant with established standards and governance. The ideal candidate will also be responsible for enhancing existing AI Solutions in cloud\-based environments and with integration into various platforms, including websites and Tableau dashboards.

