Training and/or deep experience in mathematical concepts underlying statistics, machine\-learning, algorithms, and data structures.  

Intermediate to Expert programming skills in at least one of Python, C, Scala.  

Experience working with large datasets using tools like PySpark.  

Experience in Java/Python  

Experience in building and deploying models as micro\-services.  

