**Job Summary**

We are seeking an experienced and skilled AI Trainer to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and delivering high\-quality training programs for our AI models. The AI Trainer will work closely with our data science team to develop and implement AI solutions that meet business objectives.

