Ethos is seeking a Senior Data Analyst Engineer to join our Enterprise Systems team and help drive data operations Sales, Marketing, and Product teams. As a Senior Data Analyst Engineer, you will play a critical role in transforming raw data into actionable insights that drive business growth. If you have a passion for data analysis, development, and are proficient in SQL, DBT \& data modeling, we encourage you to apply.


