Job Summary :  

We're seeking an Data Scientist to join our agile, cross\-functional team as a key contributor. As a Data Scientist, you will help build data\-driven solutions to drive business outcomes. You will work with your team and manager on advanced analytics and DS modelling projects from inception to production, collaborating with stakeholders to deliver high\-impact results.


