Position Overview

At BlueKaktus, we're leveraging cutting\-edge cloud technology to transform the $3 trillion Fashion \& Lifestyle industry. As a Product Analyst, you will play a pivotal role in shaping our product roadmap within the dynamic fashion technology landscape. Your expertise in AI technologies will be instrumental in driving product innovation and enhancing efficiency.

