6\. Strategic Vision \& Collaboration

* Translate AI innovations into practical, user\-focused product features through cross\-functional collaboration.
* Align stakeholders with strong communication and a clear product vision.

\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_

Required Qualifications

