Technical Skills

* Proficiency in AI design/analysis tools like Figma, Cursor, etc.
* Strong coding ability (Python, R, or similar).
* Solid understanding of data analytics, machine learning, and AI applications.

Methodologies

* Familiarity with Agile development and product lifecycle management.

\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_

Screening Process

