* Recognition through the Kudos Platform and Referral Rewards.

**WHY CHOOSE US:**  

  

Flutter is an **equal\-opportunity employer** and values the unique perspectives and experiences that everyone brings. Our message to colleagues and stakeholders is clear: everyone is welcome, and every voice matters. We have ambitious growth plans and goals for the future. Here's an opportunity for you to play a pivotal role in shaping the future of Flutter Entertainment India.",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE3381369.htm,Data Science
