* Familiarity with business process automation tools (e.g., Power Automate, Zapier).

  

JATO Dynamics is a global business and our success is attributed to the diversity, skills and experiences of our colleagues across the world. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, sex, age, gender identity, sexual orientation, religion or belief, disability, marital status or veteran status.",,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/Overview/W-EI_IE145360.htm,Data Science
