**Job Description: Senior Engineer****– Machine Learning**

**What Is the Opportunity**


Do you want to help us build products \& platform that optimize our vessel utilization, reduce our carbon footprint and be part of the team in building the definitive Global Data \& Analytics (GDA) strategy. Maersk’s strategy is powered by data \& AI is the key enabler and our unique competitive advantage, your passion and leadership is critical for success in a role that has direct influence on our company’s transformation.


We are seeking an exceptional Lead Engineer for GDA reporting to Director – Data, AI \& Platform(GDA). You will be the organizational change leader and champion for insights, data, ML products developments that will form the foundation of the division’s digital evolution. You will evaluate and design cross\-functional enterprise business processes and build products and partner with leaders across the team to execute new workflows. You will also partner with business \& tech leaders to drive and execute effective change management strategies associated with business process and technology changes.

**Job Overview:**


As a Lead Engineer, you will play a vital role in designing, developing, and implementing both machine learning models, platform and software systems that solve complex challenge. You will collaborate closely with interdisciplinary teams, including data scientists, software engineers, product managers, and domain experts, to deliver innovative and scalable solutions.

