gd-1009698903092,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009698903092,,Sr. Data Scientist (Conversational),Humonics Global,Gurgaon,2025-04-05,,,,,False,"Job Description

We aim to bring about a new paradigm in medical image diagnostics; providing intelligent, holistic, ethical, explainable and patient centric care. We are looking for innovative problem solvers. We want people who can empathize with the consumer, understand business problems and design and deliver intelligent products. We develop scalable products in the call\-centre, healthcare, and enterprise AI space, leveraging cutting\-edge advancements in Deep Learning, NLP, LLMs, and Big Data. We’re looking for a dynamic and innovative Data Scientist with deep expertise in Deep Learning, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and Large Language Models (LLMs). You will play a crucial role in building smart, production\-ready AI models for use cases including call quality assurance, intent detection, entity extraction, speech \& text analytics, and recommendation systems.

Responsibilities

NLP, AI \& Deep Learning Development

* Build and fine\-tune deep learning models (ANN, CNN, RNN, LSTM, etc.) for supervised and unsupervised tasks.
* Develop and optimize NLP models for intent classification, entity recognition, sentiment analysis, and text summarization.
* Fine\-tune state\-of\-the\-art LLMs (e.g., BERT, GPT, RoBERTa) for specific use cases in
* healthcare and call center technologies.
* Engineer prompts for LLMs to optimize user interaction and automate call workflows.

Voice \& Text Intelligence

* Analyze voice data from healthcare call centers using speech\-to\-text, NLP, and deep

learning models to extract meaningful insights.

* Contribute to speech recognition, text mining, and dialogue system design using cutting edge tools.

System Design \& Production

* Work with cross\-functional teams to integrate AI/ML/NLP models into scalable systems and APIs.
* Collaborate on software architecture design to ensure model performance, reliability, and scalability in production.
* Research \& Innovation
* Conduct exploratory research in NLP, propose innovative solutions, and lead the
* prototyping of new ideas.
* Evaluate multiple NLP/LLM architectures for speed, cost\-efficiency, and accuracy.
