We are seeking an experienced Healthcare Data Analytics Trainer to lead training programs in healthcare data analytics, artificial intelligence (AI), and emerging healthcare technologies. The trainer will design and deliver industry\-relevant, hands\-on training tailored to the Indian healthcare sector, equipping students and professionals with the necessary skills to thrive in this growing field.

Key Responsibilities:

Develop and conduct interactive training sessions covering healthcare analytics, AI in healthcare, IoMT, big data, blockchain, cybersecurity, and predictive analytics.

Train students and working professionals on data\-driven decision\-making in hospitals, healthcare startups, and public health settings.

Provide hands\-on experience with tools like Python, R, SQL, Power BI, Tableau, and AI\-based healthcare platforms.

Incorporate case studies and real\-world applications from Indian healthcare (hospital networks, insurance, telemedicine, Ayushman Bharat).

Guide learners in capstone projects and industry\-oriented problem\-solving.

Stay updated with the latest healthcare data policies in India (NABH, Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission, NDHM).

Eligibility Criteria:

✅ Educational Qualifications:

Master’s in Healthcare Management, Data Science, Public Health, AI, Computer Science, or related fields.

✅ Experience:

