Work Location:

* Ahmedabad, Gujarat.

Job Summary:

We are looking for a skilled Data Science/AI/ML\-Engineer\-Visualizer to join our team at Optimized Solutions Limited. The ideal candidate will play a crucial role in data collection, warehousing, processing, analysis, and visualization to support data\-driven decision\-making. The role involves working on cutting\-edge data science and engineering solutions to derive actionable insights from large datasets and enhance business intelligence. The role further involves dealing with varied sources of data, examples include tabular data (SQL, NoSQL, JSON), image data and text data.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* **Machine Learning / Artificial Intelligence:**

o Computer Vision: Image processing, Morphological transformations. Familiarity with Object detection/classification/tracking. Knowledge of Optical character recognition, relevant tools include Tesseract, easyOCR.

o AI model development: Knowledge of deep learning frameworks such as TensorFlow and Pytorch.

o Tool Knowledge: Familiarity with popular open\-source AI frameworks such as OpenAI and Microsoft CoPilot.

**Software Deployment:**

o REST API: Host the AI/ML model through Django REST API.

o Cloud: Familiarity with tools such as AWS EC2, Lambda and S3\. Data security concepts such as IAM authentication.

o Version Tracking: Code and Data version tracking through GitHub/Gitlab.

o Code Development: Strictly follow the principle of Modularity, code\-readability and code\-transferability.

**Data Engineering (Good to have but not necessary):**

o Data Pipelines: Develop modular and efficient ETL (Extract Load and Transform Pipelines). Orchestrate the pipelines through tools such as Dagster/Airflow. Ability to handle both structured and unstructured data.

