gd-1009697631977,glassdoor,https://www.glassdoor.co.in/job-listing/j?jl=1009697631977,,S&C Global Network - AI - CDI - Data Science Manager,Accenture,Bengaluru,2025-04-04,,,,,False,"**Job Title \- Data Scientist and Analytics Level 7: Manager Ind \& Func AI Decision Science Manager – S\&C**

