* Working knowledge of scripting languages like R and Python and / or dashboarding platforms like Power BI for quick prototyping.
* Understanding of advanced analytics in statistics and machine learning
* Advanced knowledge of visual analytics algorithms like force directed graph and network diagrams.
* Proficiency with grammar of graphics and data story telling
* Internal or external consulting experience
* Agility and flexibility to work with very diverse problems and business partners
* Ability to work with diverse data sources and data types
* Self\-management skills with a focus on results for timely and accurate completion of competing deliverable

**Additional Information:**

* When applying please attach or submit a link to your portfolio of work
* You will be on a hybrid work schedule in Bengaluru, India.


