 **Solution Integration:**

  

* Deploy AI solutions within client environments, ensuring scalability and seamless integration with existing systems.
* Work with stakeholders to identify automation opportunities and tailor solutions to business needs.

 **AI Algorithm and Model Implementation:**

  

* Design and implement machine learning algorithms, focusing on natural language processing (NLP) and conversational AI.
