* Strong problem\-solving, analytical thinking, and troubleshooting skills.
* Ability to work independently and collaborate with teams.

**Preferred (Nice\-to\-Have) Skills**

* Experience in RPA (Robotic Process Automation) or AI\-based workflow development.
