Contract length: 3 months

Pay: ₹50,000\.00 \- ₹80,000\.00 per month

Benefits:

* Flexible schedule
* Work from home

Experience:

* Machine learning: 3 years (Required)
* AI: 3 years (Required)

Work Location: Remote

