We're developing an innovative Cricket Batting Analysis System that uses AI and computer vision to analyze batting techniques and provide feedback to players. Our technology stack includes Azure Machine Learning, YOLOv7\-pose, MoveNet, and a modern React/Node.js frontend.

**Position Overview**

We're seeking two talented interns to support our AI model development and data annotation efforts. These roles offer hands\-on experience with cutting\-edge computer vision technology in sports analytics.

