* Contribute to API development for inference requests
* Assist with performance benchmarking and testing
* Help integrate Azure Blob Storage with Azure ML pipelines

**Data Annotation Responsibilities:**

* Annotate cricket batting videos with precise keypoints and labels
* Mark cricket equipment (bat, ball, stumps) in video frames
* Annotate bat keypoints (3\-5 points) for path and angle analysis
* Classify cricket shots and mark shot phases
* Maintain consistent annotation quality across diverse cricket videos
* Document annotation patterns and edge cases

QualificationsRequired:

* Currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Data Science, or related field
* Basic understanding of machine learning concepts
* Strong attention to detail
* Ability to work independently and as part of a team
