Preferred:

* Experience with Azure services, particularly Azure ML
* Prior work with annotation tools
* Knowledge of cricket or sports analytics
* Programming experience in Python

What You'll Gain

* Hands\-on experience with cutting\-edge AI/ML technologies
* Practical knowledge of the complete ML lifecycle using Azure ML
* Skills in creating high\-quality training data for sports\-specific models
* Exposure to a real\-world AI product development environment
* Understanding of how computer vision is transforming sports analytics

Duration

2\-month internship with possibility of extension based on performance and project needs.

Location

\[Remote/On\-site as applicable]

How to Apply

Please submit your resume, a brief cover letter explaining your interest in sports technology, and any relevant examples of your work with ML, annotation, or Azure technologies.

