in-44448f132836ca61,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=44448f132836ca61,http://in.indeed.com/job/ai-trainer-44448f132836ca61,AI trainer,Ground Cyber,"UP, IN",2025-04-10,parttime,,,,False,"**Job Title:** AI Trainer

**Job Summary**

We are seeking an experienced and skilled AI Trainer to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and delivering high\-quality training programs for our AI models. The AI Trainer will work closely with our data science team to develop and implement AI solutions that meet business objectives.

**Key Responsibilities**

**Training Development**

1\. Design, develop, and deliver training programs for AI models, including data preparation, model selection, and hyperparameter tuning.

2\. Develop and maintain training datasets, including data cleaning, data augmentation, and data labeling.

3\. Collaborate with data scientists to develop and implement AI solutions that meet business objectives.

**Model Training**

1\. Train and evaluate AI models using various machine learning algorithms and deep learning techniques.

2\. Optimize model performance using techniques such as hyperparameter tuning, regularization, and ensemble methods.

3\. Collaborate with data scientists to integrate trained models into larger AI systems.

**Data Analysis**

1\. Analyze and interpret data to identify trends, patterns, and insights that inform AI model development.

2\. Develop and maintain data visualizations and reports to communicate insights to stakeholders.

3\. Collaborate with data scientists to develop and implement data\-driven solutions that meet business objectives.

**Collaboration**

1\. Collaborate with cross\-functional teams, including data science, engineering, and product management, to develop and implement AI solutions.

2\. Communicate complex technical concepts to non\-technical stakeholders, including business leaders and product managers.

3\. Provide technical guidance and support to junior AI trainers and data scientists.

**Requirements**

Education and Experience

1\. Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Mathematics, Statistics, or a related field.

2\. At least 2 years of experience in AI training, machine learning, or deep learning.

3\. Experience with AI frameworks, such as TensorFlow, PyTorch, or Keras.

**Technical Skills**

1\. Strong understanding of machine learning algorithms, deep learning techniques, and AI frameworks.

2\. Experience with data preprocessing, feature engineering, and data visualization.

3\. Strong programming skills in languages such as Python, R, or Julia.

**Soft Skills**

1\. Excellent communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.

2\. Ability to work in a fast\-paced environment and meet deadlines.

3\. Strong organizational, planning, and time management skills.

