in-4368831e4947743b,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=4368831e4947743b,http://in.indeed.com/job/senior-aiml-engineer-4368831e4947743b,Senior AI/ML Engineer,Ticket Wallet,"Remote, IN",2025-04-10,fulltime,,,,True,"**Senior AI/ML Engineer – Machine Learning Expert**

We are looking for the highest level AI/ML Engineer who can pioneer scalable machine learning systems, leveraging time series data to optimize our AI\-driven pricing and distribution platform. We are a YC\-backed startup, and you'll have the unique opportunity to be an early core hire, driving innovation in predictive analytics and dynamic decision\-making. This is not just another engineering role \- it's the chance to shape the future of an industry with your expertise and vision. We're looking for a hard\-working, fast\-moving, visionary. If selected, expect to work hard. Do not apply unless you are a stand out candidate. We will never ask you to do anything we don't do ourselves.

**What you'll do:**

* Design, build, and deploy robust machine learning models powering dynamic pricing, omni\-channel distribution, and forecasting based on time series data.
* Collaborate closely with product and engineering teams to integrate AI solutions seamlessly into our platform.
* Continuously improve existing ML models using performance metrics, real\-world outcomes, and advanced time series analytics.
* Take ownership of end\-to\-end AI/ML projects, from concept to production.
* Build pipelines to clean and manage big data efficiently.
* Engage in continuous learning and development, staying up\-to\-date with the latest advances in machine learning and software engineering.

**We’re looking for experts in:**

* Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Reinforcement Learning
* ETL / ELT Pipelines
* Databases and Data Warehouses
* MLOps \+ DevOps
* Python, TensorFlow, and PyTorch
* AWS (Sagemaker)
* SQL, PostgreSQL
* Big Data
* Git and CI/CD workflows

**Characteristics:**

* Proven ability to write high level machine learning code and also be a leader in a team.
* Proven experience deploying successful machine learning systems, especially with expertise in time series analysis, pricing optimization, recommendation systems, or predictive analytics. You're exceptional, and you have examples to prove it.
* Deep expertise in Python, TensorFlow/PyTorch, and data modeling, specifically with time series data.
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving abilities with a proactive approach to challenges.
* Mastery of building end to end ML solutions, with the ability to think for yourself and offer solutions.
* Able to deliver high\-quality ML solutions quickly in a fast\-paced startup environment. Move fast, think faster.
* Effective communicator (or quietly brilliant) \- you deliver exceptional results consistently.

**Requirements**

* 6\+ years of engineering experience, with at least 3\+ years in a dedicated machine learning role.
* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics, or closely related fields.
* Demonstrated excellence \+ expertise as a machine learning engineer and computer programmer.
* Extremely strong English.

**Preferred Qualifications** 

* 10\+ years of engineering experience, with at least 6\+ years in a dedicated machine learning role.
* Masters / PHD in Machine Learning, Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics, or closely related fields.

**Why Ticket Wallet?**

* This is a dynamic, high\-stakes environment that will really test \+ improve you.
* We reward those who contribute at a high level and work hard \- you will be paid exceptionally well for exceptional work.
* Be part of a YC\-funded startup with experienced founders.
* Build and scale a product from the ground up.

**Extra:**

If this sounds exactly like you, apply. We want to meet you. If you hesitated at any point reading this, you probably won't thrive here \- save us both the time.

