● Experience with CNNs, RNNs, LSTMs, transfer learning, dropout, and batch normalization. ● Knowledge of NLP workflows, tokenization, stop words handling, and text classification. ● Exposure to Computer Vision: image classification, object detection, filters/kernels, face recognition.

● Hands\-on experience or knowledge of tools such as MediaPipe, Langchain, RAG, Ollama, and Prompt Engineering.

