in-8ccbf003fb44b709,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=8ccbf003fb44b709,http://in.indeed.com/job/data-science-consultant-8ccbf003fb44b709,Data Science Consultant,MNR solutions pvt.ltd,"KA, IN",2025-04-10,fulltime,,,,False,"**Job Title:** Data Science Consultant  
**Location:** Bangalore, India  
**Experience Required:** 4\-5 Years  
**Notice Period:** Immediate Joiners Only

**About the Role:**  
We are seeking a talented and driven **Data Science Consultant** with **4\-5 years** of experience to join our team in **Bangalore**. As a **Data Science Consultant**, you will work closely with clients to understand their data challenges and leverage your expertise in data analysis, machine learning, and statistical modeling to deliver actionable insights and solutions. You will play a key role in transforming data into strategic business decisions, ensuring impactful outcomes for clients.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Collaborate with clients to understand business needs and translate them into data science problems.
* Perform exploratory data analysis (EDA) to uncover insights and trends from structured and unstructured data.
* Develop and implement **machine learning models** (supervised, unsupervised, reinforcement learning) for predictive and prescriptive analytics.
* Apply **statistical techniques**, such as hypothesis testing, regression analysis, and time series forecasting, to support data\-driven decision\-making.
* Utilize tools like **Python**, **R\*,** SQL**,** Spark**, or** Hadoop\* for data manipulation, analysis, and modeling.
* Create **data visualizations** and interactive dashboards using tools like **Tableau**, **Power BI**, or **Matplotlib** to communicate findings clearly.

**Key Skills \& Qualifications:**

* **4\-5 years** of experience in **data science**, with a strong foundation in **statistical modeling**, **machine learning**, and **data analytics**.
* Proficiency in **Python**, **R\*, and** SQL\* for data manipulation and model development.
* Experience with **machine learning libraries** such as **scikit\-learn**, **TensorFlow**, **PyTorch**, or **Keras**.
* Familiarity with **big data technologies** like **Spark**, **Hadoop**, or similar frameworks is a plus.
* Strong knowledge of **data visualization tools** like **Tableau**, **Power BI**, **Matplotlib**, or **Seaborn**.

