in-8c0569dfbc5dbb34,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=8c0569dfbc5dbb34,http://in.indeed.com/job/lead-developer-ai-powered-applications-8c0569dfbc5dbb34,Lead Developer – AI-Powered Applications,Aimplify Technologies,"KA, IN",2025-04-09,fulltime,,,,False,"**Role Overview**

We’re looking for a **Lead Developer** to spearhead backend development and architecture for AI\-first products. This high\-impact role involves building scalable backend services, integrating LLMs, and driving DevOps excellence. You’ll work closely with cross\-functional teams, own critical systems, and mentor a growing team of engineers.

**What You’ll Do**

**Backend Engineering \& AI Integration**

* Design and implement high\-performance backend services and APIs using **Python (FastAPI)**, **Java**, or **Node.js**.
* Build and optimize **Document Ingestion \& Embedding Pipelines**, **Vector Similarity Search**, and **RAG** workflows.
* Integrate AI models (OpenAI, Claude, Llama, Mistral, etc.) into production environments.
* Develop robust APIs for frontend interaction with RAG and LLM pipelines.

**Architecture \& Technical Leadership**

* Drive architecture decisions across services, ensuring scalability, maintainability, and performance.
* Lead POCs for next\-gen product features and guide business/technology decisions through feasibility studies.
* Enforce best practices in system design, coding standards, and documentation.
* Mentor junior developers and foster a strong technical culture.

**Cloud Infrastructure \& DevOps**

* Manage deployments with **Docker**, **Kubernetes**, and CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Maven).
* Scale cloud infrastructure on **AWS**, **Azure**, or **GCP**, focusing on reliability and cost\-effectiveness.
* Implement monitoring, observability, and proactive issue resolution in production systems.

**Performance, Security \& Collaboration**

* Optimize backend performance for large\-scale document workflows and concurrent processing.
* Ensure security, data protection, and regulatory compliance.
* Lead sprints, stand\-ups, and collaborate closely with Product, AI, and Design teams.

**What You Bring**

**Core Requirements**

* 5–8 years of hands\-on experience in backend development, with a strong focus on **Python** and **FastAPI**.
* Proficiency in at least **two** of: Python, Java, Node.js.
* Deep understanding of **concurrency**, **asynchronous patterns**, and **distributed systems**.
* Experience with **RAG architectures**, **vector databases**, and **semantic search**.
* Strong grasp of **data structures**, **OOP**, **design patterns**, and **RESTful APIs**.
* Cloud\-native mindset and containerization experience with **Docker/K8s**.
* Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science or related discipline.

**Nice to Have**

* Experience with **Redis**, **MongoDB**, and **microservices/event\-driven architectures**.
* Familiarity with **Generative AI user flows**, **prompt engineering**, and **semantic kernel search**.
* Exposure to **Linux/UNIX systems** and **frontend integration (Node.js/AngularJS)**.
* Background in **Data Science** or analytics.

**Why Join Aimplify?**

✔ High\-impact role in a rapidly growing AI startup  
✔ Opportunity to work on real\-world Generative AI and cloud\-native solutions  
✔ Learning\-driven culture with mentorship and career growth  
✔ Collaborative and open team environment

**Ready to build the future of AI with us?**  
Apply now and be part of our journey to reimagine what’s possible.

Job Type: Full\-time

Pay: Up to ₹3,096,320\.85 per year

Schedule:

* Day shift
* Monday to Friday

Work Location: In person

Expected Start Date: 01/05/2025",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Aimplify-Technologies,Data Science
in-f77f0fc8f445c644,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=f77f0fc8f445c644,https://www.hirewand.com/apply/job/detail?jid=1593388sid=56827cf47f551cc15507e4cb&src=jobpost&cpid=1593&uid=79979,Senior Data Scientist (Gen AI Developer),HireWand Technologies,IN,2025-04-09,fulltime,,,,False,"**Role**: Senior Data Scientist (Gen AI Developer)


**Experience**: 5 to 7\+ Years


**Location**: Hyderabad


**Employment Type**: Full\-Time


**Work Mode**: Hybrid (4 days in office, 1 day from home)

  

  

  

  

**Job Brief**

  

  

We are looking for a talented AI Engineer with hands\-on experience in Speech\-to\-Text and Text Generation technologies to tackle a Conversational AI challenge for our client. The goal is to transcribe customer conversations and apply Generative AI for actionable insights that improve engagement strategies and support decision\-making.

  

  

You will be working with cutting\-edge technologies like LLMs, NLP, and RAG pipelines to develop real\-time transcription, summarization, intent recognition, and recommendation systems.

  

  

  

**Key Responsibilities**

  

  

1\. Conversational AI \& Call Transcription


* Develop and fine\-tune Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) models.
* Fine\-tune language models for industry\-specific terminology.
* Implement speaker diarization to distinguish multiple voices in a conversation.
  

  

2\. NLP \& Generative AI Applications


* Build conversation summarization models.
* Implement Named Entity Recognition (NER).
* Apply LLMs for deep conversation analysis and smart recommendations.
* Design Retrieval\-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines using external knowledge sources.
  

  

3\. Sentiment Analysis \& Decision Support


* Create sentiment and intent classification systems.
* Develop predictive models for next\-best\-action suggestions based on historical call data and engagement.
  

  

4\. AI Deployment \& Scalability


* Deploy models on AWS, Azure, or GCP ensuring real\-time capabilities.
* Optimize inference with ONNX, TensorRT, or Triton.
* Establish MLOps pipelines for continual learning and performance optimization.
  

  

  

  

**Required Skills \& Qualifications**

  

  

Technical Skills


* Proven expertise in ASR, NLP, and Conversational AI systems.
* Experience with tools like Whisper, DeepSpeech, Kaldi, AWS Transcribe, Google STT.
* Proficient in Python, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Hugging Face.
* Familiar with RAG, LangChain, and LLM fine\-tuning.
* Hands\-on with vector databases (FAISS, Pinecone, Weaviate, ChromaDB).
* Experience in deploying AI solutions using Docker, Kubernetes, FastAPI, or Flask.
  

  

  

Soft Skills


* Strong business acumen with the ability to translate AI insights into impact.
* Fast\-paced problem\-solver and innovative thinker.
* Excellent collaboration and communication skills with cross\-functional teams.
  

  

  

Preferred Qualifications


* Experience in healthcare, pharma, or life sciences NLP projects.
* Knowledge of multimodal AI, prompt engineering, and knowledge graphs.
* Exposure to Reinforcement Learning (RLHF) techniques for conversational models.
  

  

  

  

**Why Join Us**


* Work on impactful real\-world projects in Conversational AI and Gen AI.
* Collaborate with innovative teams and industry experts.
* Opportunity to work with cutting\-edge tools and cloud platforms.
* Hybrid work environment fostering flexibility and balance.
* Be part of a forward\-thinking, AI\-first culture where your ideas matter.
  

  

  

**Application Instructions**

  

  

If you possess the qualifications and are driven to excel in your field, we warmly invite you to apply by sharing your updated resume at resumes@empglobal.ae or by applying directly through this platform.

  

  

Note: While we appreciate every application, only shortlisted candidates will be contacted. Your understanding is appreciated in this regard!",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Hirewand-Technologies,Data Science
