About Us:  

AceNet Consulting is a fast\-growing global business and technology consulting firm specializing in business strategy, digital transformation, technology consulting, product development, start\-up advisory and fund\-raising services to our global clients across banking \& financial services, healthcare, supply chain \& logistics, consumer retail, manufacturing, eGovernance and other industry sectors.  

We are looking for hungry, highly skilled and motivated individuals to join our dynamic team. If you’re passionate about technology and thrive in a fast\-paced environment, we want to hear from you.


Job Summary :  

We're seeking a Senior Data Scientist to join our agile, cross\-functional team as a key contributor. As a Senior Data Scientist, you will design, develop, and implement data\-driven solutions to drive business outcomes. You will work with your team and manager on advanced analytics and DS modelling projects from inception to production, collaborating with stakeholders to deliver high\-impact results.


Key Responsibilities:  

* Develop, test, and deploy predictive models using machine learning and statistical techniques.
* Collaborate with stakeholders to identify opportunities and design solutions.
* Explore and analyze large datasets to inform business decisions.
* Create repeatable, interpretable, and scalable models and statistical products.
* Engineer new features and test various modeling approaches to develop industry\-leading analytics products.
* Contribute to the development of our data science capabilities and best practices.
* Communicate complex technical concepts to non\-technical stakeholders, including data insights and recommendations.
* Stay up\-to\-date with industry trends and emerging technologies in data science, making recommendations for how to leverage these advancements to drive business growth.

Role Requirements and Qualifications:  

* Bachelor’s degree in Data Science, Computer Science, Engineering, or Statistics.
* 5\+ years of applied experience in data science or related field (flexible).
* Expertise in implementing ML and AI algorithms in Python and/or R.
* Fluency in SQL.
* Strong understanding of machine learning, data wrangling, and exploratory analysis.
* Ability to work collaboratively with stakeholders to deliver high\-impact results.
* Excellent communication and problem\-solving skills.
* Experience with Big Data technologies such as Snowflake and Spark.
* Experience with cloud\-based technologies such as Azure (must have).
* Familiarity with Agile development methodologies.
* Experience working in a cross\-functional team environment.
* Expertise with the following modeling methods: Design of Experiments, ANOVA, multivariate regression, discrete and continuous optimization, survival analysis, discrete event simulation.

Why Join Us:  

* Opportunities to work on transformative projects, cutting\-edge technology and innovative solutions with leading global firms across industry sectors.
* Continuous investment in employee growth and professional development with a strong focus on up \& re\-skilling.
* Competitive compensation \& benefits, ESOPs and international assignments.
* Supportive environment with healthy work\-life balance and a focus on employee well\-being.
* Open culture that values diverse perspectives, encourages transparent communication and rewards contributions.

How to Apply:  

If you are interested in joining our team and meet the qualifications listed above, please apply and submit your resume highlighting why you are the ideal candidate for this position.",,https://in.indeed.com/cmp/Acenet,Data Science
