* Experience with computer vision, natural language processing (NLP), or other specialized AI domains.
* Familiarity with server\-side programming and back\-end frameworks (e.g., Flask, Django, Express).
* Knowledge of version control systems (e.g., Git).
* Experience with deploying AI models into production environments.
