* Evaluates the effectiveness of various promotion and marketing programs leveraging secondary data sources, Reporting platforms / ETL Setups.
* Mentor the junior team on day to day as well as exceptional cases/ situations.
* Monitor progress of work and provide solution to issues and queries;
* Share best practices and serve as a change agent and facilitator for operational excellence.


