* Technical proficiency in SQL/Snowflake and Visualisation tools (eg. Tableau/PowerBI/Quicksight)
* Awareness/experience of version control processes such as Gitlab/Github/Bitbucket, and data orchestration software such as Apache Airflow
* Evidence of delivering insights from data (as opposed to purely working with data)
* Evidence of coaching, programme and stakeholder management
