\- Building easy visualization layer on top of the algorithms in order to empower end\-users to take decisions \- this could be on a visualization platform (Tableau / Python) or through a recommendation set through PPTs* Working with the line manager to ensure application / consumption and also think beyond the immediate ask and spot opportunities to address the bigger business questions (if any)

