Responsibilities

* Selecting features, building and optimizing classifiers and recommendation engines using deep learning techniques
* Use techniques from artificial intelligence/deep learning to solve supervised and unsupervised learning problems.
* Designing solutions for complex problems related to medical image analysis by using Deep Learning/Object Detection/Image Segmentation.
* Recommend and implement best practices around application of statistical modelling.
* Create, train, test and deploy various neural networks to solve complex problems.
* Develop and implement solutions to fit business problems which may include applying algorithms from a standard statistical tool, deep learning or custom algorithm development.

Skills and Qualifications

* Excellent understanding and hands\-on of Deep Learning techniques such as ANN, CNN, RNN, LSTM, Transformers, VAEs etc.
* Must have experience with Tensorflow or PyTorch framework in building, training, testing and deploying neural networks
* Knowledge of the common data science and deep learning libraries and toolkits such as Keras, Pandas, Scikit\-learn, Numpy, Scipy, OpenCV etc.
* Good, applied statistical skills, such as distributions, statistical testing, regression, etc.
* Knowledge of data, data augmentation, data curation and synthetic data generation.
* Experience in Computer Vision will be an advantage.
* Excellent verbal and written communication skills
* Excellent analytical and problem\-solving skills with good attitude and keen to adapt evolving technologies

