	+ Ability to write clear and concise technical documentation.
	+ Experience in taking data science models from development to production.
	+ Competence in conducting independent analysis, including data manipulation, hypothesis formulation, and statistical analysis of experiments.

### **Knowing the following would be a bonus:**

* + Preferred: Experience in machine learning engineering, operations research, cloud platforms (GCS, AWS, Azure), data processing frameworks (Flink, Airflow), and software engineering workflows (version control with Git, CI/CD).
