\- Design and execute machine learning and NLP projects.

\- Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to integrate data\-driven solutions into  
business processes.

\- Develop REST APIs using FastAPI and manage containerized applications with Docker.

\- Expertise in using Langchain to build and deploy LLM based applications.

\- Knowledge of different chunking strategies, RAG techniques, Embedding models.

\- Build and deploy applications using large language models (LLMs) like OpenAI

GPT\-4/Turbo/4, Anthropic, Falcon, LLama, etc.

