\- Experience with deep learning architectures, including LSTMs, Transformers, and  
related technologies.

\- Familiarity with cutting\-edge deep learning\-based NLP models like BERT, BART, and  
Sentence Transformers.

\- Hands\-on experience with LLM stack tools including Lang Chain and LLamaIndex.

**2\. Soft Skills:**

\- Proactive with strong communication (oral and written), presentation, and  
interpersonal skills.

\- Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills for designing and testing custom software  
solutions.

\- Ability to solve real\-world problems through innovative ideas and independent  
research.

\- Willingness to learn and adapt in a dynamic environment.

\- Proficient in translating academic ideas and theoretical algorithms into production  
systems.

**Preferred Qualifications:**

\- Experience with software prototyping and designing experimental software.

\- Proven track record of building and deploying applications using LLMs and NLP  
toolkits.

\- Ability to work independently and as part of a team in a remote work environment.

**Good to have\-**

\- Proficiency in deep learning frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch, JAX) and libraries like  
Deep Graph Library (DGL) and DGL\-KE.

**Benefits:**

\- Competitive salary package

\- Remote work environment

\- Opportunity to work on innovative projects with cutting\-edge technologies

\- Continuous learning and professional development opportunities

