 Are you a **tech enthusiast, problem solver, and AI innovator** ready to build the future of analytics? If yes, **Aryng** is the place for you!

### **Why Aryng?**


Aryng is a **Silicon Valley\-based AI Data Science** company on a mission to revolutionize analytics. We are scaling **Enola**—our AI\-powered analytics platform—from MVP to a **multi\-tenant SaaS solution** used by top\-tier U.S. clients. **This is your chance to work on cutting\-edge AI, cloud, and automation technologies in a fast\-paced, high\-impact environment!**

### **Who We’re Looking For**


We need a **Senior Software Engineer (4\+ years experience)** who can:  

✅ **Architect and optimize** backend services \& APIs for an AI\-driven platform  

✅ **Develop AI\-powered workflows** with intelligent agent orchestration  

✅ **Scale multi\-tenant cloud infrastructure** for high\-performance analytics  

✅ **Drive security \& compliance** in a multi\-tenant SaaS environment

### **Key Responsibilities**


**Backend \& API Development**  

 Build \& optimize APIs using **Node.js/Next.js** with scalable microservices.  

 Develop **RESTful APIs** ensuring security, rate\-limiting, and fault tolerance.


**AI \& Agent Orchestration**  

 Integrate **AI models, RAG pipelines, and LangChain\-based multi\-agent frameworks**.  

 Design **intelligent agent workflows** to automate analytics processes.


**Multi\-Tenant System Design**  

 Implement **Role\-Based Access Control (RBAC)** and secure **data isolation**.  

 Optimize **performance \& scalability** in a multi\-tenant architecture.

* ️ **Cloud Infrastructure \& Scalability**


 Design and maintain **AWS, Azure, GCP, Databricks, Snowflake** infrastructure.  

 Implement **CI/CD pipelines, autoscaling, and Kubernetes/Docker\-based orchestration**.
**Security \& Compliance**  

 Apply best practices (**OAuth, JWT, GDPR/CCPA compliance**).  

 Protect **data privacy \& security** in multi\-tenant SaaS environments.

**Requirements**

### **Required Skills (Must Have)**


✔️ 4\+ years of experience in **backend development** (Node.js, Python, Postgres, Redis)  

✔️ Strong expertise in **API development, microservices, and API security**  

✔️ Hands\-on experience with **AI/ML pipelines \& agent\-based workflows**  

✔️ Proven track record in **multi\-tenant SaaS platforms \& cloud scalability**  

✔️ Knowledge of **Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform \& cloud platforms**

### **Nice\-to\-Have Skills (Would Love To Have)**


✨ Experience with **RAG pipelines \& LangChain agent orchestration**  

✨ Familiarity with **OpenAI APIs \& multi\-agent architectures**  

✨ Exposure to **data engineering workflows \& ETL pipelines**

**Benefits**

### **Why Join Us?**


**Be a part of something BIG** – We are scaling fast, and you will be at the forefront of AI innovation.  

**100% Remote, Always** – Work from anywhere with **flexible hours** that suit your lifestyle. All you need is a good broadband internet connection and well supported laptop.  

**Learn from the Best** – Collaborate with top AI and data science experts.  

**Zero Hierarchy, Maximum Impact** – Your ideas matter, and you will own end\-to\-end problem\-solving.  

**A Culture You will Love** – Highly **collaborative, empowering, and built for innovation**.  

**Competitive Pay \+ 50%\+ Tax Benefits** – No deduction pay, just **more in your pocket**!  

* ️ **Work\-Life Balance, Guaranteed** – Thrive in an environment that values both productivity and well\-being.


**Executive Presence \& Leadership Exposure** – Work directly with decision\-makers and make an impact.**Join Aryng. Build the future. Own your success.**


