We are seeking a highly skilled Machine Learning Engineer with 5\+ years of experience to work on cutting\-edge projects in healthcare. As a member of our engineering team, you will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying machine learning models that address real\-world challenges in healthcare, such as predictive analytics, clinical decision support, medical image analysis, and patient outcome optimization.

**Key Responsibilities:**

* Design and develop machine learning algorithms and models tailored for healthcare applications.
* Work closely with data scientists, healthcare professionals, and product teams to understand business requirements and translate them into technical solutions.
