in-4a866815cc54dda1,indeed,https://in.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=4a866815cc54dda1,https://www.amazon.jobs/jobs/2943984/data-scientist-iss?cmpid=DA_INAD200785B,"Data Scientist, ISS",Amazon.com,"TS, IN",2025-03-26,fulltime,,,,False,"\- 2\+ years of data scientist experience
